c9748be1d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T18:42:37Z","email":"flavia.martini-ext@viavarejo.com.br","name":"flaviamachadomartini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T18:42:37Z","email":"flavia.martini-ext@viavarejo.com.br","name":"flaviamachadomartini"},"message":"feat(setup): add cross-platform setup agent and Claude /iniciar command\n\nscripts/setup.js — Node.js setup agent (no external deps):\n  - Checks Node.js >= 18, exits with clear message if not met\n  - Auto-installs pnpm globally via npm, falls back to npx pnpm\n  - Runs pnpm install across the workspace\n  - Spawns all 4 micro-frontend dev servers in parallel\n  - Waits for port 3000 to be ready (net.Socket polling)\n  - Opens http://localhost:3000 in the default browser\n\nsetup.sh / setup.ps1 — thin OS wrappers (one command to start)\n\n.claude/commands/iniciar.md — custom slash command for Claude Code users:\n  Typing /iniciar in Claude Code triggers the full setup flow\n\npackage.json — added ''setup'' script: node scripts/setup.js\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dade76870aa65d366262e6fbec1eb5daccfc7aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlaviaMMartini/greencart-haven/git/trees/0dade76870aa65d366262e6fbec1eb5daccfc7aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlaviaMMartini/greencart-haven/git/commits/8cab58c4396ad1d8f215d00f1c735ec9748be1d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/193943912?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/flaviamachadomartini","id":19