om/flaviamachadomartini","id":193943912,"login":"flaviamachadomartini","node_id":"U_kgDOC49ZaA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flaviamachadomartini","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlaviaMMartini/greencart-haven/commits/2061bd84f670c8bd7eeb267b211d379980daf244/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T00:14:13Z","email":"flavia.martini-ext@viavarejo.com.br","name":"flaviamachadomartini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T00:14:13Z","email":"flavia.martini-ext@viavarejo.com.br","name":"flaviamachadomartini"},"message":"feat: GreenCart Haven - Micro Frontend with Module Federation\n\nArchitecture:\n- Shell (host :3000) + Header (:3001), Footer (:3002), Cards (:3003) remotes\n- Webpack 5 Module Federation with shared singletons\n- Redux Toolkit: cart state shared across all remotes via MF\n- TanStack Query: infinite scroll + cart seeding from dummyjson API\n- Tailwind CSS configured with Figma design tokens\n\nFeatures:\n- Product listing with infinite scroll and category filter\n- Add to cart with Redux dispatch across MF boundary\n- Cart modal with slide-in animation and item management\n- Responsive layout (1->2->3->4 columns, mobile hamburger menu)\n- ErrorBoundary + Suspense per remote\n\nTests: 37 passing (Jest + React Testing Library)","tree":{"sha":"c721955a3bf3f8f383800b0a4b99ac8bd16a8ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlaviaMMartini/greencart-haven/git/trees/c721955a3bf3f8f383800b0a4b99ac8bd16a8ec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FlaviaMMartini