obertoCCC","id":124599953,"login":"RobertoCCC","node_id":"U_kgDOB20-kQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commit/a3db83c6e231ea31c6e9a2e811d9c026fb2778a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSpokvdoAKGEzZGI4M2M2ZTIzMWVhMzFjNmU5YTJlODExZDljMDI2ZmIyNzc4YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commit/b3de15fdf15970c1601b21d91ae1019c23fc8e12","sha":"b3de15fdf15970c1601b21d91ae1019c23fc8e12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commits/b3de15fdf15970c1601b21d91ae1019c23fc8e12"}],"sha":"a3db83c6e231ea31c6e9a2e811d9c026fb2778a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commits/a3db83c6e231ea31c6e9a2e811d9c026fb2778a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124599953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobertoCCC","id":124599953,"login":"RobertoCCC","node_id":"U_kgDOB20-kQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commits/b3de15fdf15970c1601b21d91ae1019c23fc8e12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T18:51:17Z","email":"robertoctf2000@hotmail.com","name":"R0bertoC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T18:51:17Z","email":"robertoctf2000@hotmail.com","name":"R0bertoC"},"message":"feat: foundation for loja-pt e-commerce (storefront + admin)\n\nSecond portfolio demo. A small e-commerce shop for Portuguese artisan and\ntraditional products, with both a public storefront and an admin panel\nsharing the same Next.js app via route groups.\n\nStorefront (public, no auth):\n- Homepage with hero, 8 category cards, 8 latest products\n- /produtos grid with category-chip filter + name/description search\n- /produtos/[slug] detail with image, stock, quantity selector,\n  add-to-cart, and related products from the same category\n- /carrinho client-side cart (React Context + localStorage, hydration-safe)\n  with subtotal, shipping (free over 50 EUR), 23% IVA\n- /checkout guest form with PT validations (NIF 9 digits, postal 1100-100)\n  and server-side total recalculation (never trusts client prices)\n- /encomendas/[id] order confirmation\n\nAdmin (protected by proxy.ts on /admin/* + /login):\n- Dashboard with KPIs (orders today, pending, monthly revenue, active\n  products) and recent orders list\n- Produtos CRUD with image thumbnails, category filter, search, Switch\n  for active state, delete with AlertDialog confirmation\n- Categorias CRUD with FK-aware delete\n- Encomendas list with status filter + detail page with status workflow\n  (pending -> confirmed -> shipped -> delivered, or cancel)\n- Clientes view aggregated from orders by email (guest checkout, no\n  Customer table)\n\nSchema: User (admin), Category, Product (slug, stock, active), Order\n(inline customer + shipping), OrderLine (snapshots product name + price).\n\nStack: Next.js 16, React 19, Prisma 7 with Neon driver adapter, Auth.js\nv5 Credentials, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui (Base UI render API), Zod 4,\n@faker-js/faker pt_PT for the seed.\n\nSeed: 1 admin, 8 categories, 33 products, 14 orders across all statuses.","tree":{"sha":"f343b3fe2dea3937fd1329071b86b51dd7f7d70f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/git/trees/f343b3fe2dea3937fd1329071b86b51dd7f7d70f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/git/commits/b3de15fdf15970c1601b21d91ae1019c23fc8e12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124599953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RobertoCCC","id":124599953,"login":"RobertoCCC","node_id":"U_kgDOB20-kQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RobertoCCC","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commit/b3de15fdf15970c1601b21d91ae1019c23fc8e12","node_id":"C_kwDOSpokvdoAKGIzZGUxNWZkZjE1OTcwYzE2MDFiMjFkOTFhZTEwMTljMjNmYzhlMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RobertoCCC/loja-pt/commit/652f7c76922ac471cc1c91645f5cb8807136aab5","sha":"652f7c76922ac471cc1c91645f5cb8807136aab5","url":"https://api.github.com/re