TBjZWI1ODgwZjQwMzgzODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/d213f6993b2438de06a6deabb965cb41b063ed18","sha":"d213f6993b2438de06a6deabb965cb41b063ed18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/d213f6993b2438de06a6deabb965cb41b063ed18"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3","sha":"25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3"}],"sha":"95197eff27a7b5b54f20de850ceb5880f4038388","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/95197eff27a7b5b54f20de850ceb5880f4038388"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T09:21:18Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T09:21:18Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"message":"fix(avatar): guard streamStart against insecure-context audioWorklet\n\nTalkingHead''s streamStart() reaches for audioCtx.audioWorklet.addModule,\nbut audioWorklet is only exposed on AudioContext in secure contexts\n(HTTPS, localhost, 127.0.0.1). Over plain HTTP on a LAN or public\nhostname it''s undefined and the user gets a TypeError loop in the\nconsole with no actionable feedback.\n\n- Detect window.isSecureContext === false at mount and preset the call\n  error banner with a clear i18n message (EN + AM)\n- Disable the Start Conversation button in that state, with a tooltip\n- Throw a sentinel AUDIO_WORKLET_UNAVAILABLE from ensureStream before\n  TalkingHead can crash, so the caller''s catch routes to the same\n  explanatory message instead of \"Audio init failed\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bcbd66719cdd432866d9e818e9195d264305346","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/9bcbd66719cdd432866d9e818e9195d264305346"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 9bcbd66719cdd432866d9e818e9195d264305346\nparent b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f\nauthor Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779960078 +0300\ncommitter Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779960078 +0300\n\nfix(avatar): guard streamStart against insecure-context audioWorklet\n\nTalkingHead''s streamStart() reaches for audioCtx.audioWorklet.addModule,\nbut audioWorklet is only exposed on AudioContext in secure contexts\n(HTTPS, localhost, 127.0.0.1). Over plain HTTP on a LAN or public\nhostname it''s undefined and the user gets a TypeError loop in the\nconsole with no actionable feedback.\n\n- Detect window.isSecureContext === false at mount and preset the call\n  error banner with a clear i18n message (EN + AM)\n- Disable the Start Conversation button in that state, with a tooltip\n- Throw a sentinel AUDIO_WORKLET_UNAVAILABLE from ensureStream before\n  TalkingHead can crash, so the caller''s catch routes to the same\n  explanatory message instead of \"Audio init failed\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEDPe5yYZGguAsxiYYg/KtgMiji5kFAmoYCQ4bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEIPyrYDIo4uZ7HwL/3FVR8DLYigiZUQtPtQG\nouLi3M2L4F8I6oJXuKyrOPMRGNB2ds8aMeVaUSuHWtWMqB7xBYWjJEAlmSxrpzCF\nTKfa0x/RyyOU8dQ75uAkXXSJM4r3MraXIyKnOf5+N1gpYUW5V3Cu2rYv/G99PJaC\nMTcULUivXsAGHXLfsRSZj6JyD2x59OpKoqZqExro3DFfumRT7rPO25h8fXb114hh\nfBiKRTlfR9dKDQPVstI286Bj8tZkyhbq5Ua8mxmWwPmealJZ3J+R1I9ksU/D/czP\nZd+bCLI9FvriIdPIAoZipFR5M48hGMmJ/ua0/brQAbBagngyWyyCrkBlk/6Ta3OH\nBKN9MY45pGxl26P3LS1Jso3plMoFifQY27Blcen3GEFmaMictpLUyb65Fd8rJHls\nVpkkguyGz3HYCGq6SzyUlmgA2b5rL7j3bItlv9RHih9tchvAanP9zBXmBtlQ3MlL\nA9Mqod5CDtWCY162sCbNfDcsXwAgI+f/r4dcu9oNP+yTqA==\n=NwiK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDI1YTBhZmUzZWE3ZTk0MjYwOTBlMGMyMjY0MjY2MmMzYWQ2MGUyYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f","sha":"b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f"}],"sha":"25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/25a0afe3ea7e9426090e0c22642662c3ad60e2c3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T09:21:06Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T09:21:06Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"message":"perf(avatar): make picker load instantly\n\n- Static-thumb fast path in AvatarThumbnail: probe /avatars/{slug}.webp\n  next to each .glb and render it as a plain <img>, skipping the\n  three.js snapshot entirely when present\n- Bump render concurrency from 1 to 2 so cold first-load doesn''t drag\n  through five sequential WebGL captures\n- compress: true + Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable\n  on /avatars/* so repeat visits skip the 11–13 MB .glb download\n- Prefetch the first persona''s .glb on picker mount and on hover/focus,\n  so click-to-viewer has the bytes in cache already\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e93e863dc6d4a698d79d050707ae8227bac4ca30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/e93e863dc6d4a698d79d050707ae8227bac4ca30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f","verification":{"payload":"tree e93e863dc6d4a698d79d050707ae8227bac4ca30\nparent d213f6993b2438de06a6deabb965cb41b063ed18\nauthor Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779960066 +0300\ncommitter Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779960066 +0300\n\nperf(avatar): make picker load instantly\n\n- Static-thumb fast path in AvatarThumbnail: probe /avatars/{slug}.webp\n  next to each .glb and render it as a plain <img>, skipping the\n  three.js snapshot entirely when present\n- Bump render concurrency from 1 to 2 so cold first-load doesn''t drag\n  through five sequential WebGL captures\n- compress: true + Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable\n  on /avatars/* so repeat visits skip the 11–13 MB .glb download\n- Prefetch the first persona''s .glb on picker mount and on hover/focus,\n  so click-to-viewer has the bytes in cache already\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEDPe5yYZGguAsxiYYg/KtgMiji5kFAmoYCQIbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEIPyrYDIo4uZO7UMAJL+Pjiws9gT73ZECw04\n939TdW2pM75Zbsy0I9CON0e1EnK6nfcVeaJxoI3a5EAz6thPfe/Y25ANlTOrkAe5\nut/Mr7vgoaTClLtle10dc7Iyx+Wt5/KkZ+7YGkYRAsWmyZpu/gImFuLeBizvzWos\nTCg2FcQrOjlgKHjs3z37l7jZZhbveO7VU/Sx4Awa4ZnoMR7twOmNI7QHe0G7+1cb\nm6agZR5j1dtAYlHzC5mao1AbOK/UMje0FWrMXL7pB5825DnsPvohx8OCq+aPwQYz\nC1ttKY19f7Z2UaAkZh/8+pDL+4gIrvDvfcBtBuf9lKMetXDh49hpz2n+0SayNnHE\nr09gV88GYeZNFHddIiNL2Ce1tRoamEDtVC8MKG7ACtFUHiuq6xK5uMB6MRTnvw7n\nFXOcI/hPSKZUxs9DDmSaSboE0ogO9+sWtaL3FxvMmnH2QuDp7wBGMznZjo1AmR4Q\nnNlFTygGWcyna1s9GJP8JCaPd+xwxHc1/wt0SLuJfmLcBA==\n=eEHG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/b2999d030fdf28e45e89ffa9b92c5de10704bd2f","node_i