ng\nunder nohup (no SSH session) — the reloader is fragile and unnecessary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36e646bdaddfd9efc7d2eed901fa26d939a64ae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/36e646bdaddfd9efc7d2eed901fa26d939a64ae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/02d2b9fd9a212a77e6bb38a431a8920936385f8a","verification":{"payload":"tree 36e646bdaddfd9efc7d2eed901fa26d939a64ae5\nparent 57dc29d31dbf77b68598316cc272ff7eccc41ed6\nauthor Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779948727 +0300\ncommitter Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779948727 +0300\n\nfix(run-gpu-stack): pass --no-reload through to ai-service\n\nThe outer GPU stack script rejected --no-reload as \"unknown arg\" because\nit only existed on the inner run-ai-service-native.sh. Useful when running\nunder nohup (no SSH session) — the reloader is fragile and unnecessary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEDPe5yYZGguAsxiYYg/KtgMiji5kFAmoX3LcbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEIPyrYDIo4uZ3+AMAINpiVsVAP1mbk/XLO3+\n65ayjBenlol7nFhbX8WrBcSr4lY9fcx7TYYrIZUV4CpknF9INEpKoBZGN5Ip3nE4\n9+wH8TDXeQlzkOcVcHp4dG1vJh4elIyl13k8HxqV3LvU/9pw39rqgnnTt6eF6VdI\nKMpNKkemN9tucRvfxegcgTaoTFRyl/uRywCxiGDsL8b9blYHPKbZyOpT3e3D47Jt\nAzMSMR7ACkv40T+6IuTDB/3UolCd2yD8ZDeGRhJZxcQlo5pWB8zx0ZfPrjGxVZpm\nBgGxycIGX5F5qMlz7jAhy7Pcmd+yqC55pn4DXHS/e7AF4ttCWDZul4r1Whiz68/b\nW3lDBNDENA9VcrkojN1yZZ8ErHzyV6P5MvJxY0NTS/3wE3xvdPNikb3ShcMNPJVj\n27YitTiOFio8v7nKGpymZLitNZ/ALhXdtnVUFvX4BU4OIBkqd2g9hVm39tZdkZRF\nUNIoL95hoRqk4xl8pT5NgJ2coF3j/b7jZRFLgAfS7WbQ4w==\n=xJED\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/02d2b9fd9a212a77e6bb38a431a8920936385f8a","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDAyZDJ