low","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/08661ffc7d0d2bad5feeb2232ecb521a51f1c9fb","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDA4NjYxZmZjN2QwZDJiYWQ1ZmVlYjIyMzJlY2I1MjFhNTFmMWM5ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/2d63240bdac72a861cdc62629e9851e8ea5aea24","sha":"2d63240bdac72a861cdc62629e9851e8ea5aea24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/2d63240bdac72a861cdc62629e9851e8ea5aea24"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/57dc29d31dbf77b68598316cc272ff7eccc41ed6","sha":"57dc29d31dbf77b68598316cc272ff7eccc41ed6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/57dc29d31dbf77b68598316cc272ff7eccc41ed6"}],"sha":"08661ffc7d0d2bad5feeb2232ecb521a51f1c9fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/08661ffc7d0d2bad5feeb2232ecb521a51f1c9fb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/57dc29d31dbf77b68598316cc272ff7eccc41ed6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T04:47:58Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T04:47:58Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"message":"fix(mood_detector): disable thinking on gemini-2.5-flash\n\nThe model is a thinking model — with the previous max_output_tokens=20 the\nentire budget was consumed by internal reasoning, so resp.text returned\nempty and the parser fell through to null on every call.\n\n- thinking_config=ThinkingConfig(thinking_budget=0) disables the internal\n  reasoning step (this is a cheap classifier, no thinking needed).\n- max_output_tokens 20 → 64 gives headroom if the model wraps the JSON.\n- Log the raw response when parsing fails so future regressions are\n  diagnosable from server logs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6529311bc4fe04da2359fa72e7178e0624085fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/d6529311bc4fe04da2359fa72e7178e0624085fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/57dc29d31dbf77b68598316cc272ff7eccc41ed6","verification":{"payload":"tree d6529311bc4fe04da2359fa72e7178e0624085fd\nparent 8c666f4bed21af069271c865dc1ed58b05031a96\nauthor Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779943678 +0300\ncommitter Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779943678 +0300\n\nfix(mood_detector): disable thinking on gemini-2.5-flash\n\nThe model is a thinking model — with the previous max_output_tokens=20 the\nentire budget was consumed by internal reasoning, so resp.text returned\nempty and the parser fell through to null on every call.\n\n- thinking_config=ThinkingConfig(thinking_budget=0) disables the internal\n  reasoning step (this is a cheap classifier, no thinking needed).\n- max_output_tokens 20 → 64 gives headroom if the model wraps the JSON.\n- Log the raw response when parsing fails so future regressions are\n  diagnosable from server logs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEDPe5yYZGguAsxiYYg/KtgMiji5kFAmoXyP4bFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEIPyrYDIo4uZ4x4MAKg5kzIobBdjNs8kcp5C\nel2dqqxiK0aAfT+vnzaoQ3GaMhUUDtaQbJQGYugWiJzfWNyM1po64c5LPX/PWGTd\nmJ9WGX7pl46235hBgqBdxBjngGZ/iIpaMep/gFUTvUqh5hSbU8NU0CDlnj0EM79f\nd2Ajq6ReJNbs30PsIZnCnnd5K717i1Wg