i.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/8c666f4bed21af069271c865dc1ed58b05031a96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T22:51:19Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T22:51:19Z","email":"amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Amanuel Wondim"},"message":"fix(run-gpu-stack): export MODEL_NAME and auto-install zstd/curl on Linux\n\n- export MODEL_NAME so --model / .env MODEL_NAME actually reaches the\n  ai-service subprocess (was being reassigned without export, so the\n  FastAPI process kept inheriting the config.py default).\n- ensure_linux_prereqs(): on a fresh RunPod container the apt cache is\n  empty, so the ollama installer''s `apt-get install zstd` would fail with\n  \"Unable to locate package\". Run apt-get update + install curl/zstd\n  before invoking the ollama installer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f030c97597c027a3569d2ed374597112f2dbc69c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/f030c97597c027a3569d2ed374597112f2dbc69c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/8c666f4bed21af069271c865dc1ed58b05031a96","verification":{"payload":"tree f030c97597c027a3569d2ed374597112f2dbc69c\nparent bb392a497624fd47b3bf60350282e81d1a756c42\nauthor Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779922279 +0300\ncommitter Amanuel Wondim <amanuel@Amanuels-MacBook-Air.local> 1779922279 +0300\n\nfix(run-gpu-stack): export MODEL_NAME and auto-install zstd/curl on Linux\n\n- export MODEL_NAME so --model / .env MODEL_NAME actually reaches the\n  ai-service subprocess (was being reassigned without export, so the\n  FastAPI process kept inheriting the config.py default).\n- ensure_linux_prereqs(): on a fresh RunPod container the apt cache is\n  empty, so the ollama installer''s `apt-get install zstd` would fail with\n  \"Unable to locate package\". Run apt-get update + install curl/zstd\n  before invoking the ollama installer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"no_user","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQHPBAABCAA5FiEEDPe5yYZGguAsxiYYg/KtgMiji5kFAmoXdWcbFIAAAAAABAAO\nbWFudTIsMi41KzEuMTIsMCwzAAoJEIPyrYDIo4uZGtgMAK8dfDMW0inLLuli7R5X\nxVEoH/i+sM+x8AmX/mtrxeQOcLeAv33r6Lkj79DIgAB1Bj/q+Ws5Rrd1Br44sI4f\ny9floFZdwuqc5gyqDxLAMsnYTHo6W6gEOtq1TTfXyS+8N5wsqp50duG+xbaoDnRR\nIqAjo5jgHSo62vcYLMtakrPKLfZ/Tl7ZvctQ7egpp/g3j4TJz3a+NJwdJPGsf07c\n/n3+T4RzpcCTmrT4JeeVPjExttF7Fzn3XfIymtVzgLV69/szbP2A0v6iGzr2mrKX\nX0olIuIeBdFQeWV2Eyi4TK3Q28nnkHWLzsN00l58VaJvMwAlO3YGnnKmWxrKoT1D\nlZevIYeRIgOvsbw3mhJdhgxkM2PLKIM8WO/L0IxUp9ku/uncfc1YVt+nwWizoftt\n2Ueow9GsqO3O9nlj191UNyxCN/ttI/mEBk7zsRhY4L9FjW0wx69sdSWpqbhJmNRb\nu9NFDuUi1rP1SIaIxrRQoL6IyG1u4GweE2nE+APMl8SzNA==\n=Sb5Z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/8c666f4bed21af069271c865dc1ed58b05031a96","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDhjNjY2ZjRiZWQyMWFmMDY5MjcxYzg2NWRjMWVkNThiMDUwMzFhOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/bb392a497624fd47b3bf60350282e81d1a756c42","sha":"bb392a497624fd47b3bf60350282e81d1a756c42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/bb392a497624fd47b3bf60350282e81d1a756c42"}],"sha":"8c666f4bed21af069271c865dc1ed58b05031a96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/8c666f4bed21af069271c865dc1ed58b05031a96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130090452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amantsehay/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amantsehay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amantsehay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amantsehay/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay","id":130090452,"login"