}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/dd2527661cb44a0ec68e4424bc32ee4d85034b77","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKGRkMjUyNzY2MWNiNDRhMGVjNjhlNDQyNGJjMzJlZTRkODUwMzRiNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/0d155f8c338b8eb03ff0803064ccb64f2df26dc4","sha":"0d155f8c338b8eb03ff0803064ccb64f2df26dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/0d155f8c338b8eb03ff0803064ccb64f2df26dc4"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/3cfad6d2015039d9ea27325061166b72b1b6dfe6","sha":"3cfad6d2015039d9ea27325061166b72b1b6dfe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/3cfad6d2015039d9ea27325061166b72b1b6dfe6"}],"sha":"dd2527661cb44a0ec68e4424bc32ee4d85034b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/dd2527661cb44a0ec68e4424bc32ee4d85034b77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119097475?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Teklez","id":119097475,"login":"Teklez","node_id":"U_kgDOBxlIgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/3cfad6d2015039d9ea27325061166b72b1b6dfe6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T19:29:21Z","email":"zemenumekiria@gmail.com","name":"zemenumekiria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T19:29:21Z","email":"zemenumekiria@gmail.com","name":"zemenumekiria"},"message":"fix: avatar streaming, admin UX, assessment locale, faster nav, slower-model handling\n\nAvatar voice:\n- Add locale plumbing through voice conversation create + WS handshake\n- 3-chunk (~300ms) jitter buffer in AvatarViewer to absorb network jitter\n- MiniHead resamples preview PCM to audioCtx.sampleRate (was silently playing at the wrong rate)\n- Remove locale directive from voice persona prompt; let Gemini Live auto-detect\n\nAssessments:\n- Drop unique constraint on assessments.name (was blocking re-saves on duplicate name)\n- Include assessment_id in history items so frontend can match by id; was matching by assessment_type, which made every admin-created \"other\" assessment share the same lastResult/Retake button\n- Default scoring-tier colors when admin AI generator omits them\n- Fall back gracefully when bucket.color is None (bucket.get(\"color\") or default — .get default doesn''t fire on explicit None)\n- Auto-translate name / description / questions / option labels / range labels + feedback to Amharic during admin create\n\nAdmin panel:\n- Custom Confirm modal + Toast stack replacing native confirm()/alert() across Badges, Resources, Groups, Assessments, GroupDrawer, UserDrawer\n\nFrontend perf:\n- Global (main)/loading.tsx so every navigation paints a fallback on the first frame\n- Route-specific skeletons for /chat and /groups/[id]\n\nAI service:\n- Bump Ollama call timeout 60s -> 240s (3B model on CPU exceeds 60s once context grows)\n- Log exception details instead of silently returning the fallback message","tree":{"sha":"8c2c673a2bca59d46c32fa97076201d2a68674db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/8c2c673a2bca59d46c32fa97076201d2a68674db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/3cfad6d2015039d9ea27325061166b72b1b6dfe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119097475?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Teklez","id":119097475,"login":"Teklez","node_id":"U_kgDOBxlIgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/3cfad6d2015039d9ea27325061166b72b1b6dfe6","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDNjZmFkNmQyMDE1MDM5ZDllYTI3MzI1MDYxMTY2YjcyYjFiNmRmZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/0d155f8c338b8eb03ff0803064ccb64f2df26dc4","sha":"0d155f8c338b8eb03ff0803064ccb64f2df26dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/0d155f8c338b8eb03ff08