 chat\nmetadata (counts only — no message content). Output is a structured narrative\ncovering mood trends, assessment progress, engagement, and observations.\n\n- ai-service: /summarize-export endpoint + ExportSummarizerService\n- backend: export_ai_summary_pdf() + GET /api/v1/export/ai-summary\n- frontend: AI Summary button with distinct styling on the Export Everything card","tree":{"sha":"4fbe2a26a29f00214c63c39e4d5d3cc1ab2c352d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/4fbe2a26a29f00214c63c39e4d5d3cc1ab2c352d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/0ea1aa0657718b70eae1dba60d602f8cd4d3686d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/0ea1aa0657718b70eae1dba60d602f8cd4d3686d","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDBlYTFhYTA2NTc3MThiNzBlYWUxZGJhNjBkNjAyZjhjZDRkMzY4NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/5764b0710b9773bbcd0a61497e70bd10b3e089bc","sha":"5764b0710b9773bbcd0a61497e70bd10b3e089bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/5764b0710b9773bbcd0a61497e70bd10b3e089bc"}],"sha":"0ea1aa0657718b70eae1dba60d602f8cd4d3686d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/0ea1aa0657718b70eae1dba60d602f8cd4d3686d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/5764b0710b9773bbcd0a61497e70bd10b3e089bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T03:40:03Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T03:40:03Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"message":"feat: add how-we-score page with GAD-7, PHQ-9, PSS scoring breakdowns\n\nShows score ranges, methodology, and disclaimers for all three instruments.\nUpdates the ''How we score'' link to point to the new page.","tree