 login, register, dashboard) that verify the scaffold works.\n\n- `fixtures/` — `base` (api client) + `authenticated` (auto-registers a user per test and seeds the JWT via `addInitScript`)\n- `helpers/` — env, ApiClient (register/login/me), user factory, auth-storage seeder\n- `pages/` — Page Objects, one per route, all extend `BasePage`\n- `tests/` — specs grouped by feature\n- `playwright.config.ts` — Chromium + Firefox projects, traces + screenshots on failure, retries 1 local / 2 CI\n\nCloses #34","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFZ5sCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAozAQAEG2X4UuBVqSa+tWLdV8tw7Z\nXXbRk32xTYmuYjz7RJKVeMaZ+VmNeTCRWeF7tuoEBYddDkeUUe+VGwZC0yuRMp/w\nsbD+PBfurc/3iN2cfIfQgWeUOd9NoJDWbiFGSaQmbzsxk0BMhHsuDaOGRpN7L/3B\nYJBTmuBnxzAZ97sXAiSg0vKMohfPcPFfFEiB0MSllwXqDs4+0xGhYLZ5/ViImzuf\n90rzjDciMYCo7/c5iBKWdPec9sZwl2Ga2LfjbSsswbwoOO5NxTMQlNN9CM2TaTHw\n2TUoivz6XyQMJJw8IfSKU59gbHeeL8A4Nyx58ULoKFk4p8CMR8/1ioLGNFySa/St\nZ01uJVHzptVV/x9L16tWXNAVtTFnn9maymZX+8loOEhlA94xJIbDYKZ6sl4MVmrp\n45MS8lV1ASQtdbvDUe+xPLWKHDgb8qhzFVckuuSkrHP09/eKoiA3N1HrE/Asffkj\nKSH3Qdi0+E6lpoYVZRLbOLWZafriV3A97mQ2zEzBrGqD8QXKGscijbbl4WWB8JTn\n6r8XxFbz7rf/MPP/yLCsq6lSDe1XeJxBMoIZJmIz1/ZonQEVCvAPyctTnpVDWDbx\ncms9kbnaGwamPlVbdbvMZfJ3Iu5NnBq9s8iVPcKnJJ7GjVVuwXwI9wR8M299YSlN\n8hnUjaQRhHX1u7ZI/Qew\n=rI3S\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-26T13:21:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g