d8af86103912e0c41136d33949ce6d3d1a56c62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:20:08Z","email":"133119849+yonatannnn@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Yonatan Alebachew"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T13:20:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: unblock frontend build and bake Gemini key for avatar preview\n\n- Drop unused `_id` destructure in settings/export — tripped no-unused-vars and blocked `next build`.\n- Recast `requestIdleCallback` through `unknown` in AvatarScene so the existence guard stays well-typed.\n- Plumb `NEXT_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY` from `.env` through compose build-args into the frontend Dockerfile so the avatar preview''s client-side Gemini TTS call has a key baked into the bundle.\n\nCloses #33","tree":{"sha":"0fe23776bc3bd2cc5598aa391d720cb55fe396ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/0fe23776bc3bd2cc5598aa391d720cb55fe396ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/cd8af86103912e0c41136d33949ce6d3d1a56c62","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fe23776bc3bd2cc5598aa391d720cb55fe396ad\nparent 971c283f16b243e5560b345911a9ab1b5650099d\nauthor Yonatan Alebachew <133119849+yonatannnn@users.noreply.github.com> 1779801608 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779801608 +0300\n\nfix: unblock frontend build and bake Gemini key for avatar preview\n\n- Drop unused `_id` destructure in settings/export — tripped no-unused-vars and blocked `next build`.\n- Recast `requestIdleCallback` through `unknown` in AvatarScene so the existence guard stays well-typed.\n- Plumb `NEXT_PUBLIC_GEMINI_API_KEY` from `.env` through compose build-args into the frontend Dockerfile so the avatar preview''s client-side Gemini TTS call has a key baked into the bundle.\n\nCloses #33","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFZ4ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/AMQAEMHEL9+FzUI9jElTgPmD4eO\nmsjeCiaA8obifL24iJxhId51mNcO8NOkkeJPCDGXJCTSZH93eBA