low/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/69022bb5b9d27851ae4350179360f228e7448356","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDY5MDIyYmI1YjlkMjc4NTFhZTQzNTAxNzkzNjBmMjI4ZTc0NDgzNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a","sha":"f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8","sha":"5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8"}],"sha":"69022bb5b9d27851ae4350179360f228e7448356","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/69022bb5b9d27851ae4350179360f228e7448356"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T12:51:13Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T12:51:13Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"message":"fix(chat): redesign crisis banner and wire the stop button\n\nThe crisis banner used a brittle grid with uppercase-mono pills that\ncrowded each other and clipped the title on narrow widths. Switch to a\nsingle flex row that wraps cleanly — icon + headline cluster grows,\nresource buttons sit between, dismiss anchors right via ml-auto. The\nwarm red palette is preserved; resources are now two-line action cells\n(name + contact) with proper Phone / MessageSquare / ExternalLink\nicons per resource type, mirroring the assessment CrisisInterstitial.\n\nThe chat stop button was inert. ChatInput had onStop wired internally,\nbut ChatContainer never passed the prop AND the websocket loop awaited\nprocess_message_stream inline, so even if we sent {type:''stop''} it\nwouldn''t be read until the whole stream finished.\n\nBackend: each message now spawns an asyncio.Task running the stream,\nwhile the receive loop keeps draining the socket. {type:''stop''} cancels\nthe in-flight task; its CancelledError handler emits {type:''stopped''}.\nThe partial AI response is intentionally not persisted because\nprocess_message_stream only saves on full completion. Concurrent sends\nfrom the receive loop and stream task are serialized by an asyncio\nLock. A new message arriving mid-stream cancels the previous task too.\n\nFrontend: ChatWebSocket.stop() sends the control message; useWebSocket\nexposes it. ChatContainer.handleStop does an optimistic clear and then\nsends, with a stopRequestedRef gate that drops any late token/done\nevents arriving in the race window. A new send resets the flag.","tree":{"sha":"98f231ebe5ca89bcecf2d116883f09ee31ff5c70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/98f231ebe5ca89bcecf2d116883f09ee31ff5c70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDVmNjhjYjRiZjQ1MzI1ODJmNmUzNDQxMWZmOTkxZDMzZTViOGZjYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8","sha":"618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8"}],"sha":"5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/5f68cb4bf4532582f6e34411ff991d33e5b8fca8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T12:50:48Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T12:50:48Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"message":"feat: add guest mode and on-demand data export\n\nGuest mode lets visitors try the AI chat without registering. POST\n/auth/guest provisions a temporary user row (account_status=''guest'')\nand returns a normal JWT, so every existing endpoint works unchanged.\nGuest accounts older than 24h are wiped on app startup via\nAuthService.cleanup_guest_users, which explicitly drops conversations,\nmood entries, assessments, resources, badges, and group memberships.\nA get_registered_user dependency rejects guests on group creation; the\nupgrade endpoint converts a guest row in place so all guest-session\ndata is preserved on account creation.\n\nFrontend: ''Continue as Guest'' CTA on the landing hero with a one-time\ndisclaimer dialog, a sticky GuestBanner on every (main) page that opens\nan UpgradeModal, and guest gates on Create Group / Settings / Export.\nlib/guest.ts owns the localStorage ''is_guest'' flag; api.ts wipes it on\nevery setStoredToken / clearStoredToken so logout and 401 redirects\ncorrectly reset it.\n\nData export adds GET /api/v1/export/{mood,chat,assessments,all} behind\nget_registered_user. CSV uses stdlib csv with a UTF-8 BOM so Excel\nopens Amharic correctly. PDF uses reportlab with bundled Noto Sans and\nNoto Sans Ethiopic — the Ethiopic font lacks Latin glyphs, so a\n_typeset helper wraps Ethiopic runs in inline <font> tags while the\nbody font (NotoSans) handles Latin. Sync PDF assembly is offloaded via\nasyncio.to_thread. PDFs ship with a vector leaf-mark logo flowable,\ncolored mood-level dots, chat-bubble backgrounds for user/AI, and\nKeepTogether so conversation headings never dangle at page bottom.\n\nFrontend: /settings/export page with three Cards + Export Everything,\ninline export entry points on UserMenu, the chat conversation\ndropdown, the mood page header, and the assessment result page.\nlib/export.ts + apiRequestBlob handle binary downloads (browsers can''t\nattach Authorization headers to <a download>, so we fetch + blob +\nobject URL). Counts on the export page reuse existing endpoints\n(mood stats, chat conversations list, assessment history).","tree":{"sha":"9a89f013ab34c2c90b6690c5c5b56f81c8d682bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/9a89f013ab34c2c90b6690c5c5b56f81c8d682bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDYxOGExMDQ1YTA2ZmJhMDliODU5NDk5NGQ2NjgyZjEzMjMwMGNkYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a","sha":"f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a"}],"sha":"618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/618a1045a06fba09b8594994d6682f132300cdc8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119097475?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teklez/following{/oth