","sha":"3ac371e82327a298541cdeb27be6d69ebafc667e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/3ac371e82327a298541cdeb27be6d69ebafc667e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/259a9af49f0bd78c44e297d9fca323f7b77cbe7e","sha":"259a9af49f0bd78c44e297d9fca323f7b77cbe7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/259a9af49f0bd78c44e297d9fca323f7b77cbe7e"}],"sha":"f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/f32288e9431fb8f596f694def67f8ee68ec8132a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/259a9af49f0bd78c44e297d9fca323f7b77cbe7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T10:55:53Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T10:55:53Z","email":"shadow@Zemenus-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Zemenu Mekuria"},"message":"feat: i18n coverage, chat/avatar UX polish, and voice multi-turn fix\n\nTranslations\n- Add full Amharic coverage for the assessments page (was 22 keys → now\n  mirrors the English structure) plus new keys for relative-day labels,\n  toasts, and the strong \"not a diagnosis\" prefix.\n- Add Amharic for the entire groups room namespace (was missing) plus\n  new keys for the chat shell, disclaimer banner, header dropdown,\n  members sheet, connection strips, composer placeholder, and delete\n  dialog.\n- Add the avatar namespace (picker + viewer + 5 personas) to both\n  locales; introduce Ethiopian persona names (Selam / Saba kept as\n  female voices; Dawit / Henok / Yonas as male voices to match Fenrir /\n  Puck / Charon).\n- Add mood.scores so the 5-point mood scale localises in MoodCheckIn,\n  MoodLineChart tooltip, MoodDistribution, MoodStatsCards, and the\n  ChatInput \"mood logged\" toast.\n\nNew i18n helpers\n- useMoodLabels() — locale-aware MOOD_OPTIONS + getMoodLabel.\n- useLevelLabel() — wraps assessments.levels with a titlecase fallback\n  for unknown severity strings.\n- useLocalizedAvatars() — merges static persona metadata (id, voice,\n  body) with translated name/blurb/intro.\n\nAvatar UX + latency\n- Split AvatarScene into a lightweight picker chunk and a dynamic\n  AvatarViewer chunk (TalkingHead + three.js no longer ship with the\n  picker; prefetched on hover/focus and on idle).\n- Cache the picker''s TTS audio by (id, locale) and dedupe in-flight\n  fetches so locale switches don''t replay stale audio.\n- Stream Gemini Live audio through TalkingHead''s AudioWorklet\n  (streamStart / streamAudio / streamNotifyEnd / streamStop) instead of\n  buffering every chunk until turn_complete — avatar starts talking on\n  the first ~100 ms chunk and chains chunks gap-free.\n\nVoice multi-turn fix\n- voice_service supervisor now sends a fresh {\"type\":\"ready\"} after\n  each reconnect (Gemini Live closes its session after one turn). The\n  frontend keeps callStatus on \"thinking\" between turns until that\n  ready event arrives, so audio recorded during the swap window is no\n  longer silently dropped.\n\nChat shell\n- Collapsible chat sidebar (persisted in localStorage) with the brand\n  row removed (TopNav already has the logo); grid track switches\n  between 64 px and 280 px.\n\nAuth + landing\n- Auth pages locked to viewport (h-screen overflow-hidden), brand\n  panel trimmed to logo + headline + subcopy + (optional) quote;\n  FormPanelTop and FormFoot deleted.\n- LanguageSwitcher added to LandingNav (same dropdown used in TopNav)\n  so locale can be set from the landing page.\n\nMisc\n- /settings/memory now renders inside the main layout (was missing\n  from isMainPath, hence no TopNav).","tree":{"sha":"b06a8b7329e80dc64a02e49e84c43c4c3f877deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/b06a8b7329e80dc64a02e49e84c43c4c3f877deb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/259a9af49f0bd78c44e297d9fca323f7b77cbe7e","verif