3b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/33b2c9b426aec8994fef728008d39271e4ae6cc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:21:08Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:21:08Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"message":"i18n: add chat.v2 + adjacent namespaces\n\nAdds chat.v2 in en + am: sidebar groups, thread header (connection\nstatus / rename / share), composer, empty state + 4 starter prompts,\nlocale-aware crisis banner, 5-4-3-2-1 grounding card.\n\nAlso carries adjacent namespaces (landing.v3, auth.v2, dashboard.v2)\nfor the parallel redesign PRs in this sprint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0fc544dd33bfa57a4c1c25f5ddb4502098fcca9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/e0fc544dd33bfa57a4c1c25f5ddb4502098fcca9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/33b2c9b426aec8994fef728008d39271e4ae6cc1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/33b2c9b426aec8994fef728008d39271e4ae6cc1","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDMzYjJjOWI0MjZhZWM4OTk0ZmVmNzI4MDA4ZDM5MjcxZTRhZTZjYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f","sha":"b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f"}],"sha":"33b2c9b426aec8994fef728008d39271e4ae6cc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/33b2c9b426aec8994fef728008d39271e4ae6cc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:21:08Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:21:08Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"message":"feat(chat): redesigned /chat with sidebar + thread + composer\n\nRewrites the AI chat experience against Chat.html. New layout shell:\n\n  /chat/layout.tsx → grid-cols-[280px_1fr] h-[calc(100vh-60px)]\n\nSidebar lives only inside (main)/chat/, NOT globally. Below lg it\ncollapses into a shadcn <Sheet> opened from a hamburger.\n\nRewrites under src/components/chat/:\n\n- ChatSidebar.tsx — brand row + \"New chat\" ink button with ⌘K kbd hint\n  + debounced (200ms) search + grouped list + user footer dropdown\n  with sign-out.\n- ConversationList.tsx — groups conversations into Today / Yesterday /\n  Previous 7 / Earlier (via src/lib/group-conversations.ts).\n- ConversationItem.tsx — active state reads as a card lifted off the\n  sage page (1px primary border + 3px sage shadow ring via inline\n  color-mix). Hover-revealed kebab → Rename + Delete.\n- ChatContainer.tsx — preserves all useWebSocket plumbing (token /\n  done / crisis_alert / error events, sessionStorage initial-message\n  hand-off, conversations refresh). Restyles the header: serif title,\n  mono caps connection-status meta with pulse dot, icon buttons for\n  Rename / Share + a kebab dropdown with Rename / Share / Regenerate\n  title (disabled) / Delete conversation.\n- MessageList.tsx — gradient bg from-background to-secondary/40,\n  max-w-[760px] centered, day dividers (\"Today\" / \"Yesterday\" /\n  weekday + date) with mono caps and flanking rules.\n- MessageBubble.tsx — ink user bubble + bg-card bot bubble with mono\n  \"MindEase\" byline; hover-revealed action row (Helpful / Not quite /\n  Copy) with active sage-soft state and copy-confirmation.\n- StreamingMessage.tsx — same bubble shell with a blinking sage cursor.\n- TypingIndicator.tsx — 3 sage dots in a bubble shell.\n- ChatInput.tsx — auto-grow textarea (1→6 rows / 168px cap), Enter\n  sends + Shift+Enter newline, send-button morphs to a Square stop\n  while streaming, 3 ghost icon buttons on the left (Paperclip / Mic\n  → coming-soon toasts; Smile → opens MoodCheckIn in a dialog), char\n  counter past 800 chars, mono caps footer (locale / disclaimer /\n  keybind hint).\n- StarterPrompts.tsx — 2x2 grid of 4 starter cards (Anxious / Stress /\n  Talk / Breathing) with sage-soft icon chips.\n- CrisisBanner.tsx — clay-tinted band with 1-2 country-local hotline\n  pills + \"I''m okay\" dismiss; resources resolve from the WebSocket\n  payload first, fall back to getCrisisResources(locale).\n- RenameDialog.tsx — controlled dialog used by both the sidebar kebab\n  and the thread header. PATCH /api/v1/chat/conversations/{id} via\n  the existing updateConversation() wrapper.\n\nEmpty state (/chat) shows a sage leaf badge + \"How are you feeling\ntoday?\" italic-accent headline + StarterPrompts + a trust row +\nthe same composer. Clicking any starter (or sending direct text)\ncreates a conversation, stashes the prompt in sessionStorage, and\nroutes to /chat/{id} where the thread auto-sends on first connect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de283adea82c03d7eb17e3e70b92ae4ba414f640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/de283adea82c03d7eb17e3e70b92ae4ba414f640"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKGIwMGI2YzZmNDA2ZDJjMjQ0ZTVmNjIxMzZkZTlmOTA2YWU0MWQ4NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4","sha":"9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4"}],"sha":"b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/b00b6c6f406d2c244e5f62136de9f906ae41d85f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:21:08Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:21:08Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"message":"fix(lib): add safeRandomUUID + safeClipboardWrite helpers\n\nBoth navigator.clipboard and crypto.randomUUID are gated to secure\ncontexts. Firefox treats 0.0.0.0 / bare-IP hosts as insecure, so the\nchat surface (which sends messages via WebSocket and copies bot replies)\nbroke for users hitting the dev stack on those URLs.\n\nsafeRandomUUID(): tries crypto.randomUUID() first, falls back to a\nv4-shaped string from Math.random.\n\nsafeClipboardWrite(text): tries navigator.clipboard.writeText() first,\nfalls back to a hidden textarea + document.execCommand(\"copy\").\nReturns true on success so callers can decide whether to flip to a\n\"Copied\" state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e293ed1d82cc3ac07723601d9427ce33aad28b67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/e293ed1d82cc3ac07723601d9427ce33aad28b67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDllNWRmOWNjZjVhNzkwZmQyMjYwYTA5YmI2ODY2N2U0NjI4NzlhYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/5aff91c33df70e06ca2fec7dd220523721dbdf84","sha":"5aff91c33df70e06ca2fec7dd220523721dbdf84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/5aff91c33df70e06ca2fec7dd220523721dbdf84"}],"sha":"9e5df9ccf5a790fd2260a09bb68667e462879ab4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/com