baadf6a5abd999d47aed8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:16:48Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:16:48Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"message":"i18n: add dashboard.v2 + adjacent namespaces\n\nAdds dashboard.v2 in en + am: time-of-day eyebrow + greeting variants,\nstreak line, mood check-in copy + face labels, three stat-card labels\nand their delta phrasings, dark \"start new chat\" CTA, recent list,\nfour quick-action labels, sparkline header, daily reflection prompts\n(10 static lines), and the badges panel.\n\nAlso carries adjacent namespaces (landing.v3, auth.v2, chat.v2) for\nthe parallel redesign PRs in this sprint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6208bf66e6eaf92c38573cc967a6da8beecbf889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/6208bf66e6eaf92c38573cc967a6da8beecbf889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/4d7920388a6926fefbbaadf6a5abd999d47aed8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/4d7920388a6926fefbbaadf6a5abd999d47aed8a","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDRkNzkyMDM4OGE2OTI2ZmVmYmJhYWRmNmE1YWJkOTk5ZDQ3YWVkOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/30dd40c7adebc7a3e9a65f5fd0fdf3c31c0c1142","sha":"30dd40c7adebc7a3e9a65f5fd0fdf3c31c0c1142","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/30dd40c7adebc7a3e9a65f5fd0fdf3c31c0c1142"}],"sha":"4d7920388a6926fefbbaadf6a5abd999d47aed8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/4d7920388a6926fefbbaadf6a5abd999d47aed8a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/30dd40c7adebc7a3e9a65f5fd0fdf3c31c0c1142/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:16:48Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:16:48Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"message":"feat(dashboard): redesigned /dashboard with 9 components + local header\n\nRewrites /dashboard against Dashboard.html. Two-column layout (1.6fr /\n1fr on lg): left stack carries MoodCheckInCard + StatCards +\nStartChatCTA + RecentConversations + QuickActions; right rail carries\nMoodSparkline + DailyReflection + BadgesPanel.\n\nNew components under src/components/dashboard/:\n\n- DashboardHeader.tsx — breadcrumb + bell + settings strip above the\n  greeting. (EN/አማ pill removed since the global TopNav already has a\n  language switcher.)\n- GreetingHero.tsx — time-of-day mono eyebrow + serif greeting with\n  italic name + streak line; right column shows the date and a live\n  HH:MM clock that ticks every 30s.\n- MoodCheckInCard.tsx — sage-gradient card with a decorative blur blob\n  in the top-right and 5 custom-SVG face buttons (extracted verbatim\n  from the mockup). Click opens the existing <MoodCheckIn /> in a\n  Dialog so the full save path is preserved.\n- StatCards.tsx — 3-up: Total conversations / This week / Mood streak,\n  each with a mono label + serif number + delta line.\n- StartChatCTA.tsx — dark ink panel with a sage radial glow + italic-\n  accent serif headline + light \"Start new chat\" link.\n- RecentConversations.tsx — numbered top-3 list with relative-time\n  trailing chip.\n- QuickActions.tsx — 4-up grid (Breathing / Journal / Assessment /\n  Find help nearby) with sage-soft icon chips; each toasts \"Coming\n  soon\" for now.\n- MoodSparkline.tsx — 7 vertical bars stepping through 5 sage shade\n  tiers (via inline color-mix to bypass Tailwind''s opacity-strip on\n  oklch variables), streak pill + avg + trend line in the footer,\n  Open tracker → link.\n- DailyReflection.tsx — mono eyebrow + serif blockquote with oversized\n  italic open-quote, day attribution, three pill actions (Save / New\n  prompt / Talk about this →). Prompts rotate daily from a 10-line\n  static array hashed by day-of-year.\n- BadgesPanel.tsx — recent badges list (uses real BadgeResponse data\n  from getMoodBadges() when present, falls back to a 3-row sample)\n  with a locked-badge row at the bottom.\n\nDrops the orphan dashboard components: FooterBand, ReflectionCard,\nResourceCard, YourGroups, and mood/DashboardMoodWidget.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa796b7f1d1688e91a0f8498ca63da03f918db51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/aa796b7f1d1688e91a0f8498ca63da03f918db51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/30dd40c7adebc7a3e9a65f5fd0fdf3c31c0c1142","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/30dd40c7adebc7a3e9a65f5fd0fdf3c31c0c1142","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDMwZGQ0MGM3YWRlYmM3YTNlOWE2NWY1ZmQwZmRmM2MzMWMwYzExNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https: