eived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/0b138fa831a3d4b75614d5ac7b2a148c4d5a1dc7","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKDBiMTM4ZmE4MzFhM2Q0Yjc1NjE0ZDVhYzdiMmExNDhjNGQ1YTFkYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/555fd7ddd9d11286a8785e37d4f0f9d9ee0572bd","sha":"555fd7ddd9d11286a8785e37d4f0f9d9ee0572bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/555fd7ddd9d11286a8785e37d4f0f9d9ee0572bd"}],"sha":"0b138fa831a3d4b75614d5ac7b2a148c4d5a1dc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/0b138fa831a3d4b75614d5ac7b2a148c4d5a1dc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/commits/555fd7ddd9d11286a8785e37d4f0f9d9ee0572bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:10:09Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T15:10:09Z","email":"yonatanalebachew7@gmail.com","name":"yonatannnn"},"message":"feat(auth): redesigned login + register pages with split-screen shell\n\nPorts the auth split-screen design from Auth.html into the existing\nNext.js codebase.\n\nLogin + Register both render as a 2-column layout on lg+: a photo\nbrand panel on the left and the form panel on the right. Below lg the\nbrand panel collapses out and the form takes the full screen.\n\nNew components under src/components/auth/:\n\n- BrandPanel.tsx — full-bleed photo with a dark gradient overlay, brand\n  row at top, mono eyebrow + serif italic-accent headline + subcopy\n  anchored toward the bottom, optional frosted brand-quote card (used\n  by login), and a flexible foot row.\n- FormPanelTop.tsx — back-to-home link on the left, EN/አማ pill toggle\n  on the right (uses /set-locale&next= with the current pathname so\n  switching the locale stays on the same route, and uses plain <a>\n  tags so the cookie actually applies on the next render).\n- FormFoot.tsx — version stamp + Privacy / Terms / Help links.\n- LoginForm.tsx — rewrite. Welcome pill, mono eyebrow, serif italic-\n  accent headline, sub, Google ghost button, mono divider, email +\n  password (each with a lucide icon prefix + show/hide toggle on\n  password), keep-signed-in checkbox, 48px ink submit, sage-dot\n  disclaimer card, alt-action linking to /register.\n- RegisterForm.tsx — rewrite. Display name + email + password + confirm\n  + terms. Password row includes a 4-segment strength bar driven by\n  passing regex checks, a 2x2 requirements grid that flips to primary\n  as each rule starts passing, an animated \"Passwords match\" line on\n  the confirm field, and inline Terms / Privacy links inside the\n  agree-terms checkbox.\n\nGoogleSignInButton stays on the @react-oauth/google ID-token flow\n(backend verifies a credential JWT, not access tokens) — the visible\nbutton now layers on top of an invisible <GoogleLogin> with pointer-\nevents disabled so the underlying click reaches Google''s iframe while\nthe visible shell matches the 44px ghost-with-color-logo design.\n\nDrops the now-orphan AuthShell wrapper; the pages compose BrandPanel\ninline. Adds an (auth)/forgot-password stub route the login form\nlinks to.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93645d5cff883195c66d62702d021c68793e7a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/93645d5cff883195c66d62702d021c68793e7a58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/555fd7ddd9d11286a8785e37d4f0f9d9ee0572bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/555fd7ddd9d11286a8785e37d4f0f9d9ee0572bd","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiP