 0.018 150) (--bg-deep)\n- --secondary / --accent → oklch(0.92 0.022 150) (--sage-soft)\n- --primary → oklch(0.52 0.045 155) (--sage)\n\nCharts and mood scale repointed to oklch ramps; sidebar tokens follow\nthe same sage scale. .dark theme repainted to match.\n\nAlso gates the global DisclaimerBanner on pathname so it doesn''t double-\nrender above the landing''s own slim DisclaimerStrip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81544f88d700ca3f2caa6f3981550e7a92ccb83d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/trees/81544f88d700ca3f2caa6f3981550e7a92ccb83d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Amantsehay/MindEase/git/commits/c80f822821e0d627b864453b8b8c24fa1fd55719","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133119849?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yonatannnn","id":133119849,"login":"yonatannnn","node_id":"U_kgDOB-8_aQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yonatannnn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Amantsehay/MindEase/commit/c80f822821e0d627b864453b8b8c24fa1fd55719","node_id":"C_kwDOSpuiPdoAKGM4MGY4MjI4MjFlMGQ2MjdiODY0NDUzYjhiOGMyNGZhMWZkNTU3MTk","paren