co Bartoli"},"message":"chore(validate): parse frontmatter and check reference links in SKILL.md\n\nThe validator only checked `references/...` links inside reference files,\nso a broken link in SKILL.md or a stale cross-skill path went unnoticed.\n\n- parse the frontmatter block (quoted scalars, `>`/`|` block scalars,\n  UTF-8 BOM) instead of grepping the whole file\n- enforce the Agent Skills spec: `name` is 1-64 chars, lowercase a-z0-9\n  with single hyphens, and matches the folder; `description` is non-empty\n  and at most 1024 chars\n- resolve `references/...` and `<skill>/references/...` links in SKILL.md\n  and reference files, written as inline code or markdown links; ignore\n  `#anchors`, skip globs\n- document the new checks in CONTRIBUTING and narrow the remaining\n  \"JSON schema\" item to what is still uncovered","tree":{"sha":"7c5450b04e3ca53b86680e2926ea4a1b99c1fef3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucamezzalira/mfe-skills/git/trees/7c5450b04e3ca53b86680e2926ea4a1b99c1fef3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lucamezzalira/mfe-skills/git/commits/ce3b227178a80d57a4d204fb8ad46ba9278a48e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27234034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/federicobartoli","id":27234034,"login":"federicobartoli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjM0MDM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/federicobartoli/repos","site_admin":false