https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/905f693f816ac8b0cbabf6dfc18accfe9d6a7a54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/baf4d7bd7edf092b62375facb3c6ecae01035573/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:15:15Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:15:15Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"refactor(tailwind): feuille Tailwind unique du core (propriétaire : TopBar) + breakpoint xs\n\nAvant : chaque app Tailwind (TopBar, assistant, 404) générait sa propre feuille,\nglobale et non layerée ; la dernière chargée réécrivait les règles responsives des\nautres (cause de la disparition de la date/options du niveau 1, corrigée en 53c7577\npar un contournement symétrique).\n\nMaintenant :\n- esm-primary-navigation-app/src/tailwind.tw.css est la seule feuille : elle importe le\n  preset et scanne les .ts/.tsx de packages/apps/*/src (tests exclus). Importée une\n  fois, en tête de index.ts de la TopBar (module chargé partout sauf login/logout/\n  change-password).\n- esm-ai-assistant-app et esm-not-found-app n''importent plus Tailwind et n''ont plus\n  la dépendance @egen-civitas/tailwind-preset (yarn.lock aligné, version 8 conservée).\n- esm-primary-navigation-app/turbo.json : le build de la TopBar hache les sources de\n  toutes les apps (196 fichiers, tests exclus), sinon le cache turbo servirait une\n  feuille périmée quand seule une autre app change.\n- Breakpoint xs = 30rem (480px) défini dans la feuille unique : il était absent du thème\n  (hérité de GED, classes inertes). Corrige ''hidden xs:flex'' (menu Créer), et active\n  ''hidden xs:inline'' (nom complet du collaborateur, fil d''Ariane niveau 2) et\n  ''xs:max-w-[165px]'' (sélecteur d''espace) tels que prévus.\n\nVérifié : build Rspack réel de la TopBar (preset 1.4.0, styleguide 1.5.1), audit de\n2846 classes utilitaires + 273 variantes (0 manquante), une seule injection de la\nfeuille, tests 404 (2/2) et assistant (15/15).","tree":{"sha":"83b86f07f44dccfcb4476b449db11f4ceced2ed4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/83b86f07f44dccfcb4476b449db11f4ceced2ed4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/baf4d7bd7edf092b62375facb3c6ecae01035573","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https