muel (via Claude)"},"message":"feat(primary-navigation): TopBar Supreme Intranet 100% dans l''app du core\n\n- Copie du socle de la TopBar Civitas-GED (2 niveaux) dans src/intranet-topbar :\n  SupremeIntranetTopBar, DropdownNavigation, BreadcrumbLevel2Nav,\n  WorkspaceAndSiteSelectorsColumn, EgenLogo, GooeyInput, WaterGlassModal,\n  AssistantRobotButton, contextes Workspace/Site. Plus aucune dépendance\n  au composant TopBar du framework (TopBar/TopBarIconButton/TopBarAvatar).\n- Services de l''ancienne barre réintégrés à droite, au design GED :\n  apps (app-menu-slot + externalRefLinks), langue, raccourcis, notifications,\n  plein écran, thème, menu utilisateur (session + user-panel-slots),\n  menu latéral, slots top-nav-info/actions/trailing/breadcrumb.\n- Recherche : navigation réelle vers config.search.path?q=.\n- Suppression de l''ancien design (logo, search-bar, context-switcher, panneaux SCSS).\n- Bouton Assistant IA -> événement window egen:assistant-toggle (esm-ai-assistant-app).\n- Deps ajoutées : lucide-react, motion, @radix-ui/react-slot (yarn.lock à régénérer).","tree":{"sha":"4002ac0a0a7c99aad0467b8a50fb6a184fc0df3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/4002ac0a0a7c99aad0467b8a50fb6a184fc0df3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/3f04c6c9434694143084853400b2372802e8a79f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/us