outes.\n\n- esm-styleguide (1.x / ^1.0.1) declare dans les 7 apps qui l''utilisent\n  (devtools, help-menu, home, implementer-tools, login, offline-tools,\n  primary-navigation)\n- esm-routes (1.x / ^1.0.2) et esm-dynamic-loading (2.x / ^2.0.0)\n  declares dans les 11 apps (peers du styleguide et d''esm-routes@1.0.2)\n- yarn.lock resynchronise (yarn install --immutable OK)\n\nBuild valide : les 11 apps compilent (warnings de taille d''asset seulement).","tree":{"sha":"0dbf1db37670b8742587165dc190f5318bb89a51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/0dbf1db37670b8742587165dc190f5318bb89a51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/9fff87d1aab7878e49ed907a4cb8d25e28a58c47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/9fff87d1aab7878e49ed907a4cb8d25e28a58c47","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDlmZmY4N2QxYWFiNzg3OGU0OWVkOTA3YTRjYjhkMjVlMjhhNThjNDc","parents":[{"html