m-error-handling`, `esm-extensions`, `esm-feature-flags`, `esm-globals`, `esm-navigation`, `esm-utils`\n     - `dayjs`, `single-spa`, `swr`\n     - `@egen-civitas/esm-expression-evaluator`, `esm-offline`, `esm-translations`\n   - Mis à jour `@egen-civitas/esm-api` de `1.x` à `^1.1.1` (version minimale requise)\n   - Mis à jour `rxjs` de `6.x` à `7.x` dans `devDependencies`\n\n**Résultat :**\n- Les warnings spécifiques sur `rxjs 6.x` et les dépendances manquantes ont disparu\n- `rxjs@npm:6.6.7` a été supprimé du projet\n- Il reste un warning générique sur les peer dependencies qui peut être normal dans un monorepo\n\nLes dépendances de `Frontend-esm-core` sont maintenant alignées avec les dernières versions des packages publiés.","tree":{"sha":"5c76bef9abd40fed11e3bfd34e096960272933cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/5c76bef9abd40fed11e3bfd34e096960272933cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/ea14e6ffab1ead5ff6ca17b97c39cdbd2f448e79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User