https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/62b317117012c657821bb91cdc759cd24dc00d75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:10:06Z","email":"164351680+amourgit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:10:06Z","email":"164351680+amourgit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"amourgit"},"message":"feat(esm-home-app): assemble la vraie page d''accueil (home.component.tsx)\n\nCompose toutes les sections portees depuis Civitas-GED (HomeBackground,\nHeroMosaic, BlogSection, SocialLinks, ProfileCard, QuickLinks, TeamCalendar,\nDocuments) au sein du squelette HomeSection. Devient la page ''home'' par\ndefaut (l''ancienne vitrine reste sur ''home/showcase'').\n\nhome-sample-data.ts : SEUL fichier a modifier pour brancher une vraie source\nde donnees plus tard (API, config) sans toucher aux composants de section.\nContenu sur le theme reel de l''ecosysteme (GED, IAM, agenda) plutot que du\ncontenu generique hors-sujet ; aucun lien social par defaut (SocialLinks\nn''est affiche que si des liens reels sont fournis).\n\nCorrections mineures au passage :\n- gradient-wave.component.tsx : import React manquant (tsconfig de ce\n  monorepo utilise jsx:''react'', contrairement a la branche framework d''origine).\n- quick-links : type de la prop icon elargi (strokeWidth de lucide-react\n  accepte string|number, pas seulement number).\n- profile-card : le ternaire de repli sur erreur d''image ne faisait rien\n  (les deux branches etaient identiques) ; remplace par un vrai repli en\n  initiales, reinitialise a l''enregistrement du formulaire d''edition.\n\nNon porte dans cette passe : la section ''Evenements'' de GED (EventsSection),\nqui depend d''un sous-systeme de filtres complet (FilterBar, types/events.ts)\nabsent de ce monorepo — recommande comme tache dediee separee.\n\nVerifie par typecheck TypeScript contre les vraies dependances publiees\n(@egen-civitas/esm-framework, @egen-civitas/esm-styleguide, framer-motion,\nlucide-react...) : aucune erreur (hors 1 faux positif d''environnement de\nverification, sans rapport, deja present avant ce travail : require.context\nnon type dans le sandbox de typecheck).","tree":{"sha":"858cdee7b9df1027d8e652b26bd575dd1d0c7fa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/858cdee7b9df1027d8e652b26bd575dd1d0c7fa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/62b317117012c657821bb91cdc759cd24dc00d75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user