om","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T20:05:26Z","email":"164351680+amourgit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"amourgit"},"message":"feat(esm-home-app): liste Documents (panneau lateral), props-driven\n\nCopie/adapte depuis Civitas-GED (PortalDocuments.tsx). ''items'' et tous les\ncallbacks (onOpenDocument, onSeeAll, onCreateFolder, onUploadFile,\nonMoreOptions) sont desormais des props ; la version d''origine allait\nchercher PORTAL_MOCK_DATA.documents en dur et naviguait vers des routes\nfixes independamment du document reellement clique. Chaque callback est\noptionnel : le bouton correspondant ne s''affiche/agit que si fourni.\nSysteme de son Xbox non porte, specifique a GED.","tree":{"sha":"0598f1191457e1d175e1ea2396ad98b2d3f89c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/0598f1191457e1d175e1ea2396ad98b2d3f89c5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/d41192e69eb334dbe65d1ac0bb64394c611e062d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https: