","name":"amourgit"},"message":"feat(esm-home-app): widget TeamCalendar (panneau lateral), pagination reelle\n\nCopie/adapte depuis Civitas-GED (PortalTeamCalendar.tsx). BUGS CORRIGES :\n- La pagination ''Previous/Next'' etait purement decorative : le state ''page''\n  changeait mais rien dans le rendu n''en dependait, la liste n''avait jamais\n  bouge. Elle decoupe desormais reellement les evenements par page.\n- Le clic sur un evenement ignorait l''evenement clique et naviguait\n  toujours vers la meme route fixe. onSelectEvent recoit maintenant le bon\n  evenement.\n- L''onglet ''Passes'' retournait un evenement fictif code en dur ; pastEvents\n  est maintenant une vraie prop (vide par defaut).\n- Systeme de son Xbox non porte, specifique a GED.","tree":{"sha":"68c525ee36f9e3deccbbb7d024e83232db6749db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/68c525ee36f9e3deccbbb7d024e83232db6749db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/d9593682e62eac70b3a2c2bc819165137214b824","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscr