80+amourgit@users.noreply.github.com","name":"amourgit"},"message":"feat(esm-home-app): grille de raccourcis QuickLinks (panneau lateral)\n\nCopie/adapte depuis Civitas-GED (PortalQuickLinks.tsx) :\n- ''iconName'' (enum fermee + switch a maintenir) remplace par ''icon'' (le\n  composant d''icone directement en prop, meme principe que SocialLinks) :\n  ajouter un raccourci avec une nouvelle icone ne touche plus ce fichier.\n- ''route'' + navigation interne (useNavigate) remplaces par ''onSelectItem'',\n  laisse a l''appelant (coherent avec HeroMosaic/BlogSection).\n- Systeme de son Xbox (''playXboxSound'') non porte, specifique a GED.","tree":{"sha":"6deb8f3c08ab683e70b81a23fb31cd1ea6febb34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/6deb8f3c08ab683e70b81a23fb31cd1ea6febb34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/5dd211c06ba71d4168be4bd072f35168eda03fea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g