ex SophieProfileCard) + modal d''edition\n\nCopie/adapte depuis Civitas-GED (SophieProfileCard.tsx), separe en 2 fichiers\n(carte / modal d''edition). BUG CORRIGE : la version d''origine avait le\nprofil d''UNE personne precise (nom, poste, email, photos) code EN DUR dans\nun useState interne, impossible a reutiliser pour qui que ce soit d''autre.\n''profile'' est maintenant une prop obligatoire ; ''onProfileChange'' est\noptionnel pour persister les modifications cote appelant.","tree":{"sha":"7bdd4ddca34e64df320c978b60ccd8a65832d4d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/7bdd4ddca34e64df320c978b60ccd8a65832d4d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/14f85f91b6f28009e7bbd476e24f63e2d0d1a18d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/14f85f91b6f28009e7bbd476e24f63e2d0d1a18d","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDE0Zjg1ZjkxYjZmMjgwMDllN2JiZDQ3NmUyNGY2M2UyZDB