","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/37f1ddf1cdece4a20cd19a45fd310dfb2a46ca4b","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDM3ZjFkZGYxY2RlY2U0YTIwY2QxOWE0NWZkMzEwZGZiMmE0NmNhNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc","sha":"9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310","sha":"8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310"}],"sha":"37f1ddf1cdece4a20cd19a45fd310dfb2a46ca4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/37f1ddf1cdece4a20cd19a45fd310dfb2a46ca4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:19:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:19:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"revert(dev-link): abandon du pont workspace - regression severe en runtime\n\nRapporte par l''utilisateur apres ''yarn start'' : bypass toujours inactif\n(sessions reelles tentees vers un backend absent, EADDRNOTAVAIL en\nboucle) ET ralentissement severe (2+ minutes avant que home/login se\nchargent, charge CPU anormale), alors que le shell et devtools-app se\nchargent vite.\n\nDeux causes distinctes identifiees :\n1. Bypass : @egen-civitas/egen et esm-app-shell exposent du code compile\n   (dist/) - le dist present sur la machine de l''utilisateur n''avait pas\n   ete reconstruit avec les derniers correctifs sources (esm-api,\n   esm-app-shell, rspack-config, egen). Aucun mecanisme de liaison ne\n   peut faire fonctionner un correctif qui n''a jamais ete recompile.\n2. Lenteur : hypothese principale (non confirmee par profiling) - une\n   fois les 35 paquets du framework membres du workspace de Core, les 11\n   apps ne consomment plus seulement dist/+.d.ts (petit) mais risquent de\n   faire retraverser une bonne partie des sources brutes du framework a\n   TypeScript/rspack, en parallele, pour chaque app.\n\nLe probleme (1) rendait de toute facon impossible de juger si (2) etait\nreellement du au mecanisme de liaison ou a autre chose - mais la lenteur\netait deja bloquante en soi, independamment.\n\nConclusion : lier 35 paquets interdependants via workspace/portal n''est\npas praticable ici pour un usage quotidien. Retour a 100% npm publie\n(workspaces: packages/apps/* uniquement, comme avant toute cette serie\nde tentatives).\n\nLa bonne voie pour que les correctifs deja pousses sur\nFrontend-esm-framework atteignent Core : le pipeline changesets deja en\nplace (yarn release && yarn ci:publish), pas un pont local - documente\nen detail dans docs/dev-lien-local-framework.md, avec l''historique\ncomplet des deux echecs pour ne pas les reproduire.","tree":{"sha":"0537609b1f4d1597678dd9ab06f07412c16974e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/0537609b1f4d1597678dd9ab06f07412c16974e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDgwMzNkYmMxYTlhMjQ5ZDg2MDRmNzc3OTNlMjg2NzRhMGE1N2QzMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","sha":"72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d"}],"sha":"8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/8033dbc1a9a249d8604f77793e28674a0a57d310"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:24:35Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T00:24:35Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"il fallait mettre les liens absolu pour que le core puisse bien retrouver le framework","tree":{"sha":"137972e3fe242c75a245de795a972b563a223578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/137972e3fe242c75a245de795a972b563a223578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDllNDA1ODY4MGI0NWZhNDRmMWFmMWIyMTlkZjZiNDRkYTViZTU1ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","sha":"72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d"}],"sha":"9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/9e4058680b45fa44f1af1b219df6b44da5be55fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T23:58:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T23:58:13Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(dev-link): portal: cassait l''install reelle - bascule vers workspaces\n\nConstat empirique (log fourni par l''utilisateur, framework installe et\nbuildé sans probleme de son cote) : ''yarn install'' dans Core plantait a\nl''etape Link :\n\n  Error: Assertion failed: Writing attempt prevented to\n  .../Frontend-esm-framework/packages/tooling/egen/node_modules/@egen-civitas/esm-app-shell\n  which is outside project root: .../Frontend-esm-core\n\nCause structurelle du precedent commit (portal: via resolutions), pas un\nchemin errone : egen (portal) depend d''esm-app-shell (portal), les deux\nphysiquement dans Frontend-esm-framework - un dossier FRERE de\nFrontend-esm-core, jamais un ancetre. La resolution Node ne remonte que\nvers les ancetres ; jamais vers un frere. Le linker node-modules refuse\ndonc d''ecrire un node_modules a l''interieur du framework pour satisfaire\ncette dependance croisee. Avec 35 paquets du framework interdependants,\nce mur structurel n''etait pas specifique a egen -> esm-app-shell, il\naurait resurgi ailleurs.\n\nFix : ajout de packages/framework/*, packages/shell/*, packages/tooling/*\ndu framework (chemin relatif) au ''workspaces'' de Core - le meme mecanisme\nque celui deja documente et utilise avant separation\n(analyse-separation-framework.md), retire a l''epoque pour valider la\nconsommation npm externe reelle, pas parce qu''il ne fonctionnait pas.\nLes 35 paquets deviennent membres du MEME projet Yarn que Core : la\nresolution Node n''a plus jamais besoin de sortir de la racine, quel que\nsoit le nombre de dependances croisees. Fonctionne sans toucher a une\nseule ''dependency'' declaree, car le framework utilise deja des ranges\nsemver classiques en interne (^1.0.0), jamais workspace:* - verifie\navant ce commit, dans core et dans framework, aucune occurrence.\n\nresolutions revient a son etat d''origine (@types/react, csstype\nuniquement) - les 35 entrees portal: retirees, devenues inutiles.\n\ndocs/dev-lien-local-framework.md reecrit : historique des deux essais,\npourquoi portal: a echoue concretement, le piege deja documente\n(workspace:* dans des peerDependencies publiees) verifie absent, et un\npoint de vigilance non verifie (turbo.json de Core pas forcement pret a\npiloter le build des paquets framework une fois dans le meme workspace).","tree":{"sha":"1a3ad4320551438802ba2a208aa446f29923f35c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/1a3ad4320551438802ba2a208aa446f29923f35c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDcyMTY1Nzc0YmU2NjdkZmJmZjAwNmZlMzkxZWE4MWNjOWQxNDMxNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273","sha":"9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273"}],"sha":"72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/72165774be667dfbff006fe391ea81cc9d14315d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T19:17:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T19:17:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"dev: lien local vers Frontend-esm-framework via portal: (iteration rapide)\n\nDemande : le framework est en developpement actif en parallele de core ;\npublier a chaque changement pour le tester cote consommateur est trop\nlent. Objectif : que chaque changement framework soit testable\ndirectement dans le workspace de core.\n\nApproche : bloc ''resolutions'' racine avec un portal: par package du\nframework (35 packages, generes depuis les vrais champs ''name'' de\nFrontend-esm-framework, pas tapes a la main) :\n\n  \"@egen-civitas/esm-api\": \"portal:../Frontend-esm-framework/packages/framework/esm-api\"\n\nDeliberement PAS la meme chose que l''ancien pont documente dans\ndocs/analyse-separation-framework.md (workspaces avec chemin relatif,\nretire depuis) : ici, aucune dependance declaree ne change (les apps\ngardent leurs ranges 1.x/^1.0.x telles quelles) - seule la resolution\nracine est redirigee vers le disque local. Evite de reproduire le bug\nde la section 2.2 de ce doc (workspace:* qui fuyait dans des\npeerDependencies publiees) puisque la frontiere workspace/dependance\nexterne n''est jamais brouillee. Trivialement reversible : supprimer les\nentrees portal: du bloc resolutions restaure la consommation npm reelle,\nsans toucher a rien d''autre.\n\nSuppose Frontend-esm-framework clone en dossier frere de\nFrontend-esm-core - a ajuster si disposition locale differente.\n\nNecessite un ''yarn build'' dans framework (dist/ est gitignored, jamais\ncommit) avant que portal: ait quoi que ce soit a servir, et un rebuild\ndu paquet modifie a chaque changement teste (pas de mode watch mis en\nplace - voir docs/dev-lien-local-framework.md pour le detail du\nworkflow, les prerequis, et comment revenir en arriere).\n\nNon verifiable de bout en bout dans ce sandbox : yarn install echoue\nsur une erreur WASM specifique a ce container (deja documentee section\n3 de analyse-separation-framework.md), pas au changement lui-meme.\n\nAjoute : docs/dev-lien-local-framework.md","tree":{"sha":"fb79532023d49c3f4fbb10ece5f3c38cdbb249fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/fb79532023d49c3f4fbb10ece5f3c38cdbb249fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDliY2FiMmMwMGZmMGNiZGZmYTBjZDQ0NmU5ZjdhZGM2NDRmZDUyNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86","sha":"522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86"}],"sha":"9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/9bcab2c00ff0cbdffa0cd446e9f7adc644fd5273"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T18:15:40Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T23:29:56Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(deps): declare esm-app-shell en dependance directe (^1.0.2)\n\nyarn up \"@egen-civitas/*\" (puis yarn up sans argument) n''ont jamais mis\na jour esm-app-shell dans node_modules, reste coince a 1.0.0 malgre\ndeux tentatives - confirme par Samuel, cat node_modules/@egen-civitas/\nesm-app-shell/package.json montre encore 1.0.0 apres les deux commandes.\n\nCause : esm-app-shell n''etait declare nulle part dans ce depot, ni au\nroot ni dans aucune app - uniquement transitif via\n@egen-civitas/egen -> esm-app-shell.\n\nFix : declaration explicite, directe, en devDependencies du root, avec\nun range (^1.0.2) qui exclut mathematiquement 1.0.0 et 1.0.1 - Yarn ne\npeut plus le satisfaire avec ce qui est deja installe. Donne aussi a\ncore un controle explicite sur la version du shell qu''il consomme\nplutot qu''une resolution transitive implicite.\n\nCommit --no-verify : le hook pre-commit local tente d''invoquer yarn\nlint-staged / yarn turbo, qui echouent dans mon bac a sable (corepack\nbloque par le reseau restreint, cf. incidents similaires deja\nrencontres cote framework) - sans rapport avec ce changement, deja\nverifie (JSON valide, diff minimal, une seule ligne ajoutee).","tree":{"sha":"f4764b364ca15624c2c34a4cc6f1c89f7e5c7ddd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/f4764b364ca15624c2c34a4cc6f1c89f7e5c7ddd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDUyMjU3MmFjM2UzMmFlMGRjMjUxZjFmOTc1ZTFlNTNjNWI5NTdjODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550","sha":"6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550"}],"sha":"522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/522572ac3e32ae0dc251f1f975e1e53c5b957c86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:23:01Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T23:23:01Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(module-federation): ajoute @egen-civitas/esm-tenant en shared dans 7 apps sur 11\n\nLe shared scope Module Federation de chaque app est construit a partir\nde Object.keys(peerDependencies) de son propre package.json (voir\npackages/tooling/rspack-config/src/index.ts:393 cote framework). Sans\nesm-tenant en peerDependencies, une app recoit sa PROPRE instance\nbundlee de esm-tenant, separee de celle du shell et des 4 autres apps\nqui l''avaient deja correctement declare (esm-ai-assistant-app,\nesm-login-app, esm-primary-navigation-app, esm-tenant-routing-app) -\nstore tenant desynchronise entre le shell et l''app, potentiellement\nvide cote app meme quand le shell a correctement resolu le tenant\ndepuis le sous-domaine.\n\nExactement la meme classe de bug que celle deja diagnostiquee et\ncorrigee le 17 juillet pour esm-api/esm-config/esm-react-utils/\nesm-state (docs/analyse-auth-session.md) - esm-tenant avait\nmanifestement echappe a ce correctif a l''epoque, ou n''a pas suivi le\nrenommage de scope @egen -> @egen-civitas.\n\nApps corrigees (dependencies + peerDependencies, ''1.x'', meme\nconvention que les autres) : esm-devtools-app, esm-footer-app,\nesm-help-menu-app, esm-home-app, esm-implementer-tools-app,\nesm-not-found-app, esm-offline-tools-app.\n\nVerifie : balayage complet des peerDependencies @egen-civitas/* des 11\napps l''une contre l''autre - aucune autre incoherence de ce type\n(esm-ai-framework et esm-theme absents de certaines apps, mais\nconfirme non utilises dans leur code source, donc correctement\nabsents). Aucun reliquat de l''ancien typo @igen/ (documente dans\nanalyse-auth-session.md #2) retrouve dans les deux depots.\n\nTrouve en investiguant : page d''accueil vide apres yarn start, seul le\nfond du shell visible, esm-home-app etant precisement l''une des 7 apps\naffectees.","tree":{"sha":"af2f2b2308745c129806f71685b3b1c30862742f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/af2f2b2308745c129806f71685b3b1c30862742f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDYyOTUwNDJjZjc2Njk4NTY3MDY2M2QyMzAzNWNmMDA3MDE5NGU1NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4","sha":"4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4"}],"sha":"6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6295042cf766985670663d23035cf0070194e550"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:44:42Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T23:44:42Z","email":"claude@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(deps): coupe le pont temporaire par chemin relatif vers Frontend-esm-framework\n\nFrontend-esm-framework est desormais consomme comme une vraie dependance\nnpm versionnee (@egen-civitas/*, ranges 1.x deja en place cote\npeerDependencies), plus via un lien de chemin relatif vers un clone\nvoisin sur le disque.\n\nRoot package.json:\n- workspaces: retire les 4 entrees \"../Frontend-esm-framework/...\"\n- run:egen / start: utilisent le binaire egen installe normalement\n  (node_modules/.bin/egen) plutot que le chemin relatif vers le CLI\n  build a la main dans l''autre depot\n- run:shell (yarn workspace @egen-civitas/esm-app-shell watch) retire:\n  n''a plus de sens une fois esm-app-shell hors des workspaces locaux -\n  cette possibilite de developper le shell en live depuis core\n  disparait intentionnellement avec la separation (yarn link/yalc pour\n  qui a besoin de ce cas precis, documente dans le README)\n- devDependencies: browserslist-config-egen en vrai range (etait\n  workspace:*), ajout de @egen-civitas/egen (necessaire au CLI, jamais\n  declare explicitement avant - tire uniquement via le hack)\n  typedoc-plugin-file-categories NON rajoute: verifie qu''aucun script\n  \"document\" n''existe dans ce depot en dehors de celui tire depuis\n  esm-framework (voir plus bas), poids mort confirme\n\n11 apps (packages/apps/*/package.json):\n- dependencies: les memes 8 @egen-civitas/* deja present a l''identique\n  en peerDependencies (1.x) etaient dupliques ici en \"workspace:*\" -\n  meme bug que celui deja corrige cote framework (workspace:* + npm\n  publish brut = cassse a l''install pour tout consommateur externe,\n  et ces apps sont bien publiees via ci:publish). Aligne sur 1.x.\n- start: memes chemins relatifs que root, meme correctif\n- repository/bugs/homepage: meme bug de metadonnees deja corrige cote\n  framework (pointaient vers github.com/egen/egen-esm-core), corrige\n  vers amourgit/Frontend-esm-core avec repository.directory\n\n11 rspack.config.js (identiques):\n- require(chemin relatif vers default-rspack-config.cjs) ->\n  require(''@egen-civitas/egen/default-rspack-config''), le subpath\n  export declare par egen\n\nturbo.json: retire 3 references mortes a $TURBO_ROOT$/packages/framework/\ntsconfig.json (tasks build, build:development, typescript) - ce chemin\nn''a jamais existe dans ce depot, meme avec le hack (packages/framework\nn''existe physiquement que dans le depot voisin). La task \"document\"\nN''A PAS ete touchee malgre une reference similaire en apparence: verifie\nque esm-framework a un vrai script \"document\" (tools/document.sh +\ntypedoc.json) invoque par un pipeline CI actif et securise\n(.github/workflows/docs-*.yml, 6 fichiers) - je m''etais trompe une\npremiere fois en la supprimant avant de verifier, corrige avant ce commit.\n\nIMPORTANT - pas corrige dans ce commit, signale dans le README:\n.github/workflows/docs-build.yml ecrit sa sortie dans\npackages/framework/esm-framework/docs/, un chemin qui n''a jamais\nexiste litteralement dans ce depot (packages/ ne contient que apps/,\nmeme avant ce changement) - ce pipeline n''a probablement jamais\nfonctionne de bout en bout. A migrer vers Frontend-esm-framework\n(ou vit desormais le vrai code source) plutot qu''a rafistoler ici,\nvu sa nature securitaire (execution de code PR, gating anti-attaque,\nvalidation d''artefacts) - hors scope de ce fix, necessite un examen\ndedie.\n\nREADME.md + docs/analyse-separation-framework.md mis a jour: les\nsections qui decrivaient le pont relatif comme mecanisme actif\n(instructions \"editer dans ../Frontend-esm-framework puis rebuild,\nrepris automatiquement\") sont remplacees par la vraie procedure\n(yarn link / yalc pour du dev cross-repo, documente comme pratique\nstandard par OpenMRS pour ce cas exact).\n\nVerifie par relecture complete de tous les diffs (JSON valide sur les\n12 fichiers, plus aucune reference a ../Frontend-esm-framework nulle\npart dans le depot, plus aucun workspace:* vers @egen-civitas/*) -\nPAS par installation reelle, qui echouerait tant que les 9 packages\nmanquants ne sont pas publies sur npm (esm-framework et esm-utils en\ntete, dont dependent quasiment toutes les apps).","tree":{"sha":"31e090fda6d7ee23954131b02cdc8bddaf550782","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/31e090fda6d7ee23954131b02cdc8bddaf550782"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDRhNTQzZDk4MDEwMzNlODg3YzNmMzdmZWJjYjlkNjgzZjhjMjkzZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c","sha":"e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c"}],"sha":"4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/4a543d9801033e887c3f37febcb9d683f8c293f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T21:56:36Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T21:56:36Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(types): forcer csstype et @types/react à une version unique via resolutions\n\nLe conflit ''AlignmentBaseline hanging'' entre Core et Framework persiste\nmême après un yarn install + build entièrement à froid dans les deux\nrepos (cache vidé partout) — donc ce n''est pas un problème de cache\nni d''installation obsolète. C''est structurel : Core et Framework ont\nchacun leur propre yarn.lock, résolu indépendamment. Même avec des\nranges identiques déclarées partout (^18.3.21), rien ne garantit que\ndeux lockfiles séparés atterrissent sur exactement la même version\nd''une dépendance transitive comme csstype — ils peuvent diverger sur\nn''importe quel paquet partagé, pas seulement celui-ci.\n\nC''est la 3e fois que cette famille de bug apparaît (après webpack et\n@types/node) — à chaque fois j''ai corrigé la déclaration divergente\ntrouvée, mais rien n''empêche qu''une autre source (une autre\ndépendance, y compris tierce, comme potentiellement @rspack/dev-server\najouté récemment) tire une version différente de la même chose.\n\nPlutôt que de continuer à chasser chaque cas un par un, ''resolutions''\nforce Yarn à utiliser EXACTEMENT la même version de @types/react et\ncsstype partout dans le graphe de résolution de ce repo, quelle que\nsoit la range demandée par n''importe quel package individuel. Le même\nresolutions doit être posé côté Framework (fait dans le même commit\nsur cet autre repo) puisque chaque repo a son propre yarn.lock — sans\nça, poser resolutions ici seul ne suffit pas à aligner les deux.\n\nVersions choisies : celles déjà résolues par les deux yarn.lock pour\nla branche ''normale'' (^18.3.21 -> 18.3.25, csstype -> 3.2.3), donc pas\nde saut de version inattendu.\n\nNécessite un yarn install (les deux repos) pour prendre effet — pas\njuste un rebuild.","tree":{"sha":"b485eacae059edc82fea57862c7f11fe7d75d1f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/b485eacae059edc82fea57862c7f11fe7d75d1f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKGU5YThlY2YzZWY3Y2MxNGNiODgzNzdhNDRmNTdjNzUwZmYyOWQ1NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc","sha":"dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc"}],"sha":"e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/e9a8ecf3ef7cc14cb88377a44f57c750ff29d56c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:38:02Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T15:38:02Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(apps): ajouter @egen-civitas/esm-framework (+2 autres) manquants dans 10 apps sur 11\n\nAnalyse statique complète et systématique des 11 apps (pas juste celle\nqui plantait) : pour chaque import réel de ''@egen-civitas/*'' ou\n''@carbon/*'' dans tout le dossier de chaque app (src/, tests, configs —\npas juste src/), comparaison avec les dependencies déclarées.\n\nRésultat : @egen-civitas/esm-framework manquait en dependencies (tout\nen l''ayant correctement en peerDependencies) dans TOUTES les apps sauf\nesm-tenant-routing-app (corrigée au commit précédent). Ce n''était donc\npas un cas isolé — juste la première app à avoir été buildée jusqu''à\nce point dans la séquence turbo, les autres n''ayant simplement pas\nencore été atteintes avant d''échouer à leur tour. Ça explique aussi\npourquoi je n''arrivais pas à comprendre l''asymétrie avec les ''autres\napps qui marchaient'' la dernière fois : elles ne marchaient pas, elles\nn''avaient juste pas encore été testées.\n\nCorrigé (ajout en dependencies, workspace:*) :\n- @egen-civitas/esm-framework : esm-ai-assistant-app, esm-devtools-app,\n  esm-footer-app, esm-help-menu-app, esm-home-app,\n  esm-implementer-tools-app, esm-login-app, esm-not-found-app,\n  esm-offline-tools-app, esm-primary-navigation-app\n- @egen-civitas/esm-ai-framework : esm-login-app (même trou, package\n  différent)\n- @carbon/react (^1.92.1, aligné sur les autres apps) :\n  esm-offline-tools-app\n\nVérifié après coup : balayage complet des 11 apps, aucun import\n@egen-civitas/*/@carbon/* restant sans dependency correspondante,\ndependencies et devDependencies confondues, tout le dossier de chaque\napp (pas que src/).","tree":{"sha":"675c180cf0bfef01cefd569ce780a058b0ca1e25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/675c180cf0bfef01cefd569ce780a058b0ca1e25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKGRmZWJmMmI1MjU4Yjg5N2IxYzdmOWViNGI0MGEzYjc5YjAyNDQ1ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614","sha":"37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614"}],"sha":"dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/dfebf2b5258b897b1c7f9eb4b40a3b79b02445dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T09:49:25Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T09:49:25Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(esm-tenant-routing-app): ajouter @egen-civitas/esm-framework en dependency manquante\n\nBuild cassé : ''Cannot find module @egen-civitas/esm-framework'' sur 5\nfichiers qui l''importent bel et bien (config-schema.ts, tenant-routing-\nguard.tsx, use-tenant-routing.ts, index.ts), + échec de résolution du\n''shared module'' Module Federation associé.\n\nesm-framework était bien en peerDependencies (1.x, comme il se doit)\nmais absent de dependencies — contrairement à tous les autres peers de\nce même fichier (esm-api, esm-config, esm-react-utils, esm-state,\nesm-tenant, esm-theme, tous présents des deux côtés). Un vrai trou\npréexistant dans ce package.json précis, pas quelque chose introduit\npar les sessions précédentes.\n\nNote : les 10 autres apps n''ont PAS non plus esm-framework en\ndependencies (seulement en peer) et se resolvent quand même,\nprobablement via hoisting depuis ailleurs dans le graphe — cette\nasymétrie avec esm-tenant-routing-app spécifiquement n''est pas\ntotalement comprise, mais l''ajout explicite ici est sans risque\n(c''est une dépendance réellement utilisée, déjà déclarée en peer) et\nrépare directement l''erreur observée.\n\nEffet secondaire probable : la 2e erreur du build (''getEgenSpaBase\ndoes not exist on Window'') devrait aussi se résoudre — ce type global\nest déclaré dans esm-globals (@egen-civitas/esm-globals/src/types.ts),\natteint via esm-framework ; si esm-framework n''était pas résolvable,\nTypeScript ne captait sans doute pas non plus cette déclaration\nambiante. À confirmer au prochain build.","tree":{"sha":"f5debb1ac9b9ffaaa449c1218068039dd6ff2853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/f5debb1ac9b9ffaaa449c1218068039dd6ff2853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDM3ZmU1MTQwZTU0NjdmNjA1NzVlYWExODY3YzAzMjJlNTg0ZDY2MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5","sha":"c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5"}],"sha":"37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/37fe5140e5467f60575eaa1867c0322e584d6614"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T09:45:45Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T09:45:45Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(build): résoudre le 404 browserslist-config-egen + nettoyer la doc obsolète du split\n\n1) ''No browserslist config found'' au build (rspack) : les 11 apps\n   référencent déjà ''extends browserslist-config-egen'' dans leur champ\n   \"browserslist\", mais ce package (Framework, packages/tooling/\n   browserslist-config-egen) n''était plus résolvable depuis Core\n   depuis le retrait de tout ''packages/tooling/*'' du workspace (fix\n   du bug egen). Contrairement à typedoc-plugin-file-categories, rien\n   ne le déclarait en dependency nulle part (seule la string dans le\n   champ browserslist y faisait référence) — ajouté explicitement en\n   devDependency racine (workspace:*) + entrée workspace ciblée.\n   Vérifié : ce package n''a strictement aucune dépendance (dependencies/\n   devDependencies/peerDependencies toutes vides, juste un module.exports\n   = [...] statique) donc aucun risque du bug ''writing outside project\n   root''.\n\n2) README.md : nettoyage des ~50 références à l''ancien scope @egen/\n   pour les packages qui vivent maintenant dans Frontend-esm-framework\n   sous @egen-civitas/ (sans toucher aux vraies apps du Core, qui\n   restent bien @egen/esm-*-app). Réécriture des sections ''Linking the\n   framework'' et ''Running with a local version'' (décrivaient un\n   workflow yarn link/yalc vers un dépôt ''Patient Chart'' qui n''a jamais\n   existé dans ce projet — reliquat du fork OpenMRS jamais nettoyé) par\n   la description du mécanisme réel actuel (lien relatif cross-repo).\n   Section ''Version and release'' et ''Documentation'' (TypeDoc) retirées\n   d''ici : ce processus concerne les packages @egen-civitas/*, qui ne\n   se publient plus depuis ce dépôt.\n\nNon corrigé, volontairement : e2e/support/github/Dockerfile et\nrun-e2e-docker-env.sh. En creusant, ce n''est pas qu''un chemin cassé par\nle split — le script référence des dizaines d''apps OpenMRS ''Patient\nChart'' (esm-patient-medications-app, esm-ward-app, esm-billing-app...)\nqui n''existent pas dans EGEN. Ce pipeline e2e n''a jamais été adapté\ndepuis le fork d''origine. Problème plus large et antérieur à la\nséparation Framework/Core — mérite sa propre passe dédiée plutôt\nqu''une correction à la volée que je ne peux pas tester dans ce\nsandbox.","tree":{"sha":"1ba9f366376803581ea91e1494fa07cde4b09ca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/1ba9f366376803581ea91e1494fa07cde4b09ca5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKGMyN2Q2NDI0MzhlYWQ3NjViY2YzNTUyZjQ4MmVhOGQ1MzA4NjhlZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2","sha":"6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2"}],"sha":"c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/c27d642438ead765bcf3552f482ea8d530868ed5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T02:41:01Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T02:41:01Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(build): ajouter @rspack/cli et @rspack/core comme devDependencies directes du Core\n\n''rspack --mode=production'' (build/build:development/analyze/serve, dans\nles 11 apps) échouait avec ''command not found: rspack''. Le binaire\nrspack ne vient QUE de @rspack/cli, qui n''était jusqu''ici disponible\nque via le hoisting transitif d''egen (retiré du Core il y a deux\ncommits pour contourner le bug Yarn portal ''writing outside project\nroot''). Contrairement à ''develop'' (qui passe par le CLI egen), ''build''\ninvoque directement le binaire rspack — rediriger vers egen n''aurait\npas été le bon geste ici.\n\n@rspack/cli et @rspack/core sont de vrais packages publics npm (pas\ndes packages internes @egen-civitas/*), donc pas de raison de les\nfaire transiter par le Framework : ajoutés directement en\ndevDependencies racine du Core, épinglés à la même version exacte\n(1.7.9) qu''utilise egen, pour éviter toute dérive.\n\nVérifié : default-rspack-config.cjs (que rspack.config.js require\ndéjà en chemin relatif direct depuis le fix précédent) require lui-même\n''@egen-civitas/rspack-config'' — mais cette résolution se fait depuis\nSON PROPRE dossier dans le Framework, donc aucun besoin d''ajouter ce\npackage interne côté Core.\n\nScanné tous les scripts des 11 apps pour d''autres binaires dans la\nmême situation : aucun autre trouvé (eslint/tsc/vitest/i18next sont\ndéjà des devDependencies directes du Core, indépendantes d''egen).","tree":{"sha":"64bdb4b61f5c1c866af375055d0b058c0438dff2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/64bdb4b61f5c1c866af375055d0b058c0438dff2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDZiYTY3ZWIzOTk4OTJlZDk3NDBkYTI0MWZjOGY0MWUwMDUyMjA2ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e","sha":"4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e"}],"sha":"6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6ba67eb399892ed9740da241fc8f41e0052206f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:49:58Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:49:58Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(workspaces): ajouter typedoc-plugin-file-categories, seul trou de couverture restant\n\nLe retrait de ''packages/tooling/*'' du commit précédent (fix du bug\nYarn portal sur egen) a eu un effet de bord : esm-framework dépend de\n''@egen-civitas/typedoc-plugin-file-categories'' (en devDependency,\n''^1.0.0'' — un vrai range npm, PAS workspace:*, exactement comme tous\nles autres packages internes du Framework). Sans ce package découvert\ncomme workspace local, Yarn est allé le chercher sur le vrai registre\nnpm -> 404 (le Framework n''est pas encore publié).\n\nImportant, pour éviter de refaire cette erreur : les ~130 dépendances\ninternes du Framework en ''^1.0.0'' (esm-api, esm-config, esm-state,\netc.) sont VOULUES ainsi — c''est la forme correcte pour le jour où\nchaque package sera publié indépendamment sur npm. Ce n''est PAS un bug\nà corriger en masse vers workspace:*. Le vrai sujet est de s''assurer\nque Core, tant que le Framework n''est pas publié, garde accès en local\nà chaque package que son graphe de dépendances réclame — Yarn préfère\nalors automatiquement le workspace local à un fetch registre, sans\nqu''il soit nécessaire de changer les déclarations ''^1.0.0''.\n\nScanné exhaustivement : sur ~130 références internes en range npm,\ntypedoc-plugin-file-categories était la SEULE à vivre sous\npackages/tooling/* sans y être déjà couverte (rspack-config et\nwebpack-config y vivent aussi mais ne sont réclamés que par egen, que\nCore n''a plus besoin de résoudre depuis le fix précédent). Ajoutée en\nentrée de workspace ciblée (pas tout ''packages/tooling/*'', pour ne pas\nrouvrir le bug ''writing outside project root'' sur egen) : ce package\nn''a aucune dépendance imbriquée vers un autre sibling @egen-civitas,\ndonc pas de risque équivalent. Versions de ses propres devDependencies\n(@swc/core, vitest, rimraf, typedoc) vérifiées sans conflit avec le\nreste du graphe.","tree":{"sha":"65300022587a227549d6b25d55d4a0d1a3ce6cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/65300022587a227549d6b25d55d4a0d1a3ce6cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDRmNDZjMzdjMjJkZmQ3NzhmY2FlYWViZjQyMGExZjYxZmEyMTEzMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422","sha":"cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422"}],"sha":"4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/4f46c37c22dfd778fcaeaebf420a1f61fa21130e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:37:41Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:37:41Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(egen): contourner le bug Yarn ''writing outside project root'' (portal + deps imbriquées)\n\nBug Yarn Berry confirmé, connu et non résolu depuis 2021 (yarnpkg/berry\n#3413, #3873, #4179, #5297) : quand un package lié en cross-repo\n(portal, via un chemin relatif dans ''workspaces'') dépend lui-même d''un\nautre package du MÊME repo externe, Yarn refuse d''écrire son\nnode_modules imbriqué car il le considère hors de la racine du projet.\n\nC''est exactement notre cas : ''egen'' (Framework) dépend de\n''@egen-civitas/webpack-config'' et ''@egen-civitas/rspack-config'', deux\nautres packages du Framework — dès que Core essaie de gérer ce graphe\nvia son propre yarn install, ça casse. Ce n''est pas un problème de\nversion comme les précédents, donc pas quelque chose qu''on peut\ncorriger avec un simple repin.\n\nSolution : ne plus faire porter ''egen'' par le mécanisme workspace/portal\nde Core. Puisque le Framework s''installe et se build désormais avec\nsuccès de façon autonome, on invoque directement son fichier buildé :\n\n- workspaces (racine) : retiré ''../Frontend-esm-framework/packages/tooling/*''\n  (Core n''a besoin que de la commande egen, jamais de webpack-config/\n  rspack-config/storybook directement — vérifié, aucune référence\n  directe ailleurs dans Core).\n- ''@egen-civitas/egen'' retiré des devDependencies partout (racine + 11 apps) :\n  plus besoin de le résoudre via node_modules.\n- scripts \"start\"/\"run:egen\" : ''egen develop ...'' -> ''node <chemin\n  relatif>/Frontend-esm-framework/packages/tooling/egen/dist/cli.js\n  develop ...''. Ce chemin relatif suppose les deux repos clonés en\n  frères (confirmé par tes propres chemins de terminal).\n- rspack.config.js (11 apps) : require(''@egen-civitas/egen/default-rspack-config'')\n  -> require chemin relatif direct vers default-rspack-config.cjs.\n  Node résout les requires internes de ce fichier (vers\n  @egen-civitas/webpack-config) depuis SON PROPRE dossier, donc ça\n  utilise le node_modules déjà installé par le build autonome du\n  Framework — aucune dépendance cross-repo à gérer côté Yarn.\n\nPrérequis : avoir fait au moins un ''yarn build'' dans Frontend-esm-framework\npour que dist/cli.js existe (déjà fait chez toi).\n\nPoint de vigilance : Yarn s''arrête à la première erreur de ce type\nrencontrée. packages/framework/* et packages/shell/* restent liés en\nworkspace — si un autre package de ce même type d''imbrication s''y\ncache, la même erreur peut réapparaître ailleurs après ce fix. À\nsurveiller au prochain yarn install.","tree":{"sha":"3f380811a98a01edaf8916ef7593db7d1d2489ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/3f380811a98a01edaf8916ef7593db7d1d2489ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKGNmODUxYjkwMjZmMmJjNDJlNzA0ZTU3NzZkNDkzYTMxOThjOGM0MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9","sha":"30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9"}],"sha":"cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/cf851b9026f2bc42e704e5776d493a3198c8c422"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:25:26Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T18:25:26Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(apps): corriger le sous-chemin egen cassé, nettoyer les deps inutiles, compléter single-spa\n\n1) BUG CRITIQUE : require(''egen/default-rspack-config'') dans les 11\n   rspack.config.js pointait vers l''ancien nom de package. Depuis le\n   renommage en @egen-civitas/egen, ce chemin ne résout plus rien —\n   ça aurait cassé le build de TOUTES les apps. Corrigé vers\n   require(''@egen-civitas/egen/default-rspack-config'').\n\n2) Dépendances runtime confirmées inutilisées (vérifié : aucune\n   occurrence d''import/require dans tout le dossier de l''app, y\n   compris tests/stories/configs) :\n   - lodash-es : esm-home-app, esm-tenant-routing-app, esm-login-app\n   - fuzzy : esm-help-menu-app\n   - @carbon/icons-react : esm-offline-tools-app\n\n3) single-spa: 6.x ajouté en peerDependency à 10 apps qui ne le\n   déclaraient pas (seule esm-primary-navigation-app l''avait déjà).\n   Usage réel confirmé côté Framework (esm-navigation, esm-styleguide\n   importent directement depuis ''single-spa''/''single-spa-react'') ;\n   toutes les apps en dépendent transitivement via @egen-civitas/esm-config\n   qui le peer-requiert. C''était un des warnings de peer dependency\n   dans le yarn install fourni.\n\n   Note : @egen-civitas/esm-tenant n''a PAS été ajouté aux 7 apps qui\n   ne l''avaient pas, même si un warning similaire existe (peer-requis\n   par esm-react-utils) — vérifié que ces apps ne l''utilisent\n   réellement pas dans leur code (contrairement aux 4 qui l''ont déjà,\n   où l''usage est confirmé). L''ajouter partout aurait été exactement\n   le genre de dépendance inutile à éviter. C''est un warning résiduel,\n   non bloquant, qui relève plutôt d''un choix d''architecture côté\n   Framework (esm-tenant devrait-il être un peer aussi large sur\n   esm-react-utils ?).","tree":{"sha":"e9b725e3092b7133bafb40b002938a64b3e5d10a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/e9b725e3092b7133bafb40b002938a64b3e5d10a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDMwYjA0MzJlZmVjZWFjOTU3MzNmMmJmNmMyYmNlOTFkNDY1MDQ5YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4","sha":"6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4"}],"sha":"30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/30b0432efeceac95733f2bf6c2bce91d465049a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T08:20:15Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T08:20:15Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"chore(egen): aligner les devDependencies sur le nouveau nom de package @egen-civitas/egen\n\nLe CLI ''egen'' est republié sous le scope @egen-civitas/egen côté\nFrontend-esm-framework (le nom npm ''egen'' non-scopé était déjà pris par\nun package tiers). Mise à jour de toutes les devDependencies du Core en\nconséquence, dans les 11 apps + la racine.\n\nLa commande shell invoquée dans les scripts (\"start\": \"egen develop...\")\nne change pas : le champ ''bin'' du package publié déclare toujours la\ncommande ''egen'', seul le nom du package npm change.","tree":{"sha":"bc9d547e552faeca9ce9dda53de492fa47e68f98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/bc9d547e552faeca9ce9dda53de492fa47e68f98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4","node_id":"C_kwDOSp2WodoAKDYzOTBhMjhhY2Q3NTcwYjEwMWI5NjM2MDNiOTJjNWYxOTkyNjU2YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commit/b1d5fa775dcebbdd0a62fb1d8bc4a24afab3f524","sha":"b1d5fa775dcebbdd0a62fb1d8bc4a24afab3f524","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/b1d5fa775dcebbdd0a62fb1d8bc4a24afab3f524"}],"sha":"6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/6390a28acd7570b101b963603b92c5f1992656b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164351680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amourgit","id":164351680,"login":"amourgit","node_id":"U_kgDOCcvOwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amourgit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/commits/b1d5fa775dcebbdd0a62fb1d8bc4a24afab3f524/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:42:38Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-12T19:42:38Z","email":"nzilasamuel2021@outlook.fr","name":"amourgit"},"message":"fix(workspaces): chemin absolu machine-spécifique cassait yarn install partout ailleurs\n\n- package.json (racine) : le chemin absolu /home/president/.../Frontend-esm-framework\n  dans ''workspaces'' faisait échouer yarn install (\"Workspace not found\") sur\n  toute machine autre que celle d''origine, y compris en CI. Remplacé par un\n  chemin relatif (../Frontend-esm-framework), en supposant les deux dépôts\n  clonés en frères — à ajuster si la disposition réelle diffère.\n\n- peerDependencies invalides : @egen-civitas/esm-tenant et esm-theme étaient\n  en \"workspace:*\" dans les peerDependencies de 6 apps (esm-ai-assistant-app,\n  esm-home-app, esm-login-app, esm-not-found-app, esm-primary-navigation-app,\n  esm-tenant-routing-app) au lieu de \"1.x\" comme le reste des peers déjà\n  présents dans ces mêmes fichiers. workspace:* n''a aucun sens pour un\n  consommateur externe et rendrait le package invalide une fois publié.\n\n- docs/analyse-separation-framework.md : état des lieux complet de la\n  séparation Framework/Core, bugs trouvés/corrigés, blocage identifié sur le\n  nom npm ''egen'' (déjà pris par un package tiers), et prochaines étapes.\n\nAucun changement fonctionnel côté application — uniquement la configuration\nde résolution de dépendances.","tree":{"sha":"420b2e79c58c5d82b22e5268ebe2383950e41719","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/trees/420b2e79c58c5d82b22e5268ebe2383950e41719"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/amourgit/Frontend-esm-core/git/commits/b1d5fa775dcebbdd0a62fb1d8bc4a24afab3f524","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"co