://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/5e07edc4d01c7aa127f5cab4b15b59218d631cef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T17:01:33Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T17:01:33Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(inference): add ORT model cache for fast warm-boot session init\n\nOn first load of any .onnx model, serialize the optimized graph to\n~/.cache/wintermute/models/<stem>.ort via with_optimization_level(All) +\nwith_optimized_model_path. On subsequent boots, load from the cached\n.ort if it is newer than the source .onnx, skipping graph optimization\nand cutting session init from ~2s to <100ms. Falls back to raw .onnx\non any cache failure (fail-open). Logs model_cache=hit/miss/written at\nINFO level so the improvement is visible in journalctl. Adds 8 unit\ntests covering cache path computation, validity check, and fallback.\n\nImplements PRD wm-audio-ort-cache AC1-6.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a25f8ebd931c2aa14ad05af6f524bfb7a080ef73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/a25f8ebd931c2aa14ad05af6f524bfb7a080ef73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/5e0