late each smoke bus to its\nown temp state file. Suite now green (128 unit + bus smoke, 4 hw ignored).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"845d441a66fd7f68b94922c4cdb3e44fac04f5f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/845d441a66fd7f68b94922c4cdb3e44fac04f5f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/95516f35a2bc533410bf9b14c4e2210a4c868e4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/95516f35a2bc533410bf9b14c4e2210a4c868e4c","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDk1NTE2ZjM1YTJiYzUzMzQxMGJmOWIxNGM0ZTIyMTBhNGM4NjhlNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053","sha":"133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053"}],"sha":"95516f35a2bc533410bf9b14c4e2210a4c868e4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/95516f35a2bc533410bf9b14c4e2210a4c868e4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T07:21:43Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T07:21:43Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(vad): wire + rewrite VAD for silero v5.1 (was never loaded; v4 API; bad extract)\n\nThe VAD path was dead three ways, so the daemon never emitted speech.start:\n- load_or_null_vad was never called in daemon_main → ran NullVadDetector.\n- OnnxVadDetector targeted silero v4 (separate h/c [2,1,64] states, hn/cn\n  outputs) but the installed model is v5.1 (single state [2,1,128], stateN).\n- the [1,1] `output` was read with try_extract_scalar → always 0.0.\n\nFixes: SileroState is now a single [2,1,128] state; process() uses\ninput[1,N]/state/sr → output/stateN; output extracted via try_extract_tensor;\nadded Daemon::with_vad_detector_arc and wired load_or_null_vad in daemon_main.\nModel installed at /usr/share/wintermute/models/vad/silero_vad.onnx\n(fetch-models). Verified: silero scores ~0.99 on clear speech, daemon emits\nspeech.start/end, and the full turn (wake→VAD→STT→dialog→brain→TTS) flows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2df736b60ddd64c9272a66c8e9967bee5672964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/a2df736b60ddd64c9272a66c8e9967bee5672964"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDEzM2M3ODczZDc5ZTI0ZmUzNzZkMGYwZDk1MjliNWZlYWM4MWYwNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135","sha":"caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135"}],"sha":"133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/133c7873d79e24fe376d0f0d9529b5feac81f053"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:34:57Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:34:57Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"fix(wake): extract [1,1] output as tensor, not scalar — wake never fired\n\nOnnxWakeDetector::process read the model''s [1,1] output with\n`try_extract_scalar::<f32>()`, which only succeeds on a 0-D scalar. On\nthe rank-2 [1,1] output it always returned Err, and `.unwrap_or(0.0)`\nsilently substituted 0.0 — so confidence was 0.0 on EVERY inference,\nprocess() always returned NotDetected, and the wake word never fired\nregardless of model, mic, or input.\n\nConfirmed end-to-end: the model scores real-voice \"wintermute\" at\n~1.0 offline and on its held-out test split (0.987), the mic captures\ncleanly, and features.rs is correct — but the daemon discarded every\nresult. With the tensor extraction fixed, live wake fires reliably at\nconfidence 0.93-1.0 (silence ~0.0001), publishing wm.audio.wake.\n\nExtract the [1,1] tensor and take its first element instead (mirrors\nthe VAD path''s try_extract_tensor usage).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"633085b9234083f08da3b461c3085d36976b2c5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/633085b9234083f08da3b461c3085d36976b2c5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKGNhYWY2NDFlZjZlOTE1ZDI1NGNiOWE5YWZkYzhhNzk5MGIyMWIxMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073","sha":"3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073"}],"sha":"caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/caaf641ef6e915d254cb9a9afdc8a7990b21b135"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:02:11Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:02:11Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"Merge feat/wire-wintermute-wake: load trained wintermute wake model + real-voice training harness\n\nWires wm-audio to load the locally-trained wake model at startup (was\nnever loaded outside tests), adds the WakeWord::Wintermute variant, fixes\nthe agorabus-0.9 build break, and lands the real-voice capture + retrain\nharness under contrib/. Model quality on real voice still needs a larger\ncapture (see project_wintermute_wake_training); the wiring + pipeline are\nproven correct.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd74d246156322da37aaee60da85bf300e941b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/dd74d246156322da37aaee60da85bf300e941b54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDNlNjYxYWQ4NGY2NWQ2NDIwZGM1ZmVkZGQyZWEyMTY0MWQ2MzkwNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017","sha":"2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48","sha":"fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48"}],"sha":"3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/3e661ad84f65d6420dc5feddd2ea21641d639073"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:01:58Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T06:01:58Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"contrib(wake-train): real-voice capture + anti-overfit retrain tuning\n\nAdds the real-voice workflow and the tuning learned from three retrain\nrounds on captured human \"wintermute\" utterances:\n\n- capture-wintermute.sh: prompts + records single-utterance clips, rejects\n  too-quiet takes, resumable. The positives source for a personal model.\n- retrain-realvoice.sh: rebuild positives real-heavy (OVERSAMPLE_REAL /\n  SYNTH_KEEP knobs), reuse the 30GB negatives, retrain from the features\n  stage.\n- write_config.py: batch_size 128->64 (15GB/no-swap OOM''d at 128) and\n  stronger SpecAugment (time[10]/freq[7]) to fight overfitting.\n- gen_features.py: training augmentation rep 2->8 and broader augmentation\n  probabilities (pitch/EQ/distortion/color-noise) so few real clips\n  generalise instead of being memorised.\n\nFindings (see project_wintermute_wake_training): export/features/scale/\nwiring all proven correct; model is amplitude-invariant. 120 single-session\nclips overfit (held-out real voice 0.0007 synthetic -> 0.015 -> 0.41 with\nthese settings, but still inconsistent). Reliable real-voice wake needs a\nlarger, more varied capture; harness is ready for it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd74d246156322da37aaee60da85bf300e941b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/dd74d246156322da37aaee60da85bf300e941b54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKGZjZDdlN2FjNTkwZGMyZjUxMjQzYTZkYmM3OWM0ZmY4ZTQ0MWZiNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0","sha":"feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0"}],"sha":"fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/fcd7e7ac590dc2f51243a6dbc79c4ff8e441fb48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:11:12Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T04:11:12Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"contrib(wake-train): durable home for the fixed training harness\n\nThe training recipe that produces wintermute.onnx only existed in a\nbuild worktree that /build git-reset away (losing the .venv + 30GB\ndata + checkpoints). Recovered from git tag wake-word-harness-recovered\nand committed here so it can''t be lost again, with three latent bugs\nin the captured copy fixed:\n\n- install.sh: vendor + editable-install kahrendt/microWakeWord (the\n  OHF-Voice fork dropped the microwakeword.audio subpackage the\n  pipeline imports).\n- install_torch.sh: pin datasets<4 (soundfile decode); datasets>=4\n  routes audio through torchcodec whose native libs need ffmpeg 4-7\n  + CUDA and fail on this CPU/ffmpeg-8 box. Drop torchcodec.\n- run-full-train.sh: one-shot driver (install -> torch -> prefetch\n  -> train) for a stable-dir run outside .build-worktrees.\n\nGenerated/vendored artifacts (.venv, out/, datasets, *.onnx, cloned\nupstreams) stay gitignored — the harness is the source of truth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4ec6b69f352bfd69c4c1fe5202d0d636dfddedc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/a4ec6b69f352bfd69c4c1fe5202d0d636dfddedc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKGZlYWRiMjcwNDYxMDBkZDc1Njk0ODA1MWRlNDMwOTIwMzBlMmFhYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86","sha":"1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86"}],"sha":"feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/feadb27046100dd756948051de43092030e2aab0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:23:38Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T03:23:38Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(wake): wire the locally-trained wintermute wake model at startup\n\nThe ONNX wake detector + bit-exact mel front-end already existed, but\nnothing loaded a model: `load_or_null_wake` was only ever called in\ntests, so `daemon_main` always ran the NullWakeDetector and wake never\nfired regardless of an installed model. And the `WakeWord` enum had no\n`wintermute` variant, so the only model present on disk wasn''t even\nselectable.\n\n- config: add `WakeWord::Wintermute` (parse + label); default to it\n  (the only wake model that exists — the other three 404''d upstream).\n- daemon: add `with_wake_detector_arc` so `load_or_null_wake`''s\n  `Arc<dyn WakeDetector>` (ONNX or null fallback) can be wired in.\n- main: in `daemon_main`, load `<prefix>/wake/<label>.onnx` via\n  `load_or_null_wake` and attach it; falls back to null (logged) if\n  absent or contract-mismatched, so the daemon always starts.\n\nDeployed: model at /usr/share/wintermute/models/wake/wintermute.onnx\n(sha a042995f…, [1,186,40]->[1,1]); journal now logs `wake_model_loaded`.\n\nAlso fixes a pre-existing build break: agorabus 0.9.0 added\n`state_file`/`state_flush_ms` to `DaemonConfig`; selftest''s initializer\nhadn''t been updated, so HEAD didn''t compile against current agorabus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e4bde8ca7258dc93374653c79b2ebf24f79b6fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/0e4bde8ca7258dc93374653c79b2ebf24f79b6fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDFhMzZkOTg1ZmQ3MDllZTI5NGI1MTY5YjJkOWQ2ZDcwMTJhMTlhODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017","sha":"2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017"}],"sha":"1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/1a36d985fd709ee294b5169b2d9d6d7012a19a86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T00:12:19Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T00:12:19Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: v0.9.0 — bit-exact mel front-end (wake-mel-frontend)\n\nBumps to v0.9.0 landing the bit-exact TFLM microfrontend port. The wake\ndetector feeds the model [1,186,40] log-mel features (AC1 shape contract\nverified against the ONNX graph) produced by a preprocessor that matches\nthe training pipeline byte-for-byte (AC2 parity, maxabs=0). AC3/AC6 remain\nPENDING-USER per the no-self-fixture rule.\n\nPRD: PRD-wintermute-wake-mel-frontend.md","tree":{"sha":"1771301058d9e702ba879ec12fce824964582f91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/1771301058d9e702ba879ec12fce824964582f91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/2011c4197aa9894fba8732aa5c9c69584aa60017","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gi