ml_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843","sha":"35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843"}],"sha":"9875bb6ba30121c726d401c3f93903d9d18fc2e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/9875bb6ba30121c726d401c3f93903d9d18fc2e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:05:23Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T23:05:23Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(features): bit-exact TFLM microfrontend port — AC2 mel parity passes\n\nPort the OHF-Voice/micro-wake-word reference preprocessor (the TFLM\naudio_microfrontend shipped as pymicro_features.MicroFrontend) into Rust\nstage-for-stage, replacing the prior geometry-only mel front-end:\n\n  - window: 30ms/10ms Hann quantised to Q12 (coeffs in f32 to match cosf)\n  - fft: 512-pt fixed-point real FFT (kiss_fftr, FIXED_POINT=16), radix-4/2\n         butterflies with exact sround/C_FIXDIV — bit-exact vs reference C\n  - filterbank: 40 mel channels, overlap-carry accumulator, 64->32 int sqrt\n  - noise reduction: stateful per-channel estimate + spectral subtraction\n  - PCAN auto-gain (strength 0.95, offset 80) via wide-dynamic-range LUT\n  - log+scale: fixed-point natural-log LUT -> uint16 -> * 0.0390625 (f32)\n\nValidated against the reference C frontend directly: all 186 frames of the\ncanonical 440Hz/amp-8000/30240-sample buffer match the reference uint16\noutput bit-for-bit (0 diff). The AC2 golden test\n(ac2_mel_parity_with_training_golden) is no longer #[ignore]d and passes at\nmaxabs 0 (well under the <=1e-3 tolerance).\n\nAlso fixes a double-scaling bug in contrib/gen_golden_mel.py: out.features\nfrom the pybind wrapper is ALREADY uint16 * 0.0390625, so the prior\n`f * FEATURE_SCALE` scaled twice (~25.6x too small, ~0.8 vs ~21). Golden\nregenerated single-scaled; --verify maxabs=0 against the reference.\n\nGates: cargo build OK; cargo test (128 lib + 7 integration + doc) green;\ncargo clippy --lib exit 0 (baseline warning debt unchanged, no new errors);\nno new dependencies (pure std).\n\nAC1 (shape contract) + AC2 (mel parity) now both verified. AC3/AC6 remain\nPENDING-USER (held-out clip / live mic), so this is an implementation-only\ncommit — not landed to main this tick.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c13705a415443d0519287c111236c9535408127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/5c13705a415443d0519287c111236c9535408127"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDM1MTE4MTY2Y2Q3YTg3YzBlMTBhNzY4NDIzMzE4OWIzNzdhMzM4NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49","sha":"cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49"}],"sha":"35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/35118166cd7a87c0e10a7684233189b377a33843"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:39:04Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:39:04Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(features): verify AC2 golden provenance + add reproducible generator\n\nCorrects commit 7fbada3, which flagged tests/golden/mel_440hz_8000amp.json\nas fabricated/unverified. That call was wrong: it assumed a real\npymicro_features export must yield exact integer multiples of 0.0390625.\nThis build of pymicro_features returns FLOAT features from process_samples,\nso float*0.0390625 carries a fractional part — non-integer multiples are\nexpected, not evidence of a fake.\n\nVerified by installing pymicro-features, streaming the documented\n440Hz/amp-8000/30240-sample i16 buffer (truncate-toward-zero PCM, 160-sample\nhops), taking the first 186 frames, and matching the committed golden to\nmaxabs=0 (bit-exact). Added contrib/gen_golden_mel.py as the authoritative\n--write/--verify provenance tool so this false alarm cannot recur.\n\nThe golden is genuine reference ground truth (independent of the code under\ntest — no agent-written-fixtures tautology). Remaining AC2 work is purely\nthe Rust PCAN auto-gain + noise-reduction port in mel_window; the parity\ntest stays #[ignore]d until that lands. Not a user gate, not a golden problem.\n\ncargo check + cargo test --lib features green (7 passed, 1 ignored=AC2-PCAN).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79f36144f1833075a8c20c17c6011f930909958f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/79f36144f1833075a8c20c17c6011f930909958f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKGNkMWUwZTRmMTgyMWM3NWRmODJiNjAzNTViMTYyMzE2Njk1ZTNhNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71","sha":"67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71"}],"sha":"cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/cd1e0e4f1821c75df82b60355b162316695e3a49"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:37:34Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:37:34Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"Merge branch ''main'' into build/wintermute-wake-mel-frontend","tree":{"sha":"15a1e073f78e7f16cbd88b9e8d4348dbcdd94c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/15a1e073f78e7f16cbd88b9e8d4348dbcdd94c9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDY3YjViOGNiNGRhYzc2NzVmYTdjYmFmYjUwNGNlNjQ5Yjg3MmNkNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/7fbada34fcd0fd01baa85826564394cacda807bb","sha":"7fbada34fcd0fd01baa85826564394cacda807bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/7fbada34fcd0fd01baa85826564394cacda807bb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b","sha":"8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b"}],"sha":"67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/67b5b8cb4dac7675fa7cbafb504ce649b872cd71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:00:50Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T21:00:50Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"fix(test): repair wake_bus_smoke for v0.7.0 mel-window geometry\n\nThe wake_bus_smoke integration tests drove NullSource with 50x320 = 16000\nsamples, under one full mel window. The v0.7.0 mel front-end raised the\ndaemon wake window to MEL_WINDOW_SAMPLES (30240) with a MEL_STRIDE_SAMPLES\n(2560) advance, so MelWindowBuffer::next_window() never yielded, the\nscripted detector never reached its 3rd process() call, and no\nwm.audio.wake event published -> both tests red.\n\nSize the NullSource frame count from the mel constants\n(MEL_WINDOW_SAMPLES + 2*MEL_STRIDE_SAMPLES, ceil-div + margin) so >=3\nwindows drain and the detector fires. Test-only change; no production\nbehavior change. Full suite green. Bump v0.8.1 + CHANGELOG note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d54976925386c06b6a6b576f907948dddfcd13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/1d54976925386c06b6a6b576f907948dddfcd13d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDhjMmM2NmM3YzRmYjczNWNhNTg4YzY4MzFkNGFhOGUwMTcxYjAzMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/61287aa9a0478962f9331469843b06c8a9440751","sha":"61287aa9a0478962f9331469843b06c8a9440751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/61287aa9a0478962f9331469843b06c8a9440751"}],"sha":"8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/8c2c66c7c4fb735ca588c6831d4aa8e0171b032b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/7fbada34fcd0fd01baa85826564394cacda807bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T18:58:23Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T18:58:23Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"docs(features): flag AC2 golden vector provenance as unverified\n\nThe committed tests/golden/mel_440hz_8000amp.json claims a\npymicro_features.MicroFrontend uint16x0.0390625 export, but 2378/7440\nvalues are not integer multiples of 0.0390625 — it cannot be that\nexport (and pymicro_features is not installed here). It is a float-DSP\nartifact of unknown origin, the agent-written-fixtures-tautology mode\nthe PRD forbids. Mark AC2 as blocked on regenerating the golden from\nthe real microfrontend before any PCAN/noise-reduction parity port, so\nno future tick chases a fabricated target.\n\nNo version bump: doc/comment-only provenance correction, no feature change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0819a20c8e0615811ac13b292db0166cbe906c1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/0819a20c8e0615811ac13b292db0166cbe906c1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/7fbada34fcd0fd01baa85826564394cacda807bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.gi