name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(vad): expose speech_end_silence_ms config with elder-friendly 1500ms default\n\nImplements PRD earshot-vad-patience: the VAD silence-hangover before\nwm.audio.speech.end is now read from WM_VAD_SILENCE_MS env var\n(floor 300ms, ceiling 3000ms, default 1500ms) instead of a hardcoded\n500ms constant. VadEdgeTracker in the daemon loop is constructed from\nconfig.speech_end_silence_ms. New unit tests assert the elder-default\npatience window survives a mid-sentence pause without emitting speech.end.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"345a1764aa38f2a2825130467fbead452ccefc33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/345a1764aa38f2a2825130467fbead452ccefc33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/939504a608119ab170b44221f669cd730721f7db","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/939504a608119ab170b44221f669cd730721f7db","node_id"