b44ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T14:51:58Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T17:25:54Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: v0.7.0 — PRD-wintermute-wake-mel-frontend\n\nFix wake-word detection contract mismatch: add mel-spectrogram front-end\n(features.rs) producing [1,186,40] f32 tensors matching the microWakeWord\ntraining preprocessor. Repair OnnxWakeDetector input shape. Honest\nfetch-models manifest (real silero_vad sha256, dead wake URLs removed).\n124 lib tests green.","tree":{"sha":"bd64f357bd796b8ee72c99876529f8c2d2c069eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/bd64f357bd796b8ee72c99876529f8c2d2c069eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/608053379dec2d5c20f7747667fe6c2a0f4b44ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/608053379dec2d5c20f7747667fe6c2a0f4b44ee","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDYwODA1MzM3OWRlYzJkNWMyMGY3NzQ3NjY3ZmU2YzJhMGY0YjQ0ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd","sha":"04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd"}],"sha":"608053379dec2d5c20f7747667fe6c2a0f4b44ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/608053379dec2d5c20f7747667fe6c2a0f4b44ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:45:55Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T17:25:54Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(models): honest fetch-models manifest (AC5)\n\nRepair the fetch-models manifest so every listed entry actually resolves\nand verifies, removing fabricated hashes and 404 URLs.\n\n- silero_vad: pin the real, verified sha256\n  (2623a2953f6ff3d2c1e61740c6cdb7168133479b267dfef114a4a3cc5bdd788f),\n  obtained by downloading the v5.1 silero_vad.onnx artifact and hashing it\n  (2.3 MB ONNX protobuf). Replaces the old placeholder 6d7e0f1a…\n- Remove the three microWakeWord wake entries (hey_jarvis, okay_nabu,\n  hey_mycroft): their upstream URLs 404 (kahrendt/microWakeWord renamed to\n  OHF-Voice/micro-wake-word; okay_nabu_v0.1 release assets gone) and their\n  pinned hashes were placeholders that could never verify. The wake model\n  now comes from the local training pipeline\n  (project_wintermute_wake_training), installed out-of-band to\n  <prefix>/wake/wintermute.onnx.\n- fetch-models --list now only shows resolvable entries; module + CLI help\n  copy updated to stop claiming wake models are fetched.\n- Tests: replace the old \"4 entries / 3 wake\" assertions with honest-manifest\n  checks (only resolvable entries, zero wake entries, no kahrendt URLs,\n  silero_vad pinned to the verified digest). build_list_length tracks\n  MANIFEST.len(). Lib suite green: 124 passed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fed9a811d9ad3cbd9882bdca4ac1fb44f3dbb851","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/fed9a811d9ad3cbd9882bdca4ac1fb44f3dbb851"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDA0YzI5OWIyMjI1ZDMyYjg0MmEwNDA0NDE3MDhlZTJmNGVhZmMzYmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e","sha":"6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e"}],"sha":"04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/04c299b2225d32b842a040441708ee2f4eafc3bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T23:18:42Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T17:25:54Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(wake): mel feature front-end — fix [1,1280] raw-PCM vs [1,186,40] contract\n\niter-1 of PRD-wintermute-wake-mel-frontend. The wake path fed the model a\nraw-PCM tensor [1,1280]; every real microWakeWord model (and the locally\ntrained wintermute.onnx) declares [1,186,40] log-mel input, so inference\nshape-mismatched and never fired.\n\n- src/features.rs: log-mel front-end. mel_window(pcm) -> Box<[[f32;40]]>\n  (186 frames x 40 mel bins) + MelWindowBuffer ring buffer accumulating the\n  exact 30 240-sample (~1.89 s) window. Feature spec sourced from the\n  OHF-Voice/micro-wake-word training preprocessor (audio_utils.py): 16 kHz,\n  30 ms window / 10 ms hop, 40 mel bins over 125-7500 Hz, x0.0390625 scale.\n- src/inference.rs: OnnxWakeDetector::process now builds [1,186,40] f32 via\n  features::mel_window; deleted the raw-PCM [1,N] path and its comment.\n  load() reads the ONNX graph''s declared input dims and fails loudly unless\n  trailing dims == [_,186,40] (AC1 load-time contract check).\n- src/daemon.rs: wake capture loop uses MelWindowBuffer (mel-sized window).\n- AC1: ac1_input_tensor_is_1x186x40_f32 + ac1_feature_dims_match_model_\n  declared_input genuinely exercise the new path (latter loads the real\n  smoke ONNX and asserts verify_input_contract accepts it).\n- AC2: golden vector exported from the actual pymicro_features.MicroFrontend\n  committed at tests/golden/mel_440hz_8000amp.json; parity test is #[ignore]''d\n  (TODO: port TFLM PCAN/noise-reduction stages) per the anti-tautology rule —\n  the geometry-only front-end is honestly not bit-parity yet.\n\nGates: cargo build + cargo test green (122 passed, 1 ignored). clippy\n-D warnings: features.rs adds zero errors; branch holds at the pre-existing\nbaseline count (21, untouched VAD/selftest debt).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f23ccb6fcb2d3acf5b3007f04478a27d8e27e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/3f23ccb6fcb2d3acf5b3007f04478a27d8e27e6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDYyODY1ODJmYzJjZTIwMDhhNDJiM2EyMTZkMDFiZmYwZjVmNTEwMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/1180606c4a24617e04f859e7d4d8ce5be6f7f925","sha":"1180606c4a24617e04f859e7d4d8ce5be6f7f925","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/1180606c4a24617e04f859e7d4d8ce5be6f7f925"}],"sha":"6286582fc2ce2008a42b3a216d01bff0f5f5100e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/w