U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/dce2c073b711b98c09c16e60c6b0f8c965a9be4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T08:12:13Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T08:12:13Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"feat(selftest): add wm-audio selftest subcommand (v0.6.0)\n\nAdds `src/selftest.rs` with fixture mode (scripted wake+VAD via in-process\nagorabus, no mic required) and live mode (subscribes to running daemon).\nVerdicts: healthy | deaf: no-wake | deaf: no-speech-segment |\nunreachable: <reason>. Exit codes 0/1/2 mirror agorabus doctor.\nOutputs --format text|json. Diagnostic breadcrumbs point to\n`wm-audio fetch-models` for deaf verdicts. 10 new unit tests (AC8).\n\nWires selftest into wm-audio main.rs dispatch and help text.\nEncodes the 2026-05-29 voice-path debugging session.\n\nPRD: PRD-rouse-voice-selftest.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Joe Yen <jyen.tech@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"9da083d043a8f31a82c5795a0f82dca88446246d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/9da083d043a8f31a82c5795a0f82dca88446246d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/dce2c073b711b98c09c16e60c6b0f8c965a9be4d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/pr