tps://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/7a6aa1c6acf36037200d22fb434e5b2ba86414f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T06:34:26Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T06:34:26Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: ONNX inference backends for wake-word and VAD\n\nAdd src/inference.rs with OnnxWakeDetector (microWakeWord) and\nOnnxVadDetector (Silero VAD v4) backed by ort 2.0.0-rc.12.\n\nBoth backends fall back to their null engines when models are absent\nor unloadable (AC7). Factory helpers load_or_null_wake / load_or_null_vad\nlog wake_model_missing / vad_model_missing on fallback. Adds 16 new\nlib tests covering: normalise_pcm, fallback on missing model, idle/active\ndetector counts, frame slicing, speech edge state machine integration,\nsynthetic wake/speech envelope tests, and AC10 self-emitted topic filter.\n\nTotal lib tests: 103 (was 87, +16, exceeds AC1 requirement of ≥current+8).\ncargo deny check bans licenses sources: clean (switched ort TLS to rustls\nto avoid the openssl ban).","tree":{"sha":"e5fb5a6d079a29e346bb19cd83ef6cdd0e5ca1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/e5fb5a6d079a29e346bb19cd83ef6cdd0e5ca1ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/7a6aa1c6acf36037200d22fb434e5b2ba86414f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith