:"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-16 AC3 wake publish latency assertion\n\nAdds wake_publish_within_two_hundred_ms_ac3 to tests/wake_bus_smoke.rs.\nTimedWake detector stamps Instant::now() into a shared Arc<Mutex<...>>\non its firing call; the test computes subscriber-receive - fire and\nasserts <200ms. Mirrors the iter-15 AC6 reload-timing pattern,\napplied to the wake topic.\n\n53 tests green (52 → 53). Clippy clean.\n\nPRD AC3: wake → wm.audio.wake event published latency: <200 ms.","tree":{"sha":"c7af26bf9378de35180417493465af5e481d0f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/c7af26bf9378de35180417493465af5e481d0f7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/1c7e3f6c33b96b447d480947f11a3e4012501441","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/1c7e3f6c33b96b447d480947f11a3e4012501441","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDFjN2UzZjZjMzNiOTZiNDQ3ZDQ4MDk0N2YxMWEzZTQwMTI1