"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/d54d1052e74918d7f2aab6af40ddccac66eca323","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKGQ1NGQxMDUyZTc0OTE4ZDdmMmFhYjZhZjQwZGRjY2FjNjZlY2EzMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c","sha":"471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c"}],"sha":"d54d1052e74918d7f2aab6af40ddccac66eca323","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/d54d1052e74918d7f2aab6af40ddccac66eca323"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T19:26:00Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T19:26:00Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-12 reload_bus_smoke integration test (PRD AC6)\n\nCloses the iter-11-deferred bus-side end-to-end coverage for the wake-detector\nhot-swap. Spins up an in-process agorabus, builds the wm-audio Daemon\npointed at it, publishes wm.audio.reload with wake_word=\"okay_nabu\" from a\nseparate client, and asserts the daemon''s control loop swaps the slot to\nthe new label within 5s. The src-level apply_wake_reload tests cover the\nhelper directly; this pins the bus wire.","tree":{"sha":"0841b4524fd00ad9574039150614107146209df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/0841b4524fd00ad9574039150614107146209df4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDQ3MWVmM2FkOGIyODZjZDllYjU2Mzk2OTE5ODlhYTljMmRmMWQwNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8","sha":"88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8"}],"sha":"471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/471ef3ad8b286cd9eb5639691989aa9c2df1d06c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T03:46:05Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T03:46:05Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-11 wake-detector hot-swap slot (PRD AC6)\n\nWakeSlot = Arc<RwLock<Arc<dyn WakeDetector>>>: capture loop reads it\nonce per outer pass (cheap Arc::clone), control loop overwrites it on\nwm.audio.reload. apply_wake_reload() resolves the new wake word from\nthe event payload''s wake_word field or WM_WAKE_WORD env, parses via\nWakeWord, builds a NullWakeDetector for the new label, swaps it in.\nUnknown words leave the slot untouched. ONNX backends will plug in\nbehind this same slot once they land.\n\nLib tests 39 -> 42 (+3): wake_slot_round_trips_swap,\napply_wake_reload_payload_swaps_label,\napply_wake_reload_unknown_word_errors_and_keeps_slot. clippy\n--release --lib --bins -D warnings clean; full suite green.","tree":{"sha":"3bfeff0fbf4a00be2b331e90eba3a2fe78bd5476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/3bfeff0fbf4a00be2b331e90eba3a2fe78bd5476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDg4YzMyMmQyMzgzZDVlYWQ5MGY5NTQxZmE2ZjU2ZGMwMWUzNDY3YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23","sha":"0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23"}],"sha":"88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/88c322d2383d5ead90f9541fa6f56dc01e3467a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T02:35:49Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T02:35:49Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-10 vad_bus_smoke integration test (PRD §2.3)\n\nEnd-to-end VAD edge publishing test against a real in-process\nagorabus daemon. NullSource feeds 50 frames through a\nScriptedVadDetector that returns 2 windows of Speech then Silence;\nthe subscriber asserts one wm.audio.speech.start, ≥1\nwm.audio.speech.chunk, and one wm.audio.speech.end with\nduration_ms = 64 (2 speech windows × 32 ms hangover-locked exit).\n\nPins the PRD §2.3 contract end-to-end: rising edge → mid-utterance\nchunks → 500 ms hangover → falling edge, with topic strings + JSON\npayload shapes routed through the real bus.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e4d1fbce7a1e4c409fcf494beabca6be36308d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/4e4d1fbce7a1e4c409fcf494beabca6be36308d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDBkZTU2OTgyNGYxN2I3MjQ1NmE3NDcwMDYxOThkOGE0OWU5NjRkMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/fd24b8afd5c810f1f6e46ed57b8489fa466c211d","sha":"fd24b8afd5c810f1f6e46ed57b8489fa466c211d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/fd24b8afd5c810f1f6e46ed57b8489fa466c211d"}],"sha":"0de569824f17b72456a747006198d8a49e964d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/0de569824f17b72456a74