"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/25bc0a1717f554da1470d7c03c9fc4816a645144/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T03:57:15Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T03:57:15Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-3 UDS PCM fanout (PRD §2.3 step 3, AC7)\n\nsrc/fanout.rs (166 LOC): tokio::sync::broadcast channel + UnixListener\nat $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/wintermute/mic.sock; per-connection writer task\nserialises i16 LE samples; slow subscribers get RecvError::Lagged and\nget dropped so they cannot back-pressure the capture loop.\n\nsrc/daemon.rs: wires fanout::channel() + fanout::run() task into Daemon::run;\neach captured PcmFrame is broadcast to subscribers; ring drain kept as\nplaceholder for the (in-process) wake/VAD consumers in iter-4+.\n\ntests/fanout_smoke.rs (182 LOC): two-subscriber integration test asserts\nbyte-identical PCM streams (AC7 smoke); listener cleans up its socket\nfile on shutdown.\n\nLib tests 15 → 17 (+2 broadcast unit tests). Integration fanout_smoke 2/2.\ncargo build --release green. cargo clippy --release --lib --bins clean;\nfanout_smoke needed as_conversions + too_many_lines added to the existing\ntest-file allow list (cast generators are inherent to PCM smoke tests).\nacceptance_template scaffold drift unchanged per iter-2 carryover note.","tree":{"sha":"b53715c9fc8d773727e4735c7525a200eea0841d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/b53715c9fc8d773727e4735c7525a200eea0841d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/25bc0a1717f554da1470d7c03c9fc4816a645144","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/25bc0a1717f554da1470d7c03c9fc4816a645144","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDI1YmMwYTE3MTdmNTU0ZGExNDcwZDdjMDNjOWZjNDgxNmE2NDUxNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e","sha":"66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e"}],"sha":"25bc0a1717f554da1470d7c03c9fc4816a645144","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/25bc0a1717f554da1470d7c03c9fc4816a645144"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:48:08Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T02:48:08Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-2 daemon skeleton\n\nWires the iter-2 topology described in PRD §2.3:\n\n* events.rs — strongly-typed `AudioEvent` enum + `ControlEvent`\n  classifier locked against the §2.3 topic table.\n* source.rs — `MicSource` trait + `NullSource` so non-PipeWire\n  contexts (tests, file replay) can drive the pipeline.\n* state.rs — `MuteState` (independent TTS/dialog reasons) and\n  `Shutdown` handle for cooperative termination.\n* config.rs — `Config` + `WakeWord` parser keyed off §2.4 env vars.\n* errors.rs — `AudioError` with `Bus` / `Capture` variants.\n* daemon.rs — agorabus pub+sub fan-out, bounded ring buffer, source\n  + control + signal tasks, main drain loop. Real wake/VAD inference\n  plugs into the same topology in iter-3+.\n\nDeps added: agorabus (path), serde, serde_json, ringbuf, tokio\n(rt-multi-thread/macros/sync/signal/time/io-util/net), tracing,\ntracing-subscriber, base64, thiserror, anyhow. ONNX / pipewire-rs\nstay queued for iter-3 when the inference + capture paths land.\n\ncargo build --release green; cargo test --release --lib 15/15;\ncargo clippy --release --lib --bins -D warnings clean. The\npre-existing acceptance_template.rs scaffold noise (doc_markdown +\nmissing_const_for_fn) is intentionally left to match the\nwintermute-bootstrap iter-2 carryover pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b0b57d1f682a7313d053ef79a4eca3e452fb026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/4b0b57d1f682a7313d053ef79a4eca3e452fb026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDY2ZjQwNjg1NzQ5YTIwYTZmZmJmMmEzNTFhOGI5MTQ0YTM0ZjdjN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/790495349aac4ebaa5ae44190798cbe9624f705c","sha":"790495349aac4ebaa5ae44190798cbe9624f705c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/790495349aac4ebaa5ae44190798cbe9624f705c"}],"sha":"66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/66f40685749a20a6ffbf2a351a8b9144a34f7c7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commits/790495349aac4ebaa5ae44190798cbe9624f705c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T00:53:01Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T00:53:01Z","email":"jyen.tech@gmail.com","name":"Joe Yen"},"message":"wintermute-audio: iter-1 scaffold (cargo check green)\n\nAutobuilder Stage 1 (intake) + Stage 2 (scaffold) for PRD-wintermute-audio.md.\n\n- intent-card synthesized from PRD §1-§7 (mixed: rust-cli + pipewire\n  conf.d drop-in); 8 ACs declared, target = 4 acceptance_tests_passing\n- scaffold template materialized 2026-05-24 with intent_slug=\n  wintermute-audio and target_kind=cli; cargo check --release green\n  (0.70s, 69 deps locked)\n- ONNX runtime / pipewire-rs / tokio / agorabus / ringbuf deps not\n  added yet — those land in iter-2 when src/main.rs becomes the real\n  daemon\n- No push, no GitHub repo create, no REPOS.md edit (separate Phase 4\n  actions per /build skill)\n\n5 ambiguities resolved in intent-card.ambiguities_resolved\n(aec3-default-true, noisetorch-soft-required, dump-deferred-iter-2,\nhardware-gated-ACs, dialog-owns-barge-in).","tree":{"sha":"4156d5de6faa86d953f4c9fba4fa96f3876137f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/trees/4156d5de6faa86d953f4c9fba4fa96f3876137f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/j0yen/wintermute-audio/git/commits/790495349aac4ebaa5ae44190798cbe9624f705c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178452872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen","id":178452872,"login":"j0yen","node_id":"U_kgDOCqL5iA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j0yen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/j0yen/wintermute-audio/commit/790495349aac4ebaa5ae44190798cbe9624f705c","node_id":"C_kwDOSp3UndoAKDc5MDQ5NTM0OWFhYzRlYmFhNWFlNDQxOTA3OThjYmU5NjI0ZjcwNWM","parents":[],"sha":"790495349aa