s","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/4dc381c08121a5597cd8b2013a6399cfaf8b4b85","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKDRkYzM4MWMwODEyMWE1NTk3Y2Q4YjIwMTNhNjM5OWNmYWY4YjRiODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6","sha":"bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6"}],"sha":"4dc381c08121a5597cd8b2013a6399cfaf8b4b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/4dc381c08121a5597cd8b2013a6399cfaf8b4b85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:49:51Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:49:51Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"docs: reconcile the last ten widget pages with the code\n\nAlerts, vertical buttons, checkbox, icon buttons, the icon helpers, the\nresponsive layout, the round slider, the top app bar and both Advanced View\nvariants, German and English; the buttons page picked up two corrections the\nvertical one uncovered.\n\nThe recurring error this time was the group name. A group without its own label\nresolves through `group_<name>`, so the English pages invented names for every\none of them: \"General\" for Common, \"Label\" for labeling, \"Image / Icon\" for\nicon. Both button pages also described a Feedback group that does not exist —\nvibration and click sound sit in Common — and stayed silent about colors and\nlocking hiding behind the advanced switch.\n\nStatements that were simply wrong, each checked against the widget source:\n\n- alignment exists on the vertical buttons only; the horizontal ones have a text\n  width. The vertical page claimed both\n- the icon widget has no \"use icon size for image\", no width/height and no\n  object id; it carries an icon, a size and a color\n- the Advanced View has no debug option, and the view list belongs to the `8`\n  variant while the fade effect, pre-rendering and error message belong to the\n  plain one\n- the top app bar has no permission or visibility fields per entry\n- a visibility condition of the responsive layout shows its view\n\nNewly documented: HTML in alert texts, the round slider''s replacement texts and\nwhere each one takes over, the drawer index prefix and the JSON format of the\nmenu entries, the icon slider''s colorize pair, and the breakpoint widths of the\nresponsive layout.","tree":{"sha":"848b084b20ccab58fd706dd2e752bb07378e950a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/848b084b20ccab58fd706dd2e752bb07378e950a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKGJkODM5NzRkN2I1YTgyNWE2NGUwMjg5YTk1YzVkZDNjMDJlNzBiYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579","sha":"bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579"}],"sha":"bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/bd83974d7b5a825a64e0289a95c5dd3c02e70bc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:49:38Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:49:38Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"fix(widgets): correct the inverted view visibility and four wrong labels\n\nThe per-view visibility condition of the Masonry and Grid containers did the\nopposite of what it promises: `isVisible` read the condition negated, so a view\nconfigured with \"== 1\" was hidden exactly while its state was 1. The Icon List\nhas always evaluated the same operators the other way round, and the field is\nnamed after showing, not hiding. Three guard tests pin the new direction; a\nproject that flipped its condition as a workaround has to flip it back.\n\nThe labels named the wrong thing in all eleven languages:\n\n- the vibration duration goes straight to `navigator.vibrate`, so it is in\n  milliseconds, not seconds — in the widgets, the drawer and the top app bar\n- `handleZoom` multiplies the knob size permanently, it is not a zoom applied\n  while dragging\n- the icon slider''s `sliderWidth` is the diameter of its arc, while the round\n  slider''s field of the same name really is the stroke width. The icon slider\n  gets its own label key and keeps the data key, so saved widgets keep their\n  value\n- the top app bar''s `navDefaultValue` is the entry preselected until the first\n  click; there are no user groups anywhere in the code\n\nOnly labels changed there — no option, value or behaviour moved.","tree":{"sha":"46ae3f5f438f6bdafbc6763ebe60ddbba61f4931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/46ae3f5f438f6bdafbc6763ebe60ddbba61f4931"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKGJkN2U5OThlY2ZhMmMwNjk0MmQ4MzY1YjhmMzQ2NWQ5N2RmMjM1Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/68a83e82b7f960cbf93a0e86dbf59458e2de193a","sha":"68a83e82b7f960cbf93a0e86dbf59458e2de193a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/68a83e82b7f960cbf93a0e86dbf59458e2de193a"}],"sha":"bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/bd7e998ecfa2c06942d8365b8f3465d97df23579"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/68a83e82b7f960cbf93a0e86dbf59458e2de193a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:15:34Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T09:15:34Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"docs: reconcile eight more widget pages with the code\n\ntable, select, input, calendar, html-card, dialog, progress and\nprogress-circular, DE and EN each, checked field by field against the\nwidgets'' visAttrs and admin/i18n labels.\n\nCorrected statements that were wrong, not merely incomplete:\n\n- table: a column always shows the n-th key of the first row; sortKey only\n  drives the sorting, it does not pick the displayed property.\n- select: showSelectedIcon picks the slot for the selected entry''s icon in\n  the input field, it is not a check mark on the active entry.\n- calendar: calendarWeekdays is a comma-separated list of weekday numbers\n  that also defines the display order, not a long/short name switch.\n- html-card: every clickType other than none makes the whole card clickable.\n- progress: progressRotate is a yes/no 90 degree select, and the two\n  threshold colors compare the percentage, not the state value.\n\nDocumented for the first time: the input mask tokens, #[obj.name] in table\nprefix/suffix, the card''s JSON data source, [#value]/[#percent] in the\ncustom progress label, and the autocomplete''s input mode and input type.\n\nField names now quote the editor labels verbatim; option values that\nadmin/i18n does not translate are left raw.","tree":{"sha":"8814f524432efe4d68a1c95390ac864fe06dec5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/8814f524432efe4d68a1c95390ac864fe06dec5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/68a83e82b7f960cbf93a0e86dbf59458e2de193a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1570