r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/e5202944c529cc652678dac6c6f707dd6517870d","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKGU1MjAyOTQ0YzUyOWNjNjUyNjc4ZGFjNmM2ZjcwN2RkNjUxNzg3MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201","sha":"cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201"}],"sha":"e5202944c529cc652678dac6c6f707dd6517870d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/e5202944c529cc652678dac6c6f707dd6517870d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/a2d721d2f9af1682550a7ee541ebc9cd67d43e71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:06:40Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:06:40Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"fix(i18n): keep the translations expose, vis-2 cannot fetch the language files\n\nSame fix as master fb5d167c, re-applied here — `9e3b05d6` is this branch''s copy\nof the switch it undoes.\n\n`visWidgets.i18n: true` never worked on a real host. vis-2 2.15.4 rewrites the\ncollection url to `./vis-2/widgets/<url>` for registerRemotes, then derives the\ni18n fetch from that same rewritten value and resolves it against a page that is\nitself served under `/vis-2/`:\n\n    404 /vis-2/vis-2/widgets/vis2-materialdesign/i18n/de.json\n\nWith no dictionary in I18n, every attribute group that declares an explicit\n`label: ''group_x''` renders its raw key in the editor - the panel puts those\nthrough `I18n.t()` while label-less groups go through `window.vis._()`, which\nstill resolves. Half the groups of Chart Bar, Chart Pie, Chart JSON, Line\nHistory, Table, Top App Bar, List, Select, Input, Slider, Checkbox and Switch\nshowed `group_chartLayout`, `group_columnLayout [0]` and friends. The live test\nhost has been in that state since the switch was deployed.\n\nSo the `./translations` expose comes back and io-package returns to\n`i18n: \"component\"`, the only path vis-2 2.15.4 loads. tasks.js stops copying\nadmin/i18n into the widget dir, since nothing fetches it there. The changelog\nentry that announced the per-language fetch goes with it.\n\nThe ~515 kB runtime chunk that motivated the switch is back. Getting rid of it\nneeds the fix on the vis-2 side, in visLoadWidgets.tsx:213 and the\n`i18n === true` branch below it; the comment in vite.config.ts names that.\n\nThe js-controller dependency the same commit added to io-package stays.","tree":{"sha":"9068b41de868196f18a22dc4ae43030aefc9a05b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/9068b41de868196f18a22dc4ae43030aefc9a05b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/a2d721d2f9af1682550a7ee541ebc9cd67d43e71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/a2d721d2f9af1682550a7ee541ebc9cd67d43e71","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKGEyZDcyMWQyZjlhZjE2ODI1NTBhN2VlNTQxZWJjOWNkNjdkNDNlNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/d8e6e5721f88f584bf220e4d9e85093d836bb7ba","sha":"d8e6e5721f88f584bf220e4d9e85093d836bb7ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/d8e6e5721f88f584bf220e4d9e85093d836bb7ba"}],"sha":"a2d721d2f9af1682550a7ee541ebc9cd67d43e71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/a2d721d2f9af1682550a7ee541ebc9cd67d43e71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:00:26Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:00:26Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"chore(changelog): drop the WIP entry for the reverted i18n change\n\nThe load-time improvement it announced is gone with fb5d167c, so the entry would\npromise a per-language fetch that the release does not do.","tree":{"sha":"0129dd6546855255c217241a193f0a33de88eba9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/0129dd6546855255c217241a193f0a33de88eba9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKGNkNGYyZDI0OWM5ZGI5YzI5OTI0MTMwMTM5M2Y1OTVlMjRjMDYyMDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0","sha":"90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0"}],"sha":"cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/cd4f2d249c9db9c299241301393f595e24c06201"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:53:59Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:53:59Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"docs: bring the widget guides and the editor screenshots up to date\n\nThe pages were last touched on 2026-08-16; the widget sources kept moving until\ntoday. Both languages get the same edits.\n\nWrong, now removed:\n\n- Top App Bar listed a permission group and visibility per menu entry. Those\n  fields went with the never-ported user-group handling, so the page says that\n  instead. The preselection field keeps the misleading \"fallback value if not in\n  user group\" label, which the page now names for what it does.\n- Advanced View in Widget documented a debug option that no longer exists.\n\nNewly documented, one entry per feature that started working:\n\n- The fields filled from the picked object, and the refill button.\n- darkTheme as a three-way setting, with the booleans still valid.\n- The slider write throttle and \"send value on release\".\n- Value''s change effect and hidden-on-load.\n- Select''s hint, counter, hover colors, label offset and auto focus, and that\n  inputType now sits on Autocomplete, where something is typed.\n- Input''s hover background and hint behaviour.\n- The shared chart legend (Bar has one now), the value labels, the tooltip\n  geometry, the chart padding and the hover settings, plus a table of the Bar\n  axis settings that reach chart.js.\n- List''s control and header-image placement, scroll-to-top and the two colors.\n- The per-view width bounds and the masonry alignment.\n- Progress stripe distance, card title background, alert close-icon press color,\n  dialog close-button size and press color.\n\nAll 45 editor screenshots are regenerated from the current master build, which\nalso puts the fixed group headers into them. The old ones still showed the\nremoved debug and permission fields, the axis zero lines, the ripple color, the\nresolution assistant, the empty icon-button label group, and a dozen labels that\ndisplayed their raw i18n key.","tree":{"sha":"8da79389ce6e12adb271cd7f93ee7eead5bc73e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/8da79389ce6e12adb271cd7f93ee7eead5bc73e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKDkwZDI5ZTUyN2JkYjUwYzFkZDc1NmUzNGM4YWI5YjM2NmM1MjI3YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/fb5d167ce1958ee9fb317b665a774e9f9ca5bd9c","sha":"fb5d167ce1958ee9fb317b665a774e9f9ca5bd9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/fb5d167ce1958ee9fb317b665a774e9f9ca5bd9c"}],"sha":"90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/90d29e527bdb50c1dd756e34c8ab9b366c5227a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/fb5d167ce1958ee9fb317b665a774e9f9ca5bd9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:53:01Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T08:53:01Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"fix(i18n): keep the translations expose, vis-2 cannot fetch the language files\n\n`visWidgets.i18n: true` never worked on a real host. vis-2 2.15.4 rewrites the\ncollection url to `./vis-2/widgets/<url>` for registerRemotes, then derives the\ni18n fetch from that same rewritten value and resolves it against a page that is\nitself served under `/vis-2/`:\n\n    404 /vis-2/vis-2/widgets/vis2-materialdesign/i18n/de.json\n\nWith no dictionary in I18n, every attribute group that declares an explicit\n`label: ''group_x''` renders its raw key in the editor - the panel puts those\nthrough `I18n.t()` while label-less groups go through `window.vis._()`, which\nstill resolves. Half the groups of Chart Bar, Chart Pie, Chart JSON, Line\nHistory, Table, Top App Bar, List, Select, Input, Slider, Checkbox and Switch\nshowed `group_chartLayout`, `group_columnLayout [0]` and friends.\n\nSo the `./translations` expose comes back and io-package returns to\n`i18n: \"component\"`, the only path vis-2 2.15.4 loads. tasks.js stops copying\nadmin/i18n into the widget dir, since nothing fetches it there.\n\nThe ~515 kB runtime chunk that motivated the switch is back with it. Getting rid\nof it needs the fix on the vis-2 side, in visLoadWidgets.tsx:213 and the\n`i18n === true` branch below it. The comment in vite.config.ts names that, so\nthe expose is not dropped a second time.\n\nThe js-controller dependency the same commit added to io-package stays.","tree":{"sha":"08ffef7738ac