"email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:50:50Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"chore(build): rebuild the widget bundles on the aligned vite","tree":{"sha":"4d05923198ab4a253a46bd9cee14ef8bf4e87c9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/4d05923198ab4a253a46bd9cee14ef8bf4e87c9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/93b151ee8eb060c60a302f676a1f54cbde500664","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/93b151ee8eb060c60a302f676a1f54cbde500664","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKDkzYjE1MWVlOGViMDYwYzYwYTMwMmY2NzZhMWY1NGNiZGU1MDA2NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff","sha":"845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff"}],"sha":"93b151ee8eb060c60a302f676a1f54cbde500664","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/93b151ee8eb060c60a302f676a1f54cbde500664"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:50:49Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:50:49Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"chore: compare the two installed trees instead of pinning types-vis-2 exactly\n\nThe exact pin only constrained what is DECLARED. What ships is the installed\nversion, so pr-gate now compares those across both node_modules — the check\nthis branch was missing entirely, ported from m3 and tightened to\nmajor.minor.\n\nmajor.minor, not full equality: the two lockfiles resolve at different times,\nso a patch apart is npm churn (@vitejs/plugin-react is 6.0.3 against 6.0.4).\nIt still fails on the drift worth catching — types-vis-2 2.13.19 vs 2.14.4,\nor the chart.js 2.9 vs 4.5 shape. With that in place both package.json files\ncan carry `~2.14.4`; the range cannot drift past what the gate asserts.\n\nThe gate moves out of adapter-tests and into build-is-current: it reads\nsrc-widgets-ts/node_modules, and only that job installs it. It now refuses to\nrun at all when that tree is missing rather than skipping quietly.\n\nIt caught real drift immediately: src-widgets-ts had vite 8.2.2 against the\nroot''s 8.1.5, because raising its range from ^8.1.3 to ^8.1.5 made npm\nre-resolve and take the newest 8.x. Both trees are back on 8.1.5, the version\n0.3.5 was released with.\n\nSide effect: types-vis-2 was the last exact version in the root\ndevDependencies, so repochecker''s S0048 suggestion is gone.","tree":{"sha":"f91dbcb62d18af0bbfab19241b9f47c90309e309","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/f91dbcb62d18af0bbfab19241b9f47c90309e309"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKDg0NWE5MTE2MTY4ZTE1M2NkMzdhZTNmZmYwMzFlMjQyNWFlM2JlZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/81fab99e0fcf4764cfae9f7718c90109ed7378f6","sha":"81fab99e0fcf4764cfae9f7718c90109ed7378f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/81fab99e0fcf4764cfae9f7718c90109ed7378f6"}],"sha":"845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/845a9116168e153cd37ae3fff031e2425ae3beff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/0e0dc3922ef76e872a43328e6448182fd46109cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:42:21Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:42:21Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"chore: guard the two trees on minor, and drop the exact types-vis-2 pin\n\nThe exact pin only constrained what is DECLARED. What actually ships is the\ninstalled version, and pr-gate already compares those across both\nnode_modules — so tightening that comparison from major to major.minor is\nstrictly stronger than the pin was, and lets both package.json files carry\n`~2.14.4` instead.\n\nNot full equality: the two lockfiles resolve at different times, so a patch\napart is npm churn (@vitejs/plugin-react is 6.0.3 against 6.0.4 right now).\nmajor.minor still fails on the drift that caused this guard — types-vis-2\n2.13.19 vs 2.14.4 and the chart.js 2.9 vs 4.5 incident.\n\nSide effect: the exact pin was the only one left in the root\ndevDependencies, so repochecker''s S0048 suggestion is gone. Resolved\nversions are unchanged, so the bundles are byte-identical.","tree":{"sha":"b12a43008f6e769c293b3ca9065dc3f56d70c6b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/b12a43008f6e769c293b3ca9065dc3f56d70c6b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/0e0dc3922ef76e872a43328e6448182fd46109cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users