{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/098cb03872de834b97ddfd72266c1b56faad8231/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:11:58Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:11:58Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"refactor(charts): share the rxData coercions the chart canvas still copied\n\nPorted from master. The coercions moved into widgetUtils for fourteen widgets\nand left the chart canvas out: it carried nine more copies, and its `str`\ndiffered from textValue by ignoring numbers and booleans instead of coercing\nthem.\n\nChartLegend, datalabelsConfig and the tooltip enable flag now use\ntextValue/numberValue/boolValue. The other half of the pattern - the one that\nmust return undefined so an unset field is left out of the chart.js config\nrather than overwriting a default with 0 or \"\" - is one pair of module-level\nhelpers now instead of five inline copies. tooltipNumber''s decimals clamp rides\nalong, completing the fix two commits back.\n\nDeleting nine always-covered arrow functions drops both sides of the coverage\nratio and pushed statements and functions just under their gates, so the pie\ntooltip callback that had no test now has one.","tree":{"sha":"06e3bde7bc87365914251b404ff8c0e5d8f29670","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/06e3bde7bc87365914251b404ff8c0e5d8f29670"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/098cb03872de834b97ddfd72266c1b56faad8231","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/098cb03872de834b97ddfd72266c1b56faad8231","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKDA5OGNiMDM4NzJkZTgzNGI5N2RkZmQ3MjI2NmMxYjU2ZmFhZDgyMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327","sha":"0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327"}],"sha":"098cb03872de834b97ddfd72266c1b56faad8231","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/098cb03872de834b97ddfd72266c1b56faad8231"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:11:47Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:11:47Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"fix(widgets): make sanitizeHtml fail closed when there is no parser\n\nPorted from master. It sanitizes through an inert <template>, so without a\ndocument it returned the input untouched - the one direction a sanitizer must\nnever fail in. Nothing reaches that branch today: vis-2 renders widgets in the\nbrowser only, and `renderToString`/`renderToStaticMarkup` appear nowhere in its\nsources, while the shipped customWidgets.ssr.js is a module-federation container\nthe plugin emits whether or not anything loads it. It is a floor, not a live\nhole.\n\nThe markup is escaped there now instead of passed through. accessibleText takes\nthe raw input in that branch rather than the sanitized string, since it strips\nto plain text anyway and would otherwise read out the entities.","tree":{"sha":"d7ba6e7705fe92eebaac025a8717fcf4f858155f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/d7ba6e7705fe92eebaac025a8717fcf4f858155f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327","node_id":"C_kwDOSqNii9oAKDBmYjRkZTdkMzY2MGY2ZGQ4MTc2NmRjNmI4YWI3Nzc4YjY0MTUzMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commit/9fefbdd412ca0265f8eb9b0d5caf94f00a84e543","sha":"9fefbdd412ca0265f8eb9b0d5caf94f00a84e543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/9fefbdd412ca0265f8eb9b0d5caf94f00a84e543"}],"sha":"0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/0fb4de7d3660f6dd81766dc6b8ab7778b6415327"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/9fefbdd412ca0265f8eb9b0d5caf94f00a84e543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:11:47Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:11:47Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"fix(io-package): give colors.darkTheme a role its type fits\n\nPorted from master. The state went from a boolean switch to a three-way setting\nwhose type has to stay `mixed`, because stored `true`/`false` values keep\nworking. Its role stayed `text`, which repochecker reads as string-only (W1133).\n\n`switch.setting` carries no type constraint and says what the state is. The\ngeneric `state` role would also clear the warning, but pr-gate.js rejects it for\nevery state in the manifest, and rightly so.","tree":{"sha":"5fa93b4f652f86