{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/157098130?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/typhosj","id":157098130,"login":"typhosj","node_id":"U_kgDOCV0gkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/5d6e75fb5635b73637de2169cc4c42171e1ee7ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:09:26Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T11:09:26Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"fix(charts): stop a min-only decimals field taking the widget down\n\nPorted from master. Intl throws a RangeError when minimumFractionDigits is above\nmaximumFractionDigits, and the editor has the two as free-standing number\nfields: filling in \"min decimals\" and leaving \"max decimals\" empty is enough.\n\nbuildBars runs during render, so the Bar chart drew nothing; the Pie builds its\nlabel inside the tooltip callback, so the throw came out of chart.js. The\ntooltipNumber clamp goes in the next commit with the rest of the canvas.\n\nThe Value widget and the Line History chart already clamped here, so this is the\nrest of the same pattern, not a second bug.","tree":{"sha":"154b6e9d0a07067efcce4692de732acd2c38f416","url":"