":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/typhosj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/commits/82b5c48d9503ad6daf5de82b8a31dc66a5554beb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T08:51:56Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T08:51:56Z","email":"typhosj@gmx.de","name":"typhosj"},"message":"chore(deps): override the vulnerable transitive dev dependencies\n\nnpm audit reported open advisories in both trees. All of them sit in transitive\nDEV dependencies - this adapter declares no runtime npm dependencies at all and\nships only the built bundles - but they still run in the build and in CI.\n\nEvery fix exists inside the major version already in the tree, so nothing jumps\na major: brace-expansion, minimatch, serialize-javascript, diff, uuid, nanoid,\njs-yaml, undici, postcss and adm-zip. @module-federation/vite and its dts-plugin\nwere flagged only for depending on adm-zip, so overriding that clears them\nwithout touching the plugin that builds the widget bundle.\n\nThe overrides go into BOTH package.json files: vite resolves the widget build\nfrom src-widgets-ts/node_modules, so one that only landed in the root tree would\nship a bundle built against the old version. chart.js stays on 4.5.1 in both.\n\nBoth trees now audit clean.","tree":{"sha":"4f75e1666694d1ac412c308ca91865361ab48e59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/trees/4f75e1666694d1ac412c308ca91865361ab48e59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/typhosj/ioBroker.vis2-materialdesign/git/commits/82b5c48d9503ad6daf5de82b8a31dc66a5554beb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fa