t_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/271f56ac3985c2f01f9cc491d116f7976d9217fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:21:23Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:21:23Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs(book): Kiro CLI now has enforced path scoping\n\nCh04/05/09 updated: enforced scoping now covers Claude Code (pre-edit hook),\nCodex (post-run git-diff), and Kiro CLI (pre-edit preToolUse hook, verified\nagainst kiro-cli). Kiro IDE remains prompt-only; fix loops still Claude-only.","tree":{"sha":"b1661d4bc4516c6065feff9a6ef732552900fd74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/b1661d4bc4516c6065feff9a6ef732552900fd74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/271f56ac3985c2f01f9cc491d116f7976d9217fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/271f56ac3985c2f01f9cc491d116f7976d9217fe","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDI3MWY1NmFjMzk4NWMyZjAxZjljYzQ5MWQxMTZmNzk3NmQ5MjE3ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2","sha":"1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2"}],"sha":"271f56ac3985c2f01f9cc491d116f7976d9217fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/271f56ac3985c2f01f9cc491d116f7976d9217fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:21:23Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T07:21:23Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat(kiro): enforced path scoping via Kiro CLI agents (platform parity)\n\nKiro was prompt-only. It now ENFORCES the same allow-lists as Claude Code on the\nKiro CLI — verified end-to-end against a real `kiro-cli` (0.11): a backend-builder\nasked to write `.env` is blocked, an in-scope `src/**` write succeeds.\n\nMechanism (empirically confirmed, not assumed):\n- Kiro CLI PreToolUse hooks fire with JSON on stdin\n  {tool_name:\"fs_write\", cwd, tool_input:{path,...}} and **exit 2 blocks the write**,\n  returning stderr to the model — the same contract as Claude Code. So the SAME\n  assets/factory-guard.mjs is reused as-is (it already reads tool_input.path + cwd).\n\nGenerated per Kiro install:\n- `.kiro/agents/<name>.json` × N — one Kiro CLI agent per prompt (kiro-cli chat\n  --agent <name>): name, description, rendered prompt, tools, resources. Editing\n  agents whose allow-list is declared get a preToolUse hook (matcher fs_write →\n  node .kiro/factory-guard.mjs <agent>). Read-only agents get no write tool, no hook.\n- `.kiro/factory-scope.json` + `.kiro/factory-guard.mjs` when scope is declared\n  (removed otherwise). The existing IDE steering files are unchanged.\n\nRefactor: extract DESCRIPTIONS_BY_AGENT to src/util/agent-meta.ts (shared by the\nclaude-code and kiro adapters; claude-code imports it now).\n\nHonest scope: enforcement is the Kiro CLI flow. Kiro IDE stays prompt-only — its\nhook/block contract isn''t documented and toolsSettings.allowedPaths is reportedly\nunenforced (kirodotdev/Kiro#7799). Documented in FACTORY.md. `shell` can still\nbypass fs_write (same boundary as Claude''s Bash). Tests: 140.","tree":{"sha":"966a9fd53f5b776e408ad845bd780d3ba347c2e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/966a9fd53f5b776e408ad845bd780d3ba347c2e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDEzMDZjYTdiZmY5NDdkZTFhNWFlZDc1OWJjODYxN2Y2NzllOTg3ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58","sha":"2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58"}],"sha":"1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/1306ca7bff947de1a5aed759bc8617f679e987f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:30:50Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:30:50Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs(book): reflect Codex path-scoping parity\n\nCh04 (boundary), Ch05 (platform asymmetry), Ch09 (parity limitation + future\nwork) updated: enforced scoping is now Claude Code (pre-edit hook) AND Codex\n(post-run git-diff guard); Kiro remains prompt-only; fix loops still CC-only.","tree":{"sha":"e0ad2be8a56c90783ad4c43dbda1903f311a0021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/e0ad2be8a56c90783ad4c43dbda1903f311a0021"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDI4NTM1MzAwNTRhMGFhODA0ZDAzYjhjYjFlMjA3YjU4OGQ5ZDRkNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e","sha":"028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e"}],"sha":"2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/2853530054a0aa804d03b8cb1e207b588d9d4d58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:30:50Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T06:30:50Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat(codex): enforced per-agent path scoping (platform parity)\n\nCodex was prompt-only; now it enforces the same allow-lists as Claude Code,\nvia the mechanism that fits Codex''s architecture (separate `codex exec` per\nagent, bash orchestrator — no Claude-style PreToolUse hook).\n\n- Extract the agent->path-key mapping + scope config to src/util/scope.ts so\n  both adapters share one source of truth (no drift). claude-code.ts now imports it.\n- New asset assets/factory-check.mjs: reads factory-scope.json, takes an agent\n  name + a newline list of changed paths on stdin (from git diff), prints the\n  out-of-scope/forbidden subset and exits non-zero. Same glob engine as the guard.\n- codex.ts: write .codex/factory-scope.json + copy factory-check.mjs when the\n  manifest declares scope; inject snapshot()/enforce_scope() bash helpers into the\n  orchestrators and call enforce_scope after each EDITING agent (not read-only ones).\n  After an agent runs, its created+modified files (tracked diff + untracked) are\n  checked; violations are reverted (git checkout HEAD / rm) and the chain halts.\n  Self-disables if node or git is absent, or no scope is declared.\n\nMechanism differs from Claude (detect-and-revert after vs block-before) but the\nend state is identical; because it diffs the tree it also catches Bash-written\nfiles. Native Codex [permissions] profiles documented in FACTORY.md as an optional\nstronger layer (too version-fragile to auto-generate).\n\nTests: 138 (+12 direct factory-check unit tests + codex enforcement assertions).\nClaude guard output verified byte-identical (no regression).","tree":{"sha":"cc6789ff6e5c75f85d8a4256383841d4924fa556","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/cc6789ff6e5c75f85d8a4256383841d4924fa556"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDAyOGVjMmU0MGJlNTVlNzAzNmZiYWVjZmY1YTQ2MWFjZWRlNGUzM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097","sha":"aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097"}],"sha":"028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/028ec2e40be55e7036fbaecff5a461acede4e33e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:37:17Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:37:17Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"fix(prompts): wire agents to consume the pulled cross-repo contract\n\nAudit found the only real over-claim: `factory feature pull` copies the upstream\nstory + published contract into `.factory/features/<name>/`, but no prompt told\nany agent to read it — the frontend-builder only consumed the backend-builder''s\nin-conversation summary, which doesn''t exist when the backend shipped in another\nrepo. So the advertised cross-repo flow broke at the last mile.\n\nPrompt-only fix (the CLI already moves the files correctly):\n- feature-factory: new \"Cross-repo inputs\" step — read story.md + any api.* from\n  .factory/features/<name>/ and thread them forward; the published file is the\n  contract of record in a frontend-only repo. Steps 4 and 8 reference it.\n- frontend-builder: accepts the published .factory/features/<name>/api.* as the\n  contract source for cross-repo features (reads it; never invents one).\n- spec-writer: if a published contract is present, the brief must conform to it.\n- docs (README, cross-repo.md, book Ch07): the chain now *consumes* the pulled\n  bundle; only pull/ship invocation stays manual (auto-pull/ship is future work).\n\nNo src change. Tests: 126 (unchanged).","tree":{"sha":"5015182ac81e460e1b2c267b784284e96cb37a88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/5015182ac81e460e1b2c267b784284e96cb37a88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGFlZjc5MDEzODYzYWQzNmUxNzY4NjlkZTRjNWU5NWVmMGVlOTAwOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/a0eaf51aa6f262cc6db971031f4c37f4dbd4a505","sha":"a0eaf51aa6f262cc6db971031f4c37f4dbd4a505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/a0eaf51aa6f262cc6db971031f4c37f4dbd4a505"}],"sha":"aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/aef79013863ad36e176869de4c5e95ef0ee90097"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/a0eaf51aa6f262cc6db971031f4c37f4dbd4a505/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:27:37Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:27:37Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"refactor(claude-code): guard script as a static asset, not a template string\n\nThe guard lived as an escaped template literal inside guardScript() — the\ndoubled-backslash fragility caused two real bugs (brace-glob miss, path\ntraversal) and the script could only be tested by generating-then-executing.\n\n- Extract it verbatim to assets/factory-guard.mjs (a real, editable .mjs).\n- claude-code.ts copies it (copyFileSync, GUARD_ASSET_PATH resolved via\n  import.meta.url so it works under tsx-on-src and dist); delete guardScript().\n- Add test/factory-guard.test.ts: unit-tests the asset directly (copy + a\n  hand-written factory-scope.json into a temp dir, run real payloads) — no\n  adapter needed. guard.test.ts stays as the adapter-wired integration layer.\n\nBehavior-preserving: generated factory-guard.mjs is byte-identical before/after.\nTests: 126 (+10). Book D9 + Recipe E updated to reflect the new shape.","tree":{"sha":"ae408e6e227774f3a8ed0c0df7b5049d2b2bf1b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/ae408e6e227774f3a8ed0c0df7b5049d2b2bf1b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/a0eaf51aa6f262cc6db971031f4c37f4dbd4a505","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.co