bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/882da51220fa8b7b71e498e4b457602943217ea9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:13:49Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-13T05:13:49Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"fix(profiles): correctness + recency fixes from content audit\n\nVerified against live docs (no hallucinations found; these are accuracy/recency):\n- go-echo: `go vet` is a linter, not a type/compile gate — typecheck is now\n  `go build ./...`.\n- quarkus-reactive: \"RESTEasy Reactive\" → \"Quarkus REST\" (renamed in 3.9);\n  soften the hard @WithTransaction-vs-@Transactional rule (newer Quarkus adds\n  reactive @Transactional and deprecates the Panache annotations); flag that the\n  spotbugs lint default needs the plugin in pom.xml (fails on a vanilla repo).\n- bun-hono: add `drizzle/**` to migrations (drizzle-kit''s default output dir).\n- react-rsbuild-microfrontend: `react-router-dom` → `react-router` (RR7 canonical\n  package) and require `singleton: true` for shared MF deps.\n- nextjs-app-router: the `src/app/**` frontend glob also matches `src/app/api/**`\n  (allow-lists can''t exclude) — documented the co-ownership honestly; add\n  `src/lib/*.ts` so shadcn''s src/lib/utils.ts isn''t orphaned.","tree":{"sha":"e493030a1aae3c0a84329e42f184f78deb22e6dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/e493030a1aae3c0a84329e42f184f78deb22e6dd"},"url":"https://ap