rcement to per-agent allow-lists on\nClaude Code: extend the Paths schema (migrations/infra/docs), enforce all 6\nediting agents via per-agent frontmatter PreToolUse hooks backed by one\nconfig-driven guard script + factory-scope.json. Opt-in (absent list =\nprompt-only), Claude-Code-only, backward compatible.","tree":{"sha":"90ed2a4ca69fde5b2fdaa3c0534aae8385a88b02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/90ed2a4ca69fde5b2fdaa3c0534aae8385a88b02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/635f55744d19a5b7e164b72d2f658a73e125ca86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/635f55744d19a5b7e164b72d2f658a73e125ca86","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDYzNWY1NTc0NGQxOWE1YjdlMTY0YjcyZDJmNjU4YTczZTEyNWNhODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/ea23be711e0d10949f6b1772fb058758e27e59c0","sha":"ea23be711e0d10949f6b1772fb058758e27e59c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/ea23be711e0d10949f6b1772fb058758e27e59c0"}],"sha":"635f55744d19a5b7e164b72d2f658a73e125ca86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/635f55744d19a5b7e164b72d2f658a73e125ca86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/ea23be711e0d10949f6b1772fb058758e27e59c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:58:28Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:58:28Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat(claude-code): real skill descriptions + enforced path guard\n\nFix skill descriptions:\n- extractDescription() returned the \"<name> orchestrator.\" fallback for every\n  skill because each prompt opens with a `# Title` line the old regex stripped\n  to empty. Now skips leading headings and takes the first prose paragraph, so\n  the generated SKILL.md `description:` carries the real \"Use when…\" trigger\n  text Claude relies on to auto-invoke the skill.\n\nAdd an enforced path guard (was prompt-only):\n- generate a PreToolUse hook that blocks edits/writes to the manifest''s\n  `forbidden:` globs at the tool level — .claude/hooks/factory-guard.mjs\n  (glob-matches tool_input.file_path, exits 2 to block) wired via a merged\n  .claude/settings.json that preserves the user''s other settings and hooks.\n- empty forbidden writes no guard and strips a previously-generated one;\n  re-install is idempotent; unparseable settings don''t throw.\n\nTests (94 total, +14): test/guard.test.ts covers generation, block/allow\nbehavior by executing the real script, settings-merge preservation,\nidempotency, and toggle-off cleanup; adapters.test.ts asserts real skill\ndescriptions. README documents the guard + merge semantics.","tree":{"sha":"142a86d9d9126fa16541bc7a068ae20853fffec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/142a86d9d9126fa16541bc7a068ae20853fffec1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/ea23be711e0d10949f6b1772fb058758e27e59c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us