ithub.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T15:28:21Z","email":"bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"chore: fix review quick-wins, add test suite, switch to pnpm lockfile\n\nQuick wins from the code review:\n- detect-stack: suggest react-vite (react+vite, and bare-react SPA default)\n  instead of mis-suggesting nextjs-app-router\n- kiro/codex: drop stale \"× 7\" agent-count comments (now × N)\n- feature.ts: remove unreachable dead branch in readLocalRepoIdentity\n- cli.ts: read --version from package.json instead of a hardcoded literal\n- claude-code: remove unused PLATFORM_HINT render var (no prompt references it)\n- README: \"Phase A scope\" → \"Current scope\" (Phase B is shipped)\n\nTests (new test/ dir, Vitest — 80 tests):\n- render, manifest, profile-defaults, detect-stack, contracts, workspace\n- adapters: run claude-code/kiro/codex against real prompts+profile in a\n  temp dir; assert file shape, {{CONTEXT_FILE}} substitution, executable\n  + bash -n valid orchestrators, stubs throw\n- feature: start→ship lifecycle, --from seeding, idempotent re-ship\n\nLockfile cleanup:\n- commit pnpm-lock.yaml (was gitignored), drop committed package-lock.json\n  so the pnpm-based project has one reproducible lockfile","tree":{"sha":"e2045cfcdf5218364f1af41ce30dce4a72ed050e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/e2045cfcdf5218364f1af41ce30dce4a72ed050e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/4b41bb67b6ef0cd269b3a873885874bd99ce3def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gist