/ai-software-factory/commits/dc93c22f04f92ef36e51cb7c2790b6c66f3c7d7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T13:00:25Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T13:00:25Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: fix stale \"Specialist agents (7)\" → (12) in the Layers table\n\nThe Architecture → Layers table in the README still labeled the\nagents row \"Specialist agents (7)\". The chain went to 12 several\ncommits ago; this row is the last spot where the old count survived.\n\nFull-repo sweep after this edit: no remaining \"(7)\" or \"seven\" count\nreferences tied to agents/specialists. The only \"7\" left in docs are\nunrelated (the \"7-day unpaid invoice\" example in walkthroughs).","tree":{"sha":"732d83d537daccaf689e3ce4adb5b7300c0d59a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/732d83d537daccaf689e3ce4adb5b7300c0d59a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/dc93c22f04f92ef36e51cb7c2790b6c66f3c7d7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/dc93c22f04f92ef36e51cb7c2790b6c66f3c7d7a","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGRjOTNjMjJmMDRmOTJlZjM2ZTUxY2I3YzI3OTBiNmM2NmYzYzdkN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b","sha":"47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b"}],"sha":"dc93c22f04f92ef36e51cb7c2790b6c66f3c7d7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/dc93c22f04f92ef36e51cb7c2790b6c66f3c7d7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:37:15Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:37:15Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"fix: stop writing `factory-repo` (absolute local path) into manifests\n\n`factory-repo` was being written by `factory init` as an absolute\npath to the developer''s local checkout (e.g.,\n/Users/$dev/Projects/research/.../ai-factory). When that manifest\ngets committed and another teammate clones the repo, the path is\nnonsense on their machine.\n\nWorse — the field isn''t even used by `factory install`. The global\n`factory` binary knows where its checkout lives (the install\nlocation of the linked package); the manifest never needs to repeat\nit.\n\nChanges:\n- src/commands/init.ts: passes `factoryRoot: undefined` to\n  composeManifest so the key is omitted from generated .factory.yaml.\n  ComposeArgs.factoryRoot is now optional in the type.\n- examples/manifest-backend.yaml + manifest-frontend.yaml: remove the\n  factory-repo line, add a comment explaining the omission so people\n  copying the example don''t paste it back in.\n- README usage example: same comment in the manifest snippet.\n\nExisting manifests with a stale `factory-repo:` line keep working —\nthe field has always been parsed-and-ignored by the install logic.\nCleanup is opt-in: just delete the line from the .factory.yaml.","tree":{"sha":"ceb503be04016285b09ea5efc2a2ae1f794c8ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/ceb503be04016285b09ea5efc2a2ae1f794c8ced"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDQ3YjMzMTNlNzJkNDhmMzA5ZTgyMTVlOTNjOTg5MmRjMTIyMGIyN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a","sha":"d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a"}],"sha":"47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/47b3313e72d48f309e8215e93c9892dc1220b27b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:31:08Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:31:08Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: add \"Keeping things in sync (updating)\" section to README\n\nPreviously the README only mentioned `factory sync` as a one-liner in\nthe commands-at-a-glance table; there was no coherent answer to\n\"how do I update an already-installed repo when the central factory\nchanges.\"\n\nNew section covers:\n\n- Three layers that can drift (central checkout, global binary,\n  per-repo generated files).\n- Single-repo update: `git pull` in ai-factory, then `factory install`\n  in the project, then commit the regenerated files.\n- Multi-repo update: `factory sync` with optional --dry-run.\n- Preserved-vs-overwritten table — including the explicit note that\n  `.codex/runs/**` (run history) is never touched.\n- Hard rule: never hand-edit generated files; edit the manifest /\n  profile / central prompts instead.\n- \"Where to edit when X\" matrix covering manifest, profile, agent\n  prompt, skill orchestrator, and platform adapter paths.\n- TL;DR three-line refresh.\n\nInserted between Usage and Status so the flow reads: install →\nupdate → see what''s shipped.","tree":{"sha":"cc9909361dbd24d1801c3aad4bc166f8fadc46ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/cc9909361dbd24d1801c3aad4bc166f8fadc46ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGQwMzA0YWMyNDVmYzY4YmM0ZGYwN2ZkNzA5NDlkNWU3NzJjMTE3N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae","sha":"f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae"}],"sha":"d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/d0304ac245fc68bc4df07fd70949d5e772c1177a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:25:44Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:25:44Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: ship `bin/factory.mjs` global CLI shim\n\nAdds the executable referenced by package.json''s `bin` field. It''s a\ntsx-spawn shim: locates the CLI source (../src/cli.ts) and tsx\n(../node_modules/.bin/tsx) relative to its own path, spawns tsx\nagainst the source, and forwards args + stdio.\n\nNow `pnpm link --global` (or `npm link`) makes `factory` available\non PATH globally — no more `npx tsx /long/path/to/cli.ts`.\n\nTested: `./bin/factory.mjs --version` → 0.1.0; after\n`pnpm link --global`, `factory --version` from /tmp also works.\n\nREADME updates:\n- \"Install\" section adds the `pnpm link --global` step with the npm\n  equivalent inline.\n- \"Commands at a glance\" callout updated to mention factory works\n  globally after linking.\n- \"Build-on-demand\" entry for the global binary marked shipped.\n- All `npx tsx /path/to/cli.ts` invocations now show `factory` as\n  the primary form, with the npx-tsx form as the fallback.","tree":{"sha":"18544ac5bd86fc2926abb8a99653a1657f22c857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/18544ac5bd86fc2926abb8a99653a1657f22c857"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGY5ZGY0OGFhMDE4NGRkNDQ4MzdiNjkzZGIwOGI1Njg3NWJmOTkxYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/1b52a62f82075393f58f3c0d249190158d17422c","sha":"1b52a62f82075393f58f3c0d249190158d17422c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/1b52a62f82075393f58f3c0d249190158d17422c"}],"sha":"f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/f9df48aa0184dd44837b693db08b56875bf991ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/1b52a62f82075393f58f3c0d249190158d17422c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:21:56Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:21:56Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: `factory feature start --from <file>` for PM-authored stories\n\nAdds a --from flag to `feature start` so engineers can import a\nstory authored elsewhere (Claude.ai chat, ChatGPT, Notion, Linear,\nanything that exports markdown) instead of editing the empty\ntemplate.\n\nWorkflow:\n1. PM writes the story in their tool — outputs markdown.\n2. Engineer downloads it and runs:\n     factory feature start <name> --from ~/Downloads/pm-story.md\n3. The file''s content lands as features/<name>/story.md in the\n   contracts repo. status.yaml created same as the engineer-authored\n   path.\n\nBehavior:\n- Reads the --from file (resolved relative to cwd).\n- Soft validation: warns if `## User Story` or\n  `## Acceptance Criteria` sections are missing, but proceeds\n  (spec-writer will surface real issues later).\n- Errors cleanly if --from path doesn''t exist (no half-created\n  feature dir on disk).\n- Tweaked \"Next steps\" wording to say \"review\" instead of \"edit\"\n  when the story came from --from.\n\nDocs:\n- cross-repo.md Step 1 split into 1a (engineer-authored) and 1b\n  (PM-authored via --from), plus an explicit story-quality contract\n  the chain assumes.\n- README commands-at-a-glance table mentions --from on feature start.\n\nSmoke test: three paths verified — well-formed import, malformed\nimport (warns), missing file (errors cleanly). Typecheck clean.","tree":{"sha":"6b748505831e18d63df55c19b5b8a33c65d96e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/6b748505831e18d63df55c19b5b8a33c65d96e79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/1b52a62f82075393f58f3c0d249190158d17422c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c