"2026-05-31T10:34:30Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: list react-rsbuild-microfrontend in the shipped-profiles inventory\n\nThe \"Stack profiles\" line under Phase A status was 6 entries long; it''s\nnow 7 to reflect the new react-rsbuild-microfrontend profile (added\nfor the atlas-monorepo field-test install).","tree":{"sha":"96d3e1643108c52232bd9843d98c097c5a63378f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/96d3e1643108c52232bd9843d98c097c5a63378f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/dd16c3c5f8b82f248f7769af05748f321e71d0bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/dd16c3c5f8b82f248f7769af05748f321e71d0bc","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGRkMTZjM2M1ZjhiODJmMjQ4Zjc3NjlhZjA1NzQ4ZjMyMWU3MWQwYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/6ec1a5852c9ee5007a295fe81b36e679f2673350","sha":"6ec1a5852c9ee5007a295fe81b36e679f2673350","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/6ec1a5852c9ee5007a295fe81b36e679f2673350"}],"sha":"dd16c3c5f8b82f248f7769af05748f321e71d0bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/dd16c3c5f8b82f248f7769af05748f321e71d0bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/6ec1a5852c9ee5007a295fe81b36e679f2673350/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T10:16:01Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T10:16:01Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: add react-rsbuild-microfrontend profile\n\nNew profile for React 19 + rsbuild + Module Federation Enhanced\nmonorepos (pnpm workspaces + Turborepo). Frontend-only.\n\nStack covered:\n- React 19, React Router 7, TanStack Query, Zustand\n- react-hook-form + Zod for forms\n- Tailwind 4 + shadcn/ui\n- rsbuild + Rspack bundler\n- Module Federation Enhanced for runtime composition\n- Vitest + Testing Library for tests\n- Biome (NOT ESLint/Prettier)\n- lefthook for git hooks\n\nArchitecture rules emphasize the micro-frontend contract: workspace\nimports via the scope prefix, shared deps versioned consistently for\nModule Federation, API calls via shared api-client, auth via shared\nauth-sdk, cross-app communication via event bus / shared packages\n(never direct cross-app imports).\n\nDefault paths target apps/**/src/** and packages/*/src/**, with\nnode_modules / .turbo / dist forbidden.\n\nDetection: util/detect-stack.ts now matches @module-federation/enhanced\n(or @module-federation/rsbuild-plugin) + @rsbuild/core in package.json\nand suggests this profile. Probed before the generic React fallback.","tree":{"sha":"0543f821eec62387819ff573181e9355bfd87502","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/0543f821eec62387819ff573181e9355bfd87502"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/6ec1a5852c9ee5007a295fe81b36e679f2673350","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}",