"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T01:47:20Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: scrub stale \"7-agent\" references missed in the 12-agent rollout\n\nThree spots still said \"7-agent\" after the chain expansion:\n\n- package.json `description` field — affects npm publish metadata\n- src/cli.ts top-level program `.description()` — shown in `factory --help`\n- prompts/skills/feature-factory.md intro line — propagates into every\n  generated SKILL.md / FACTORY.md across all three platform adapters\n\nAll three updated to \"12-agent\". Re-audit grep shows no remaining\n\"7-agent\" / \"seven agent\" references in the repo (excluding\nnode_modules and .git).","tree":{"sha":"3b021adf5652e8f799f97838dee584d3ea3eab0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/3b021adf5652e8f799f97838dee584d3ea3eab0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/8a187becd68d7ec95ebc9d39295ef6a7ef37bc71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/8a187becd68d7ec95ebc9d39295ef6a7ef37bc71","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDhhMTg3YmVjZDY4ZDdlYzk1ZWJjOWQzOTI5NWVmNmE3ZWYzN2JjNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572","sha":"c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572"}],"sha":"8a187becd68d7ec95ebc9d39295ef6a7ef37bc71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/8a187becd68d7ec95ebc9d39295ef6a7ef37bc71"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T16:55:30Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T16:55:30Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: extend chain to 12 agents — migration, security, perf, devops, docs\n\nAdds five specialist agents to the Tier 3 chain. Each prompt is\nplatform-neutral; adapters route them to the right files. All three\nworking adapters (Claude Code, Kiro, Codex) generate the new agents\nand orchestrator descriptions; docs are aligned end-to-end.\n\nNew agents:\n\n- migration-author — writes DB migrations safely (backfill-before-NOT-NULL,\n  online indexes, drop-column dance, rename-as-rewrite). Scoped to\n  migrations paths only. Returns \"Not applicable\" if the brief has no\n  schema changes.\n\n- security-reviewer — read-only OWASP-flavored audit. 10-section\n  checklist: auth/authz, input validation, injection, XSS, secrets,\n  CSRF, SSRF, rate limiting, dependencies, logging. Severity-graded\n  findings with file:line.\n\n- performance-reviewer — read-only perf audit. 7-section checklist:\n  database (N+1, missing indexes), loops/complexity, async/concurrency,\n  memory, external calls, caching, frontend re-render hygiene.\n  Severity-graded findings with file:line.\n\n- devops-builder — implements CI/CD + IaC changes (GitHub Actions,\n  Terraform, Helm, Docker, Kustomize). Scoped to infra paths. Runs\n  yamllint / tf validate / helm lint / hadolint / actionlint where\n  available. Returns \"Not applicable\" if no infra files in brief.\n\n- doc-writer — writes CHANGELOG entries, README updates, migration\n  guides for breaking changes. Read-only on src/tests/infra; writes\n  only to docs paths. Produces suggested PR description bullets.\n\nValidator scope shrinks: section 3 (Safety) now defers security and\nperformance specifics to the dedicated reviewers, keeping only\nproject-rule compliance (error handling, server-generated IDs, tenant\nscoping double-check). No checklist duplication.\n\nTier 3 chain goes from 7 → 12 agents in this order:\n  researcher → story-writer → ⏸1 → spec-writer → ⏸2 →\n    migration-author (skip if no schema) →\n    backend-builder → frontend-builder (skip if backend-only) →\n    devops-builder (skip if no infra) →\n    test-verifier (fix loop, max 3) →\n    security-reviewer → performance-reviewer → validator →\n    (fix loop across all three reviewers on Critical, max 3) →\n    doc-writer →\n  ⏸3 PR\n\nPer platform:\n- Claude Code: TOOLS_BY_AGENT + DESCRIPTIONS_BY_AGENT updated for the\n  5 new agents (read-only for reviewers; scoped write for builders).\n- Kiro: loop-driven adapter picks up new prompts automatically;\n  FACTORY.md \"How to use\" text updated to list all 12 agents in the\n  new order.\n- Codex: feature-factory.sh expanded to invoke all 12 agents in order\n  with outputs saved as 01-researcher.md through 12-docs.md.\n  FACTORY.md text updated.\n\nDocs aligned:\n- README: intro changed to \"12-agent\"; Mermaid sequence diagram in\n  \"Tier 3 flow\" extended with migration-author, devops-builder,\n  security-reviewer, performance-reviewer, doc-writer; counts updated\n  in Status section and Phase A inventory.\n- docs/walkthrough.md: \"Steps 4–7\" renamed \"Steps 4–12\" and rewritten\n  to describe all 9 automatic steps; \"7-agent invocations\" warning\n  updated to \"up to 12\".\n- docs/cross-repo.md: both backend-only and frontend-only chain\n  diagrams updated to show the new agents in their per-layer modes.\n\nSmoke test: install with all 3 platforms enabled generates 50 files;\nall 12 agents reach each platform; bash syntax on the new 12-step\nfeature-factory.sh verified; typecheck clean; no stale 7-agent\nreferences remain in docs.","tree":{"sha":"cd8329a84690161af4b8514d459c939e4d1d9b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/cd8329a84690161af4b8514d459c939e4d1d9b54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGM2NzkwMzYzZGQ5YzExMjcxOGE3YWY3NDg4OWMzODRhNWFjYjc1NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0","sha":"40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0"}],"sha":"c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/c6790363dd9c112718a7af74889c384a5acb7572"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:38:09Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:38:09Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: add Quarkus Reactive profile (Java)\n\nNew profile at profiles/quarkus-reactive.md:\n- Stack: Java 21, Quarkus 3.x, Mutiny (Uni/Multi), RESTEasy Reactive,\n  Hibernate Reactive + Panache, Postgres via reactive Vert.x driver,\n  Flyway, SmallRye Reactive Messaging (or Quartz for scheduled),\n  Maven or Gradle, JUnit 5 + RestAssured.\n- Architecture rules emphasize the reactive contract: endpoints must\n  return Uni/Multi; @WithTransaction over Jakarta @Transactional;\n  Hibernate Reactive Mutiny.SessionFactory over blocking\n  EntityManager; DTOs at the API boundary; tenantId in every query;\n  typed exceptions over raw RuntimeException; constructor injection.\n- Don''t-do covers the reactive-blocking traps: no .await().indefinitely()\n  in production, no blocking types from REST methods, no Jakarta\n  @Transactional, no Hibernate Session injection in reactive code.\n- Default commands target Maven (mvn compile/spotbugs:check/test/verify);\n  Gradle equivalents documented inline.\n\nDetection: util/detect-stack.ts now checks pom.xml, build.gradle, and\nbuild.gradle.kts for the literal \"quarkus\" string before other Java\nfallbacks. Detection chain: Go > Python > Quarkus > Bun/Hono >\nFastify > React-only > Node fallback.\n\nREADME: stack profiles list now includes Quarkus Reactive; Spring\nBoot relabeled \"blocking\" in the build-on-demand candidates so the\ndistinction is clear.\n\nSmoke test: install against a pom.xml-only repo with the profile\nrenders CLAUDE.md with Maven commands and Java source paths cleanly.","tree":{"sha":"5e88d13dd22acc22073589b5c32f080f901dfa66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/5e88d13dd22acc22073589b5c32f080f901dfa66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDQwYTUxNTg3MjA2MzRjYjk4NGIxZDEyYzM0YjRkZTJhYzVhNzA4YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36","sha":"0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36"}],"sha":"40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/40a5158720634cb984b1d12c34b4de2ac5a708c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:29:38Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:29:38Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: add Bun + Hono + Drizzle profile\n\nNew profile at profiles/bun-hono.md:\n- Stack: Bun 1.1+, Hono 4, Drizzle ORM + Postgres, BullMQ\n- Tests via bun:test; integration via Hono''s app.request() helper\n- Biome for lint (swap-able for ESLint)\n- Architecture rules emphasize Web-standard APIs, Zod validation via\n  @hono/zod-validator, tenantId in every Drizzle where clause.\n- Don''t-do covers Bun-specific traps: prefer Web standards over node:\n  modules, don''t mix bun.lockb with package-lock.json, etc.\n\nDetection: updated src/util/detect-stack.ts to suggest bun-hono when\n- \"hono\" is in dependencies, OR\n- bun.lockb / bunfig.toml present without a Fastify dep.\nBun signals win over generic Node fallback. Order in detection now:\nNext.js > Bun+Hono > Fastify > React-only > Node fallback.\n\nREADME: \"Stack profiles\" line now lists five (Next.js, Node+Fastify,\nGo+Echo, Python+FastAPI, Bun+Hono). Bun removed from the\nbuild-on-demand candidates list.\n\nSmoke test: install with a bun-hono manifest renders CLAUDE.md with\ncorrect commands (bunx tsc --noEmit, bun test, etc.) and path\nscoping.","tree":{"sha":"390b95aa8af1109586e8a4b56a798ba0272804f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/390b95aa8af1109586e8a4b56a798ba0272804f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDBkYmM2OGU3ZjVlNzQ5MTcwNWQyNTYzMGZjYmU1YzdjZjE5OWRmMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e","sha":"2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e"}],"sha":"0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/0dbc68e7f5e7491705d25630fcbe5c7cf199df36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:23:07Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:23:07Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: restructure Status section — Phase A + Phase B both shipped\n\nReplaces the inconsistent \"Status — Phase A\" / \"Roadmap (Phase B)\"\nsplit (which marked completed Phase B items as ✅ in one section and\nstill listed them as planned in the next) with a clean three-bucket\nstructure:\n\n  Phase A — foundation (shipped)\n    Manifest, render engine, prompts, 4 stack profiles, Claude Code\n    adapter, install command.\n\n  Phase B — multi-platform + multi-repo (shipped)\n    Kiro adapter, Codex CLI adapter, init wizard, sync command,\n    cross-repo contract bridge (5 feature subcommands), polyrepo +\n    single-repo walkthrough docs.\n\n  Build-on-demand (not blockers)\n    Cursor / Windsurf adapters, 9 additional stack profiles,\n    chain ↔ contract-bridge auto-integration, contract-format\n    validation, status locking, global factory binary.\n\nEach build-on-demand item is documented with what it would add and\nwhy it was descoped (use-case-driven, not gating). No work was lost\n— the items are still trackable; they''re just not Phase B blockers.","tree":{"sha":"46961e940d85bdb1d57287ac4f3002a509b40676","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/46961e940d85bdb1d57287ac4f3002a509b40676"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDJiZmRiNTkyYWFiMjg3ZDMyZjU2ZDRmMTgxZDY1Y2ZlMjU0YTlkMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4","sha":"e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4"}],"sha":"2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/2bfdb592aab287d32f56d4f181d65cfe254a9d0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:17:53Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:17:53Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: document Phase B (init, sync, contract bridge) + new cross-repo walkthrough\n\nREADME:\n- New \"Commands at a glance\" section listing every CLI command (init,\n  install, sync, feature start/pull/ship/list/status) with a one-line\n  description.\n- Usage section now points at both docs/walkthrough.md (single repo)\n  and docs/cross-repo.md (multi-repo).\n- Example manifest YAML now shows kiro and codex as active (was\n  marking them as stubs).\n- Replaces the \"Cross-repo coordination (planned)\" section with real\n  docs: the workflow, the on-disk shape, and a pointer to the full\n  cross-repo walkthrough.\n\nNew docs/cross-repo.md (271 lines):\n- Worked example of the same \"invoice-reminders\" feature, but split\n  across two repos (billing-api + billing-web) via the contracts repo.\n- Step-by-step commands: feature start → edit story → pull in backend\n  → run chain → ship with contract → pull in frontend → run chain →\n  ship → verify.\n- \"What this gives you\" section: one story / typed handoff / audit\n  trail / focused chain per repo.\n- Common mistakes table mapping symptoms to root causes.\n- When NOT to use the bridge (single repo, spike, single-repo features).\n- Phase A limitations called out explicitly (no auto-pull, no\n  auto-ship, no contract-format validation, no locking).\n\nwalkthrough.md:\n- Adds a one-paragraph pointer at the top directing polyrepo readers\n  to cross-repo.md, and clarifies that walkthrough.md is single-repo\n  focused.","tree":{"sha":"922f6215bebac93643b3e67fbda2d2c2f0af3d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/922f6215bebac93643b3e67fbda2d2c2f0af3d08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGUyZGIwMWNmMDRmNjQ5MWI0NDQ1YWM2OTBhNjNmNWYzOWM5NDdhZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2","sha":"cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2"}],"sha":"e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/e2db01cf04f6491b4445ac690a63f5f39c947af4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:13:49Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:13:49Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: cross-repo contract bridge (factory feature ...)\n\nAdds the contract-bridge MVP that lets one feature span multiple\nrepos with a shared user story and a backend-to-frontend API\ncontract handoff.\n\nCLI surface (nested under `factory feature`):\n\n  start <name>         Scaffold features/<name>/ with story.md skeleton\n                       + empty status.yaml in the contracts repo.\n  pull <name>          Copy story + api.* artifacts from the contracts\n                       repo into local .factory/features/<name>/.\n  ship <name>          Mark this repo as having shipped the feature;\n       --contract <p>  optionally copy a local contract artifact (e.g.\n       --commit <sha>  docs/api/<feature>.openapi.yaml) into the\n                       contracts repo as api.<ext>. Auto-detects repo\n                       name + layer from local .factory.yaml.\n  list                 List features in the contracts repo with shipped\n                       counts.\n  status <name>        Show which repos have shipped a feature, when,\n                       and at what commit.\n\nOn-disk shape in the contracts repo:\n\n  features/<name>/\n    story.md           # single source of truth, authored once\n    api.<ext>          # backend writes; frontend reads\n    status.yaml        # append-only ship log\n\nThe contracts repo path comes from `contracts-repo` in the local\nmanifest, or --contracts-repo override. Resolved relative to the\nmanifest''s directory.\n\nPhase A scope: CLI only. The chain doesn''t yet auto-pull on start or\nauto-ship on completion — the user invokes those commands manually\nbetween chain runs. Integration with the orchestrator skills can come\nlater.\n\nSmoke test: full lifecycle (start → list → pull → ship --contract\n--commit → status → re-pull picks up the contract) works end-to-end\nacross two manifests pointing at a shared contracts dir.","tree":{"sha":"eab9ed10f50e0aa7c672d91e825e2f3bca801052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/eab9ed10f50e0aa7c672d91e825e2f3bca801052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGNiZWZjNWJlYWRkMWJlYTY4ZWJiY2I1NmMwMzhkMjEyZGJhMWIyZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722","sha":"baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722"}],"sha":"cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/cbefc5beadd1bea68ebbcb56c038d212dba1b2f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:09:58Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:09:58Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: implement `factory sync` for workspace-wide refresh\n\nReplaces the placeholder. `factory sync` reads a workspace file\nlisting repo paths and runs `install` on each, so a central change\nto a prompt or profile can be propagated across many repos with\none command.\n\nWorkspace file format (intentionally simple):\n\n  repos:\n    - ../billing-api\n    - ../billing-web\n    - /absolute/path\n\nLookup order: --workspace flag → ./factory.workspace.yaml in cwd\n→ <factory-root>/workspace.yaml. Paths in the file resolve relative\nto the workspace file''s directory.\n\nBehavior:\n- Skips repos with no .factory.yaml (suggests running init first).\n- Reports missing directories as failures but continues the run.\n- Per-repo install failures are caught and reported in the summary.\n- Exits 1 if any repo failed (skipped repos do not fail the run).\n- --dry-run lists what would happen without writing.\n\nSmoke test: 4 repos with mixed states (2 valid, 1 no manifest,\n1 missing dir) → 2 synced, 1 skipped, 1 failed, exit 1. Files\ngenerated correctly for the 2 valid ones.\n\nAdds examples/workspace.yaml showing the format.","tree":{"sha":"4ee49ecb14516e6fbaf11cbab81a7d66f1508e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/4ee49ecb14516e6fbaf11cbab81a7d66f1508e9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGJhYTBjOTMzOTU5N2MxYWIxNmEwYTZkOGIxYjI2NzcxOTkxZTc3MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de","sha":"f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de"}],"sha":"baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/baa0c9339597c1ab16a0a6d8b1b26771991e7722"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:07:48Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:07:48Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: implement `factory init` interactive manifest wizard\n\nReplaces the placeholder with a real wizard. Flow:\n\n1. Refuses to overwrite existing .factory.yaml unless --force.\n2. Lightweight stack detection from package.json (next/fastify/react),\n   go.mod, pyproject.toml — suggests a profile and layer.\n3. Prompts: name, layer (select), profile (select from profiles/),\n   commands (defaults pulled from the chosen profile''s\n   \"Default commands\" YAML block), platforms (multi-select; stub\n   adapters disabled), optional contracts-repo.\n4. Previews the manifest, confirms, writes .factory.yaml.\n\nNew deps: @inquirer/prompts (input/select/checkbox/confirm).\nNew utilities:\n- util/profile-defaults.ts — parses Default commands / Default paths\n  YAML code blocks out of a profile body\n- util/detect-stack.ts — best-effort layer/profile detection","tree":{"sha":"3f1b4831ab3105a766dbe362fb78b315aaf11c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/3f1b4831ab3105a766dbe362fb78b315aaf11c4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKGYzYTVhODQ5OGY3NWIxZjU0MDE2MWZiYWM2NGRlMjc2NjgwM2MzZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583","sha":"6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583"}],"sha":"f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/f3a5a8498f75b1f540161fbac64de2766803c3de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:00:28Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:00:28Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: make walkthrough.md platform-aware (Kiro + Codex)\n\nThe walkthrough was written when only Claude Code worked. Updates:\n\n- New \"How to invoke the chain — by platform\" section near the top\n  with a table mapping Tier 3 / 2 / 1 entry points across Claude Code,\n  Kiro, and Codex CLI.\n- Per-platform behavior notes (orchestrator auto-driven in Claude Code,\n  semi-manual in Kiro via #-mentions, bash-script with read -p in\n  Codex CLI).\n- Step 0 example now shows the Claude Code form but lists Kiro and\n  Codex equivalents inline.\n- Cheat sheet split: entry points are platform-specific (point to the\n  table); checkpoint approvals and mid-chain responses are universal\n  (with a Codex CLI note about how `stop` translates to a read -p miss).\n- Next-steps suggestions for /quick-fix and /spike rewritten in\n  platform-neutral language.\n\nThe chain logic stays identical across platforms; only the invocation\nsurface changes.","tree":{"sha":"b280ee3be612e33164ef15d2c1dcee8a44101a7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/b280ee3be612e33164ef15d2c1dcee8a44101a7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDZjODg1NzE1MThhZTMyZTk2ZDk5ZTlkMmExYmQ2NjNhZmE1MDk1ODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/ee583f05c96d6efef9ff7606a06c8b0d26cd029f","sha":"ee583f05c96d6efef9ff7606a06c8b0d26cd029f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/ee583f05c96d6efef9ff7606a06c8b0d26cd029f"}],"sha":"6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/6c88571518ae32e96d99e9d2a1bd663afa509583"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/ee583f05c96d6efef9ff7606a06c8b0d26cd029f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:57:07Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:57:07Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: implement Codex CLI platform adapter\n\nWires up the Codex adapter so .factory.yaml platforms can include\n\"codex\" alongside claude-code and kiro. Generates:\n\n- AGENTS.md (repo root) — Codex auto-loads this as project context\n- .codex/agents/<name>.md × 7 — agent prompt bodies\n- .codex/orchestrator/feature-factory.sh — Tier 3 chain\n- .codex/orchestrator/quick-fix.sh — Tier 2 chain\n- .codex/orchestrator/spike.sh — Tier 1 research only\n- .codex/FACTORY.md — layout + usage docs\n\nDesign choice: orchestrator is bash, not markdown. Each agent is a\nseparate `codex exec` call; inter-agent context is concatenated into\nthe next prompt. Checkpoints use `read -p` to pause for approval.\nAll run outputs saved under .codex/runs/<timestamp>-<skill>/ for\naudit and replay.\n\nPhase A limitations (documented in FACTORY.md):\n- No automated fix loops yet — re-run after Critical validator findings\n- Path scoping is prompt-only (Codex doesn''t enforce edit paths)\n- Each agent invocation is a fresh session; no context sharing\n\nSmoke test: install generates 12 files; all 3 scripts have +x bit,\npass `bash -n` syntax check, and have the expected checkpoint pauses.\n{{CONTEXT_FILE}} substitution clean throughout. Typecheck passes.","tree":{"sha":"d41d2b3e37312e031c4fdc2a7e7c6e5782a4b68d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/d41d2b3e37312e031c4fdc2a7e7c6e5782a4b68d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/ee583f05c96d6efef9ff7606a06c8b0d26cd029f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin"