29T14:48:32Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:48:32Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"feat: implement Kiro platform adapter\n\nWires up the Kiro adapter so .factory.yaml platforms can include\n\"kiro\" alongside \"claude-code\". Generates:\n\n- .kiro/steering/project.md (inclusion: always) — manifest + profile\n- .kiro/steering/agent-<name>.md × 7 (inclusion: manual)\n- .kiro/steering/skill-<name>.md × 3 (inclusion: manual)\n- .kiro/FACTORY.md — companion doc explaining the layout and how the\n  chain runs semi-manually via #agent-* and #skill-* invocation\n\nRenderer change: RenderContext gains an optional `title` field used\nfor the generated context file''s H1. Claude Code keeps using the\nfilename (\"# CLAUDE.md\"); Kiro uses a friendlier \"Project context — <name>\".\n\nBug fix: {{CONTEXT_FILE}} substitution now uses a clean path\n(.kiro/steering/project.md) rather than a phrase containing\nbackticks, which would have produced malformed nested-backtick\nmarkdown when wrapped in the prompts'' inline-code spans.\n\nSmoke-tested end-to-end: install against an example manifest with\nboth platforms generates 23 files cleanly, typecheck passes.","tree":{"sha":"72c295d5b00e96a18a3da1c8f4d56f3fb99b1dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/72c295d5b00e96a18a3da1c8f4d56f3fb99b1dd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/a6e845a63673080855a4d849da1b2b3c60d8cff3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other