ono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"docs: add AI/human architecture section to README\n\nAdds an \"Architecture: AI and human collaboration\" section explaining\nthe three-layer model (orchestrator, specialist agents, reviewer), the\nTier 3 flow with checkpoint markers, and a \"who decides what\" table\nmapping each decision to its owner. Renames the prior \"Architecture\"\nsection (file/directory layout) to \"Repo layout\" to disambiguate.","tree":{"sha":"d1cb9de0d85e2645e7cf38807633a9a5a8e946da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/d1cb9de0d85e2645e7cf38807633a9a5a8e946da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/9a2f4b63b81955e5c99ea2e12296044a62aefa90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/9a2f4b63b81955e5c99ea2e12296044a62aefa90","node_id":"C_kwDOSqPMatoAKDlhMmY0YjYzYjgxOTU1ZTVjOTllYTJlMTIyOTYwNDRhNjJhZWZhOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commit/e1de0b6add9d2c6ae924ffe678f9bc617969d3fa","sha":"e1de0b6add9d2c6ae924ffe678f9bc617969d3fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/e1de0b6add9d2c6ae924ffe678f9bc617969d3fa"}],"sha":"9a2f4b63b81955e5c99ea2e12296044a62aefa90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/9a2f4b63b81955e5c99ea2e12296044a62aefa90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/commits/e1de0b6add9d2c6ae924ffe678f9bc617969d3fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T10:32:06Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T10:32:06Z","email":"234321795+bejono17@users.noreply.github.com","name":"bejono17"},"message":"Initial commit: ai-factory CLI for the 7-agent software factory pattern\n\nA TypeScript CLI + prompt library that generates platform-specific\nfiles (Claude Code, Kiro, Cursor, Codex CLI, Windsurf) for any number\nof polyrepos from a single source of truth. Built for the case of\nmany repos across many tech stacks targeting multiple AI platforms.\n\nStructure:\n- prompts/: platform-neutral agent + skill prompts using {{CONTEXT_FILE}}\n- profiles/: stack rule packs (Next.js, Node+Fastify, Go+Echo,\n  Python+FastAPI)\n- platforms/: per-platform adapters\n- src/: TypeScript CLI with `factory install` command\n\nPhase A scope (working):\n- Manifest parsing + validation (.factory.yaml)\n- Render engine (template substitution + context-file composition)\n- Claude Code adapter — fully working\n- Stub adapters for Kiro / Cursor / Codex / Windsurf with target\n  structure documented for follow-up","tree":{"sha":"5b3a681fa9578590985566f9ee71c46df081c9bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/trees/5b3a681fa9578590985566f9ee71c46df081c9bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dewantrie/ai-software-factory/git/commits/e1de0b6add9d2c6ae924ffe678f9bc617969d3fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234321795?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bejono17","id":234321795,"login":"bejono17","node_id":"U_kgDODfd3gw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bejono17/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.co