Reis22/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RafaelReis22","id":179995598,"login":"RafaelReis22","node_id":"U_kgDOCrqDzg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RafaelReis22","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/commits/5acbc9c9456018ba6ca557ea50ccb34e1c397beb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T21:58:50Z","email":"rafaelreisgramado@gmail.com","name":"RafaelReis22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T01:52:12Z","email":"rafael@pucrs.br","name":"RafaelReis22"},"message":"refactor: melhorias de acessibilidade e UX para usuários idosos\n\nSistema de acompanhamento de competências para pessoas idosas.\n\n- theme.ts: fonte 16px mínima, alvos de toque 48px, contraste WCAG AA,\n  paleta coesa com cores semânticas (success/warning/error)\n- Button: loading mostra spinner + texto juntos (sem layout shift), aria-busy\n- SearchBar: debounce 400ms, aria-label claro, botão de limpar maior\n- Navbar: sticky, simples, sem padrões SaaS complexos\n- Sidebar: estado ativo (aria-current), slot de footer, itemns com 48px altura\n- RecommendationCard: barra de score com cores semânticas (verde/amarelo/vermelho),\n  truncamento de texto, labels PT-BR, navegação por teclado completa\n- UserProfileCard: layout refinado, avatar maior\n- ResourceForm: todos os textos em PT-BR, campo de etiquetas (tags),\n  validação de URL com mensagem explicativa, helperText para cada campo\n- ResourceList: confirmação de exclusão com explicação clara, Snackbar de\n  feedback, empty state com ícone e CTA, error state com botão Tentar novamente,\n  labels de tipo em PT-BR, ARIA label na tabela, responsivo\n- types/resource.ts: RESOURCE_TYPE_LABELS e RESOURCE_TYPE_COLORS em PT-BR\n- README.md: documentação completa com contexto do produto, setup e estrutura","tree":{"sha":"8d241152c4ccbda6cfc26828d7fb4fd05ea2c033","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/git/trees/8d241152c4ccbda6cfc26828d7fb4fd05ea2c033"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/git/commits/5acbc9c9456018ba6ca557ea50ccb34e1c397beb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/commit/5acbc9c9456018ba6ca557ea50ccb34e1c397beb","node_id":"C_kwDOSqadidoAKDVhY2JjOWM5NDU2MDE4YmE2Y2E1NTdlYTUwY2NiMzRlMWMzOTdiZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/commit/8d0fe4db4755fa6d1e368286f65a543dd1fcadcd","sha":"8d0fe4db4755fa6d1e368286f65a543dd1fcadcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/commits/8d0fe4db4755fa6d1e368286f65a543dd1fcadcd"}],"sha":"5acbc9c9456018ba6ca557ea50ccb34e1c397beb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/commits/5acbc9c9456018ba6ca557ea50ccb34e1c397beb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MatheusMasera12/Grupo3-Recommendation/commits/8d0fe4db4755fa6d1e368286f65a543dd1fcadcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:20:37Z","email":"rafael@pucrs.br","name":"RafaelReis22"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T19:20:37Z","email":"rafael@pucrs.br","name":"RafaelReis22"},"message":"fix: corrige configuracao e dependencias do maven no pom.xml e atualiza testes","tree":{"sha":"d58d388a7457a06535d0b8268646c4c9e0d882b3","url":"https://api