PI key; explain why proxy redirects are refused\n\nReview feedback: ''readable by this extension only'' overstated the\nprotection — chrome.storage.local is isolated per extension but stored\nin the clear, so anyone with the browser profile can read the key. The\nSettings hint and REQUIREMENTS.md now say so. The background comment\nspells out why hop-by-hop redirect validation is impossible from a\nservice worker (opaque redirect, no Location) and that a redirecting\nasset URL fails in the Modules tab by design.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ac79a4a057af55428757f82b220d06904e93711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/trees/5ac79a4a057af55428757f82b220d06904e93711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/commits/49be778c6bbc45ff4e76ff9d83cb30e3c4dd240c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commi