ct: ''follow'' the browser contacts every hop\nbefore the final URL can be checked, so the post-fetch check only\ndetected an SSRF after the private request had happened. The proxy now\nuses redirect: ''manual'' and reports an opaque redirect as a policy\nfailure (browser fetch cannot expose Location for a manual follow).\n\nThe hostname check is syntactic and cannot see resolved addresses;\nthat is now stated as an accepted residual risk in urlPolicy.ts,\ndocs/REQUIREMENTS.md (NFR-S.8) and SECURITY.md, together with why the\nexposure is small (credential-less, redirect-free GET/HEAD whose body\nonly reaches the user''s own panel). Stale activeTab mentions in\nREQUIREMENTS.md and SECURITY.md are updated to the new manifest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"351c4f20fed78c343834abd8442e15a185766d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/trees/351c4f20fed78c343834abd8442e15a185766d3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/commits/029c801e57725a877f47e8db3f75ada8b2833dbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri