rk unencrypted. The API key field now says the key is stored\nunencrypted in chrome.storage.local, and the privacy section of\ndocs/REQUIREMENTS.md spells out the at-rest and in-transit handling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26448a4a0c8254663fa85f3a33e83fc3c907aeed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/trees/26448a4a0c8254663fa85f3a33e83fc3c907aeed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/commits/af84214384283f7aa461aa42d39ed5f12350f651","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commit/af84214384283f7aa461aa42d39ed5f12350f651","node_id":"C_kwDOSqmnetoAKGFmODQyMTQzODQyODNmN2FhNDYxYWE0MmQzOWVkNWYxMjM1MGY2NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commit/cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab","sha":"cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commits/cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab"}],"sha":"af84214384283f7aa461aa42d39ed5f12350f651","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commits/af84214384283f7aa461aa42d39ed5f12350f651"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commits/cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:30:35Z","email":"ingscarrero@icloud.com","name":"SergioC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:30:35Z","email":"ingscarrero@icloud.com","name":"SergioC"},"message":"fix(background): restrict the net.fetch / net.head proxy to public http(s) hosts\n\nThe service worker fetched any URL the panel derived from page content\nwith <all_urls> host permissions and no CORS, so a hostile page could\nuse it to probe loopback and LAN services. isAllowedProxyUrl() now\nrefuses non-http(s) schemes and hostnames that are localhost,\n*.localhost, loopback, link-local, RFC1918, CGNAT, fc00::/7, fe80::/10,\nmulticast/reserved, or IPv4-mapped forms of those. Two hosts are\nexempt: the user''s configured LLM baseUrl and the inspected page''s own\nhost (so local dev servers keep working; the page can already fetch its\nown origin). The final URL after redirects is checked as well.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e902de3c23359fdef96ce32e2cda9f1115ec7c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/trees/3e902de3c23359fdef96ce32e2cda9f1115ec7c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/commits/cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commit/cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab","node_id":"C_kwDOSqmnetoAKGNiNmIxZmFjNmE1MzM2YTU3MjU1ZWUwMWUyMDc1OWU0MmU5M2Q1YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commit/243ff60956ca0cfa61a977de2bd77571f09f3dd4","sha":"243ff60956ca0cfa61a977de2bd77571f09f3dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commits/243ff60956ca0cfa61a977de2bd77571f09f3dd4"}],"sha":"cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commits/cb6b1fac6a5336a57255ee01e20759e42e93d5ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commits/243ff60956ca0cfa61a977de2bd77571f09f3dd4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:30:35Z","email":"ingscarrero@icloud.com","name":"SergioC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T00:30:35Z","email":"ingscarrero@icloud.com","name":"SergioC"},"message":"fix(panel): render the inputs summary as JSX instead of dangerouslySetInnerHTML\n\ndescribeInputs() embeds page-controlled values (element tag, id, class\nnames, React component name) into backtick-delimited strings that the\nComponents tab turned into HTML by string replacement and injected with\ndangerouslySetInnerHTML. A page with id=''\"><img src=x onerror=...>''\ncould inject markup into the privileged DevTools panel.\n\nrenderInlineCode() splits on backticks and maps the segments to text\nnodes and <code> elements so React escapes everything. Vitest now also\npicks up .tsx tests; the new suite feeds a hostile id / class /\ncomponent name through describeInputs and asserts the rendered markup\ncontains only the escaped text and no <img>/<svg>/<script> element.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c89451f59a2589077ce2ba5b92bedb50767ef71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/trees/7c89451f59a2589077ce2ba5b92bedb50767ef71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ingscarrero/dom-lens/git/commits/243ff60956ca0cfa61a977de2bd77571f09f3dd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7908002?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero","id":7908002,"login":"ingscarrero","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDgwMDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ingscarrero","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ingscarrero/dom-lens/commit/243ff60956ca0cfa61a977de2bd77571f09f3dd4","node_id":"C_kwDOSqmnetoAKDI0M2ZmNjA5NTZjYTBjZmE2MWE5NzdkZTJiZDc3NTcx