~25s and its first session is always suspicious so IOCs are never zero\n- Force defense requires confirmation (dialog shared by top bar and command palette); collapsed top-bar buttons get accessible names\n- Button focus ring fixed (Tailwind v4 outline-none suppressed focus-visible:outline-2)\n- dashboard grids only use fixed full-height layout at lg and up, removing the mobile panel overlap\n- \"Demo data\" badge in the top bar; \"Pipeline live\" and \"Live\" labels renamed to say simulated\n- self-serve billing behind NEXT_PUBLIC_BILLING_ENABLED (paid plans show Contact sales until a real sensor ships); webhook still processes existing subscriptions\n- README, architecture page, How it works, pricing features, and stack logos describe the target design as planned rather than shipped\n- audit log header no longer claims 0 events while erroring; old SaaS plan marked superseded\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GmtMLUt2Boz9oge6q6r44s","tree":{"sha":"9a8d282ab28f9aaaa7fd97c24d5b840016d2c8cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEEPESH-845/Aetheris/git/trees/9a8d282ab28f9aaaa7fd97c24d5b840016d2c8cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEEPESH-845/Aetheris/git/commits/6fda0fe3e702ea0c45bafb59a737518bcec9dbca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172120926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DEEPESH-845/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DEEPESH-845/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DEEPESH-845/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DEEPESH-845/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DEEPESH-845","id":172120926,"login":"DEEPESH-845","node_id":"U_kgDOCkJbXg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DEEPESH-845/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DEEPESH-845/received_events","