42f7ef0c600ed418b0d4cfbbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:40:44Z","email":"deepeshkakkar.work@gmail.com","name":"DEEPESH-845"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T19:40:44Z","email":"deepeshkakkar.work@gmail.com","name":"DEEPESH-845"},"message":"fix(security): tenant scoping, working billing pipeline, hardened backend\n\n- proxy no longer gates Stripe webhooks and /api/health behind Clerk (they returned 404)\n- ensureTenant mirrors the Clerk user into Postgres and creates one org under an advisory lock; org auto-creation in the checkout route violated the User FK\n- simulation.get/updateStatus and org.removeMember scoped by orgId; owner and self-removal guards; audit.create removed, audit rows written server-side\n- mapPriceToPlan uses a reverse map of configured price ids instead of substring matching\n- webhook idempotency via StripeEvent table; subscription events scoped by customer; trial recorded; plan derived from status\n- duplicate tRPC checkout/portal removed; REST routes validate body, require admin, use Stripe idempotency keys\n- tRPC errorFormatter hides internals, maps P2002 to CONFLICT; structured error logging in all envs\n- env validated at boot (src/env.ts); health endpoint checks the database\n- backend: sockets registered only after auth, issuer/azp checks, limiter keyed by user with eviction, parallel broadcast, lifespan, pinned requirements, LangGraph shim removed\n- Next 16.3.5 for the critical advisory; images.unoptimized; drop X-XSS-Protection\n- Prisma migrations baseline, Vitest suite (14 tests), GitHub Actions CI\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GmtMLUt2Boz9oge6q6r44s","tree":{"sha":"7f4de38e0fe188c106c432970a5a510860470f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEEPESH-845/Aetheris/git/trees/7f4de38e0fe188c106c432970a5a510860470f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEEPESH-845/Aetheris/git/commits/96f27afb5efbfdd42f7ef0c600ed418b0d4cfbbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsig