ed name, 4 sites)\n- schemas.py: rename ambiguous ''l'' -> ''line'' in markdown-fence strip (E741)\n- server.py: hoist asynccontextmanager/httpx/concurrency/config imports to\n  the top (E402)\n- test_schema_gate.py: remove the obsolete pipeline-level duplicate of\n  test_schema_gate_revalidates_after_each_correction (F811). The two\n  same-named tests differed; the shadowed one asserted an exact attempt\n  count under LIVE quality scoring and flaps (CI/CCR on short mock JSON\n  forces an extra retry). Kept the isolated loop-level version, which now\n  actually runs.\n- slm_benchmark.py: noqa the necessary post-sys.path import (E402), drop an\n  unused local (F841)\n\nruff check . clean (12 -> 0); full suite 236 passed, 1 xfailed. No\nfunctional behavior change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"25575ffbe5d726f1d869c128d5fe010cf9500efb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/25575ffbe5d726f1d869c128d5fe010cf9500efb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/30a1f741873c3c9effaa36bcde3610890377b6ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/st