count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T19:47:45Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"test(governance): live end-to-end proof of Phase 4 shed across the language boundary\n\nAdds GOVERNANCE_FORCE_DEGRADED (test/staging hook, off by default) that forces\nthe guardrail-degraded path so the shed-503 is inducible on a running service,\nand PythonGovernanceAdapterLiveIT (opt-in via GOVERNANCE_LIVE_URL) which drives\nthe REAL Java adapter against the LIVE degraded Python service over REAL HTTP:\na HIGH-risk request returns a genuine 503 shed and the adapter surfaces it as a\ndefinitive response (never falls back to an ungoverned model). Verified live:\nHIGH-risk -> 503 shed, non-high-risk -> 200 blocked (selective). Python 236\npassed; toggle unit-tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10afd3656b9b3d3a8db4d0d88ffa32c71b33b754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/10afd3656b9b3d3a8db4d0d88ffa32c71b33b754"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/15371d90879f57da5ee0a276b3b079b74424e29f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users