60"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T19:14:18Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"style(backend): spotless import ordering on adapter test (fix Spotless gate)","tree":{"sha":"d1535a30e53cb3121c207f5a2a658562be5a1962","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/d1535a30e53cb3121c207f5a2a658562be5a1962"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/0fdf84ba00d2227196d4fba249838eb7e96845ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/0fdf84ba00d2227196d4fba249838eb7e96845ff","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDBmZGY4NGJhMDBkMjIyNzE5NmQ0ZmJhMjQ5ODM4ZWI3ZTk2ODQ1ZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/9630307e68ecf0a25f96079b782af46b0a89ea7d","sha":"9630307e68ecf0a25f96079b782af46b0a89ea7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/9630307e68ecf0a25f96079b782af46b0a89ea7d"}],"sha":"0fdf84ba00d2227196d4fba249838eb7e96845ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/0fdf84ba00d2227196d4fba249838eb7e96845ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/9630307e68ecf0a25f96079b782af46b0a89ea7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:29:18Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T18:29:18Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"fix(backend): honor Phase 4 shed at the Java boundary — never fall back to ungoverned cloud\n\nSecurity gap found reviewing Tier 3: the Python service sheds a HIGH-risk\nrequest during guardrail degradation with HTTP 503 {shed:true} (Phase 4,\nGOVERNANCE_SPEC §5). PythonGovernanceAdapter''s postForObject threw on the 5xx,\nwhich ResilientLlmGateway treats as an outage and — for PII-free prompts —\nanswers via an UNGOVERNED cloud model (Gemini/Kimi). So a request the governance\nservice deliberately refused could be served ungoverned, defeating the shed.\n\nFix: the adapter now catches HttpStatusCodeException, and when the body carries\nshed:true (or status \"unavailable\") returns a DEFINITIVE shed LlmResponse rather\nthan throwing — the gateway returns it as-is, no cloud fallback. Genuine\n(non-shed) 5xx still propagate to the fail-safe chain.\n\nTests:\n- PythonGovernanceAdapterTest: shed-503 -> definitive response (not thrown);\n  genuine 503 (no shed marker) -> propagates. (12/12)\n- ResilientLlmGatewayTest: adapter-sheds + CLEAN (PII-free) prompt -> gateway\n  returns shed and NEVER calls Gemini/Kimi/mock. (11/11)\n- GOVERNANCE_SPEC §5 documents the cross-language boundary contract.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"859b05b1e34256fbd74189c481d6999908dd955d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/859b05b1e34256fbd74189c481d6999908dd955d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/9630307e68ecf0a25f96079b782af46b0a89ea7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb786