"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/ad483531940264755992bb20ff7f6ed90435c828","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKGFkNDgzNTMxOTQwMjY0NzU1OTkyYmIyMGZmN2Y2ZWQ5MDQzNWM4Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16","sha":"0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16"}],"sha":"ad483531940264755992bb20ff7f6ed90435c828","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/ad483531940264755992bb20ff7f6ed90435c828"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T11:49:47Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T11:49:47Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"fix(governance): block semantic jailbreaks found by live red-team (Tier 1)\n\nA full red-team run against the live service (100 tests, real models)\nfound the input gate caught direct ''ignore previous instructions'' but\nMISSED 5 semantic jailbreak framings — the model received them and\nbegan complying:\n  JB-01 DAN, JB-02 developer-mode, JB-09 hypothetical-no-safety-rules,\n  JB-14 ''safety systems disabled → output UNSAFE'', INJ-14 roleplay-malware.\n\nAdd 5 anchored jailbreak signatures to prompt_injection_filter (DAN,\ndeveloper mode, AI+no-restrictions, safety-systems-disabled, ignore-\ninstructions-you-got-before). Verified at the guardrail level: all 5\nattacks now block, and all 10 clean_queries payloads still pass —\nincluding CQ-05''s legitimate ''you are a pricing agent'' framing that a\ncareless pattern would over-block.\n\nNote for review: input patterns are necessary but not sufficient — the\nrobust long-term fix is an OUTPUT-side harmful-content guardrail\n(catches compliance regardless of input framing). Documented in the\novernight report; not built tonight (needs design + your review).\n\n207 passed. Non-destructive; mac-machine only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b9630c082c0095d54fccd0f75322ed9931a27a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/5b9630c082c0095d54fccd0f75322ed9931a27a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDBhYWI2MWJkOWY5Zjg5YTEwNDhkMWQ0MzY5ZTUxZWUxZWU3OGRkMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/bca7cb51dc458f633c26db1ebccad5b18351ac62","sha":"bca7cb51dc458f633c26db1ebccad5b18351ac62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/bca7cb51dc458f633c26db1ebccad5b18351ac62"}],"sha":"0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/0aab61bd9f9f89a1048d1d4369e51ee1ee78dd16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/bca7cb51dc458f633c26db1ebccad5b18351ac62/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T20:33:41Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T20:33:41Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"refactor(governance): close Epic 5 / vLLM loose ends (PR #148 review Tier 2)\n\n- Unify intent taxonomy: schemas.ClassificationSchema.VALID_INTENTS now\n  matches the live classifier (was Swish business domains\n  {inventory,rider,order,…}; the ''classification'' RAIL schema would have\n  rejected every real classifier output). Add a sync test that fails CI\n  on future drift, and update test_schema_validator to the canonical set.\n- vllm_url 8000 → 8001 in both configs (8000 is the governance service''s\n  own port — was a guaranteed collision/404).\n- Document vllm_reasoner as STAGED/not-routed in routing_config,\n  vllm_reasoner.yaml, and decision_table (no rule targets it, no Metal\n  backend, needs a remote vLLM host) — resolves the dead-config ambiguity.\n- Extract the duplicated mock-fallback block into agents/_mock.py so the\n  goal-1 honesty gate + canned responses can''t drift between Ollama/vLLM.\n\n192 passed, 1 xfailed. Non-destructive; mac-machine only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree