.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/047cfbfd10a3ef7d04509cc9533a912a6cd22450/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:51:18Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:51:18Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"docs(governance): record verified model-store latency finding (HDD 110s → T7 SSD 7.5s)\n\nLive smoke test on real local models: normal request 4.8s (eval loop\nskipped per §3b), elevated PII request 2.8s (elevated=True,\nlocal_only=True, eval loop runs). Root cause of prior timeouts was the\nmodel store on the external HDD (110s cold load vs 45s agent timeout);\nmoved to the T7 SSD (7.5s). Documents that no code change substitutes\nfor SSD-backed models and the 16GB host holds classifier + one agent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c05fb56bf4e097e50d08eeba8fafd9d00e8d88a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/9c05fb56bf4e097e50d08eeba8fafd9d00e8d88a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/047cfbfd10a3ef7d04509cc9533a912a6cd22450","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/047cfbfd10a3ef7d04509cc9533a912a6cd22450","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDA0N2NmYmZkMTBhM2VmN2QwNDUwOWNjOTUzM2E5MTJhNmNkMjI0NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/34ce38d648253528fd89f537245ac70f6a1b1eb1","sha":"34ce38d648253528fd89f537245ac70f6a1b1eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/34ce38d648253528fd89f537245ac70f6a1b1eb1"}],"sha":"047cfbfd10a3ef7d04509cc9533a912a6cd22450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/047cfbfd10a3ef7d04509cc9533a912a6cd22450"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/34ce38d648253528fd89f537245ac70f6a1b1eb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:52:36Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-14T16:52:36Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"fix(governance): RAIL schema gate no longer leaks errors or skips re-validation\n\nTwo bugs from PR #148 review, both in the pipeline''s step 9b:\n\n1. Internal Pydantic validation errors were spliced directly into the\n   candidate_text that ships to the caller. For expected_format=\"json\"\n   this fired on EVERY request, since \"json\" is not a registered RAIL\n   schema name — validate_output() always returned \"Unknown schema\n   ''json''\", and that text got appended to every JSON-format response.\n\n2. The gate ran once, pre-loop. A response that passed schema\n   validation on attempt 0 but was then broken by a self-correction\n   retry shipped as status=\"success\" with no re-check.\n\nFix: schema_name is now a first-class parameter to\nrun_self_correction_loop(), re-validated on every attempt including\nthe fallback response; failures feed _build_error_summary() (so the\nmodel actually sees them in the retry prompt) and never touch the\nresponse text. is_rail_schema() guards every call site so the legacy\n\"json\" flag (a different, pre-existing metrics.py check) can''t be\nlooked up in the RAIL registry. Persistent failure after exhausting\nretries now surfaces as a warning + schema_validation.valid=false\ninstead of silent status=\"success\".\n\nAlso documents (vllm_agent.py) why VllmAgent intentionally has no\nper-model semaphore, unlike OllamaAgent — vLLM''s own continuous\nbatching would fight external serialization.\n\n9 new tests incl. quality-score-isolated coverage of multi-attempt\nre-validation and the retry-cap interaction with §3b. Full suite:\n191 passed, 1 xfailed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"745870166cf69ae5375cfbdf13a1d7fe694a1f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/745870166cf69ae5375cfbdf13a1d7fe694a1f03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/34ce38d648253528fd89f537245ac70f6a1b1eb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_