-14T08:41:38Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"fix(governance): apply honesty gate to VllmAgent mock fallback\n\nVllmAgent mocked failed inference unconditionally, while 152affb made the\nsame fallback opt-in for OllamaAgent (GOVERNANCE_ALLOW_MOCK_FALLBACK) so a\nfabricated response can never masquerade as a governed one in production.\nApply the identical gate to VllmAgent and add a test asserting failures\npropagate honestly when the opt-in is absent. Suite: 182 passed, 1 xfailed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e56aa241af851dee6a42cc9dc05336c45792b0e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/e56aa241af851dee6a42cc9dc05336c45792b0e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/9eabeff65a77adb5b0c0464c7993caeefb1d9baf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/9eabeff65a7