:"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/152affbbd498eb4cdaed7132da3618a023807071/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T09:14:30Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T09:14:30Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"fix(governance): make Ollama mock fallback opt-in — production fails honestly\n\nA fabricated ''governed'' response that no model produced masks outages\nand violates goal 1. The deterministic mock path now requires\nGOVERNANCE_ALLOW_MOCK_FALLBACK=1 (set in tests/CI conftest); otherwise\nthe agent error propagates and the pipeline returns an honest failed\nstatus via its existing fallback chain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5049d432e3d8ffe5bbac62dec6af0a37d96cb22f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/5049d432e3d8ffe5bbac62dec6af0a37d96cb22f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/152affbbd498eb4cdaed7132da3618a023807071","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/152affbbd498eb4cdaed7132da3618a023807071","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDE1MmFmZmJiZDQ5OGViNGNkYWVkNzEzMmRhMzYxOGEwMjM4MDcwNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0","sha":"7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0"}],"sha":"152affbbd498eb4cdaed7132da3618a023807071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/152affbbd498eb4cdaed7132da3618a023807071"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:59:46Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:59:46Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"feat(governance): risk-triggered enforcement + per-model concurrency gates (Phase 3b)\n\nOperationalizes the two product goals (GOVERNANCE_SPEC §0/§3b):\n\nGoal 1 — security never weakened: every critical/high rule (injection,\nPII/secrets, hate speech, catastrophic code) runs on every request;\nunknown severity fails toward enforcement. Elevated requests (PII hit,\nsensitive_query/system_admin intent, or cloud route) get the full\ndetector suite, the eval loop, and 3 self-correction retries.\n\nGoal 2 — no default latency spend: normal requests skip advisory\nmedium/low detectors and the eval loop entirely (model-call-priced\ncompute), capped at 1 correction retry when the caller requests a\nvalidated format. New risk_assessed / eval_loop_skipped audit events;\n/govern responses expose risk.elevated + risk.signals.\n\nConcurrency (single 16GB Ollama host): per-model BoundedSemaphore(1) —\nsame-model generations queue, different models overlap — wired into\nOllamaAgent and the classifier; classifier pinned with keep_alive=-1\nso the floor model never reloads mid-traffic.\n\n19 new tests incl. the goal-1 invariant (critical/high rules can never\nbe dropped); full suite 144 passed, 1 xfailed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7eb263635ad2c880b71fe397deb70de5f331970","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/a7eb263635ad2c880b71fe397deb70de5f331970"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDc5OTQ1NjEyMzBmM2Y3NjU4YzFlMGE5MTU4NDczNTNmODVlN2RhYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407","sha":"6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407"}],"sha":"7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/7994561230f3f7658c1e0a915847353f85e7dab0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:46:11Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T08:46:11Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"feat(governance): PII test matrix + latency histogram, SLO alert & panel (Phases 2-3)\n\nPhase 2 (goal 1, CI-only): parametrized PII matrix with a sync test —\ndeleting any pattern from pii_patterns.py, or adding one without\ncases, fails CI. Positives + per-pattern near-misses + clean texts +\nredaction idempotence; obfuscated-email gap pinned as strict xfail.\n\nPhase 3 (goal 2, observability-only): governance_pipeline_latency_seconds\nis now a real Prometheus histogram (bucket edge at the 2.5s SLO),\nfailures record latency too, GovernanceLatencyHigh alert (p95 > 2.5s\nfor 5m) added to alert.rules, and a p50/p95-vs-SLO panel added to the\nMission Control dashboard''s AI Governance row.\n\nFull suite: 125 passed, 1 xfailed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"188fde5307c04b0a5a0859c080136c8bd71b2bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/188fde5307c04b0a5a0859c080136c8bd71b2bbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDY5NjZkZTExMDdlMjliMmQ4ZWQ0NjgwZjc5NGYyNzE0ZmNkZjQ0MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af","sha":"544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af"}],"sha":"6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/6966de1107e29b2d8ed4680f794f2714fcdf4407"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T07:26:05Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T07:26:05Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"fix(governance): fail-closed input guardrail gate (GOVERNANCE_SPEC Phase 1)\n\nSecurity goal 1: an engine error must never grant weaker safety\ntreatment.\n\n- check_nemo_guardrails() blocks on engine exception (was: allowed\n  fail-open) and writes a guardrail_engine_error audit event; audit\n  failure cannot reopen the gate\n- Loader raises GuardrailConfigError on missing/corrupt config.yml or\n  flows.co, on configs that parse to zero intents/flows (a silently\n  disabled gate), and on active flows with no definition\n- Server lifespan validates the engine at startup — unloadable\n  guardrails refuse to serve; /health returns 503 DEGRADED (healthy\n  body stays exactly {\"status\":\"UP\"} per the Java adapter contract)\n- 8 new engine/wrapper tests + degraded-health contract test; full\n  suite 87 passed; live config verified to pass the strict loader\n\nLatency goal 2 unaffected: the gate is a pure pattern matcher, so\nfailing closed adds zero compute to the request path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c102b2889991af4e6d06a470a5ef82d3bf0659b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/trees/c102b2889991af4e6d06a470a5ef82d3bf0659b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/git/commits/544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af","node_id":"C_kwDOSqvZxdoAKDU0NGY2YTI3ZTViMzViYmRlYjIyZDIwODRhNTg2NDYzZjBlZDM2YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commit/41645fa81bd3f695ee85a693819badb7e59fc317","sha":"41645fa81bd3f695ee85a693819badb7e59fc317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/41645fa81bd3f695ee85a693819badb7e59fc317"}],"sha":"544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/544f6a27e5b35bbdeb22d2084a586463f0ed36af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68843787?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Muneeb7860","id":68843787,"login":"Muneeb7860","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4ODQzNzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Muneeb7860","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Muneeb7860/Swish_App/commits/41645fa81bd3f695ee85a693819badb7e59fc317/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T06:14:34Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T06:14:34Z","email":"skmuneeb@gmail.com","name":"Muneeb7860"},"message":"docs(governance): encode owner goals — security never compromised, heavy compute only on risk signals\n\nAdds §0 product goals with the resolution rule (every layer is either\nalways-on-and-free or risk-triggered), §3b conditional enforcement\npolicy (risk signals, light/full detector sets, retry caps, eval loop\ngating) and single-host concurrency guards (per-model semaphores,\nclassifier keep_alive), plus Phase 3b implementing them.\n\nCo